(1849362, 254922, 16648, '<td valign="top">Alan? Is that you? Night shots are always more dramatic than day shots. But then i only get to town every blue moon. I can try this on Nov 16 as i''ll be here after dark. My luck there will be a power outage! <br/> <br/>Anywho, very nice. The Gulf bulding top is a tad bright and the fountain could use more light. If only we could use advanced editing rules!</td>', 'Alan? Is that you? Night shots are always more dramatic than day shots. But then i only get to town every blue moon. I can try this on Nov 16 as i''ll be here after dark. My luck there will be a power outage!  Anywho, very nice. The Gulf bulding top is a tad bright and the fountain could use more light. If only we could use advanced editing rules!', '2005-11-09 01:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1849365, 255041, 20075, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Terrific DOF!  Great clouds, too.  I wish the building in the far distance were taller, so it would show up more prominently in the picture, but that''s not exactly something you''d have control over. :)  All in all, a really well done shot.</td>', 'Wow!  Terrific DOF!  Great clouds, too.  I wish the building in the far distance were taller, so it would show up more prominently in the picture, but that''s not exactly something you''d have control over. :)  All in all, a really well done shot.', '2005-11-09 01:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
