(1850552, 255568, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ah, Kennebunkport (sp?)!  I visited this spot several years ago.  The guy beside me claimed to see the elder Bush riding his bike as he peered through binoculars.  I also have fond memories of eating at a nearby lobster hut called "Noonans."  Anyway, thanks for bringing back some memories -- nice shot!</td>', 'Ah, Kennebunkport (sp?)!  I visited this spot several years ago.  The guy beside me claimed to see the elder Bush riding his bike as he peered through binoculars.  I also have fond memories of eating at a nearby lobster hut called "Noonans."  Anyway, thanks for bringing back some memories -- nice shot!', '2005-11-09 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
