(1850609, 254846, 33068, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. The tree is very cool.  If I were you, I''d go take more pictures of it and try several differnt POV''s.  If you haven''t noticed, I have a fascination with trees and this one has a very nice figure. ;)</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. The tree is very cool.  If I were you, I''d go take more pictures of it and try several differnt POV''s.  If you haven''t noticed, I have a fascination with trees and this one has a very nice figure. ;)', '2005-11-09 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850611, 254859, 33068, '<td valign="top">Horizon seems a little tilted.</td>', 'Horizon seems a little tilted.', '2005-11-09 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850617, 255472, 33068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I love how the lines leads you to the beautiful sunset.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I love how the lines leads you to the beautiful sunset.', '2005-11-09 11:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850618, 255496, 36983, '<td valign="top">Good subject for B&amp;W, you need to add more contrast to it to give it some life. Make it a little brighter and adjust the contrast and it will jump off the screen at us.</td>', 'Good subject for B&W, you need to add more contrast to it to give it some life. Make it a little brighter and adjust the contrast and it will jump off the screen at us.', '2005-11-09 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850620, 254674, 24503, '<td valign="top">nice place. Maybe a little bit more of saturation of the colours would improved the photo.</td>', 'nice place. Maybe a little bit more of saturation of the colours would improved the photo.', '2005-11-09 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850622, 253167, 24503, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The birds adds a lot of depth to the shot.</td>', 'Nice composition. The birds adds a lot of depth to the shot.', '2005-11-09 11:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850627, 253264, 3102, '<td valign="top">You might want to read up on how to compress .jpgs a little more to your advantage.  This shot is only 8K (you can submit up to 150K)... and the blotchy artifacts are very visible here.  I''ll be glad to help if you want some assistance...</td>', 'You might want to read up on how to compress .jpgs a little more to your advantage.  This shot is only 8K (you can submit up to 150K)... and the blotchy artifacts are very visible here.  I''ll be glad to help if you want some assistance...', '2005-11-09 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850633, 252702, 24503, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-11-09 11:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1850635, 255294, 38706, '<td valign="top">Too much orange - Was the trunk and foreground really that colour?</td>', 'Too much orange - Was the trunk and foreground really that colour?', '2005-11-09 11:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
