(1850844, 253292, 40106, '<td valign="top">At first glance I wasn''t really loving this photo... but taking a deeper look i find it very unique, i love how you made something so simple into a work of art.  I would crop off more of the planks at the bottom though.</td>', 'At first glance I wasn''t really loving this photo... but taking a deeper look i find it very unique, i love how you made something so simple into a work of art.  I would crop off more of the planks at the bottom though.', '2005-11-09 12:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
