(1851030, 255154, 40106, '<td valign="top">-wow! very cool!<br/>-i love the fog<br/>-the flower is beautiful!  definitely adds to the photo<br/>-i love the sun shining through on the right</td>', '-wow! very cool!-i love the fog-the flower is beautiful!  definitely adds to the photo-i love the sun shining through on the right', '2005-11-09 13:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851032, 255524, 47482, '<td valign="top">have been waiting for this to come back since march:)</td>', 'have been waiting for this to come back since march:)', '2005-11-09 13:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851033, 254897, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is the tower itself. The tree on the right hand side just seems to be floating there. I wonder how it would look if completely cropped out or if you were able to show more of it, creating a frame for your shot.</td>', 'My favorite part is the tower itself. The tree on the right hand side just seems to be floating there. I wonder how it would look if completely cropped out or if you were able to show more of it, creating a frame for your shot.', '2005-11-09 13:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851034, 254014, 11518, '<td valign="top">White balance seems off...magenta colour cast can be easily removed in curves.</td>', 'White balance seems off...magenta colour cast can be easily removed in curves.', '2005-11-09 13:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851038, 255536, 47482, '<td valign="top">love that sky!!!</td>', 'love that sky!!!', '2005-11-09 13:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851040, 253578, 44268, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look that miserable to me...</td>', 'Doesn''t look that miserable to me...', '2005-11-09 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851042, 254109, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting entry. For me, I wish there was a  bit more sharpness to the horse itself. It appears grainy on my monitor. Also, the horse is looking off to the left and leads my eyes right out of the photo. In a way, the angle you chose almost makes it look like a fake horse.</td>', 'Interesting entry. For me, I wish there was a  bit more sharpness to the horse itself. It appears grainy on my monitor. Also, the horse is looking off to the left and leads my eyes right out of the photo. In a way, the angle you chose almost makes it look like a fake horse.', '2005-11-09 13:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851045, 254896, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for the three artificial lights (I know you couldn''t help them being there). I would have scored this a 10. Great sunset.</td>', 'Had it not been for the three artificial lights (I know you couldn''t help them being there). I would have scored this a 10. Great sunset.', '2005-11-09 13:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851047, 254373, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is soooo on purpose.  Have fun reading the self-righteous comments critiquing this picture.  I''ll give you a 1, cuz I know that''s what you''re going for.  Well done in the bizarro world.</td>', 'This is soooo on purpose.  Have fun reading the self-righteous comments critiquing this picture.  I''ll give you a 1, cuz I know that''s what you''re going for.  Well done in the bizarro world.', '2005-11-09 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851057, 254387, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fall leaves are always a nice. Your photo is very busy and for me, there isn''t any one focal point. It seems a bit over sharpened. I would have scored this higher if it was in the recent "busy" challenge.</td>', 'Fall leaves are always a nice. Your photo is very busy and for me, there isn''t any one focal point. It seems a bit over sharpened. I would have scored this higher if it was in the recent "busy" challenge.', '2005-11-09 13:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851061, 254385, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I like your angle, for me, with the hydrant smack dab in the middle as your focal point, it takes away from what looks like was a nice sunrise. My favorite part is actually the silhoutted tree against the sky.</td>', 'While I like your angle, for me, with the hydrant smack dab in the middle as your focal point, it takes away from what looks like was a nice sunrise. My favorite part is actually the silhoutted tree against the sky.', '2005-11-09 13:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851067, 253579, 34058, '<td valign="top">How awsome is that!!</td>', 'How awsome is that!!', '2005-11-09 13:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851068, 254330, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the bottom half of your photo, but those clouds look overly processed and kind of fake to me, especially in the highlight areas.</td>', 'I like the bottom half of your photo, but those clouds look overly processed and kind of fake to me, especially in the highlight areas.', '2005-11-09 13:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851075, 254932, 41675, '<td valign="top">For such an expansive view, I wish your entry was a bit larger...closer to the maximum 640 allowed..or maybe it is, but it just looks small on my screen. The ground seems to be a bit on the magenta side. My favorite part is the sky.</td>', 'For such an expansive view, I wish your entry was a bit larger...closer to the maximum 640 allowed..or maybe it is, but it just looks small on my screen. The ground seems to be a bit on the magenta side. My favorite part is the sky.', '2005-11-09 13:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851078, 253367, 34058, '<td valign="top">That is really really awsome!!</td>', 'That is really really awsome!!', '2005-11-09 13:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851088, 254057, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like black and white photos, but I wonder if this would have more appeal for me in color?</td>', 'I like black and white photos, but I wonder if this would have more appeal for me in color?', '2005-11-09 13:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851089, 253913, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool, science fiction feel to your photo. I like it alot. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Very cool, science fiction feel to your photo. I like it alot. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2005-11-09 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851091, 255586, 17507, '<td valign="top">this photo needs some leading lines to draw the viewer in. Without clear lines to lead the eye or some other manner of illustrating depth, the photo winds up looking rather flat.</td>', 'this photo needs some leading lines to draw the viewer in. Without clear lines to lead the eye or some other manner of illustrating depth, the photo winds up looking rather flat.', '2005-11-09 13:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851097, 255479, 28381, '<td valign="top">nice colours, but washed out sky lets it down for me</td>', 'nice colours, but washed out sky lets it down for me', '2005-11-09 13:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851102, 255439, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish the shot was more in focus (yeah, I''m one of those that likes crisp photos). Also, my eyes follow where the two guys are looking, and that takes me right out of your photo. I do like the sepia tone choice though.</td>', 'For me, I wish the shot was more in focus (yeah, I''m one of those that likes crisp photos). Also, my eyes follow where the two guys are looking, and that takes me right out of your photo. I do like the sepia tone choice though.', '2005-11-09 13:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851105, 254410, 17507, '<td valign="top">hahah.<br/>it took me a minute to figure out why this is upside down... but now I get it... nice way to "make your photograph as refreshing as you can." :)</td>', 'hahah.it took me a minute to figure out why this is upside down... but now I get it... nice way to "make your photograph as refreshing as you can." :)', '2005-11-09 13:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851106, 255360, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! I really like your photo itself. I like using the person for scale too. Personally, I wish there was more of the photo and a lot less of the white border area.</td>', 'Wow! I really like your photo itself. I like using the person for scale too. Personally, I wish there was more of the photo and a lot less of the white border area.', '2005-11-09 13:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851110, 255565, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely composition. I can see why you''d want to live there. The overexposure really detracts from this picture.</td>', 'lovely composition. I can see why you''d want to live there. The overexposure really detracts from this picture.', '2005-11-09 13:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851112, 255529, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty flower. I wonder how this would look if the composition wasn''t so centered and a different light source?</td>', 'It''s a pretty flower. I wonder how this would look if the composition wasn''t so centered and a different light source?', '2005-11-09 13:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851114, 254508, 41675, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. Truly a beautiful place well captured. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Magnificent. Truly a beautiful place well captured. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2005-11-09 13:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851116, 255504, 17507, '<td valign="top">great picture. The white falls against the nearly black water works wonderfully. The leaves in the pool add a lot as well. The border is used to good effect.</td>', 'great picture. The white falls against the nearly black water works wonderfully. The leaves in the pool add a lot as well. The border is used to good effect.', '2005-11-09 13:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851118, 253891, 17507, '<td valign="top">quite the natural bridge. reminds me of utah. the lighting is indeed ethereal</td>', 'quite the natural bridge. reminds me of utah. the lighting is indeed ethereal', '2005-11-09 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851119, 254137, 46448, '<td valign="top">This is such a great photo, I love the dark mood of the old fence leading you up to the hillside. I just wish the sky wasn''t so blown-out white. High marks never the less!</td>', 'This is such a great photo, I love the dark mood of the old fence leading you up to the hillside. I just wish the sky wasn''t so blown-out white. High marks never the less!', '2005-11-09 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
