(1851134, 255306, 46448, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The details in the sky are awesome, love the sun rays. I wish the ground and cows were a little brighter, but I really like the mood this sets.</td>', 'Very nice! The details in the sky are awesome, love the sun rays. I wish the ground and cows were a little brighter, but I really like the mood this sets.', '2005-11-09 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851144, 254689, 17507, '<td valign="top">beautiful scene and good exposure, but composition leaves something to be desired... there are no really strong lines or shapes, nothing to draw or grab the eye, just a few splashes of color with nothing to anchor them or bring them to life. nonetheless, being there at the right time to see this and knowing how to expose correctly puts you solidly in the "above average" category... (6)</td>', 'beautiful scene and good exposure, but composition leaves something to be desired... there are no really strong lines or shapes, nothing to draw or grab the eye, just a few splashes of color with nothing to anchor them or bring them to life. nonetheless, being there at the right time to see this and knowing how to expose correctly puts you solidly in the "above average" category... (6)', '2005-11-09 13:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851145, 255579, 38725, '<td valign="top">Landscape?</td>', 'Landscape?', '2005-11-09 13:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851147, 254852, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness. Did you try any different crops? I feel like this is just a bit too static.</td>', 'I like the starkness. Did you try any different crops? I feel like this is just a bit too static.', '2005-11-09 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851149, 255503, 45844, '<td valign="top">If you cut the top half from this picture I would love it.</td>', 'If you cut the top half from this picture I would love it.', '2005-11-09 13:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851150, 254420, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, what an open place. I wish you could have gotten the river to feature more prominently.</td>', 'wow, what an open place. I wish you could have gotten the river to feature more prominently.', '2005-11-09 13:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851153, 254564, 30392, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, I really like the composition and the depth of field is spot on. It could be improved by rotating it a bit clockwise it looks a bit tilted!</td>', 'lovely colors, I really like the composition and the depth of field is spot on. It could be improved by rotating it a bit clockwise it looks a bit tilted!', '2005-11-09 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851154, 253991, 17507, '<td valign="top">The rich blue of the sky is refreshing. The trees and their reflection look strangely flat. Maybe this could not be fixed without advanced editing...but I really wish there were more detail and highlight/shadow contrast in the foliage.</td>', 'The rich blue of the sky is refreshing. The trees and their reflection look strangely flat. Maybe this could not be fixed without advanced editing...but I really wish there were more detail and highlight/shadow contrast in the foliage.', '2005-11-09 13:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851164, 254919, 17507, '<td valign="top">Zion is an amazing place. I like the color bands in this picture - blue at the top, then red and green, and yellow at the bottom. This photo would be helped if it had some leading lines to emphasize the depth and draw the eye.</td>', 'Zion is an amazing place. I like the color bands in this picture - blue at the top, then red and green, and yellow at the bottom. This photo would be helped if it had some leading lines to emphasize the depth and draw the eye.', '2005-11-09 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851172, 255275, 34759, '<td valign="top">I love the layers of colors in this one. Nice job.</td>', 'I love the layers of colors in this one. Nice job.', '2005-11-09 13:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851173, 254057, 17507, '<td valign="top">moody and ominous. I hope this gets the high marks it deserves.</td>', 'moody and ominous. I hope this gets the high marks it deserves.', '2005-11-09 13:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851182, 255585, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like Utah!<br/>for a landscape shot, I generally feel that the viewer should have a longer line of sight - there should be objects visible in the distance visible. landscapes should not have a "closed in" feeling - they should be open and expansive.</td>', 'looks like Utah!for a landscape shot, I generally feel that the viewer should have a longer line of sight - there should be objects visible in the distance visible. landscapes should not have a "closed in" feeling - they should be open and expansive.', '2005-11-09 13:48:01.000000', NULL, 1);
