(1851776, 252661, 31533, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great subject ! This has been part of the landscape for how long ?<br/>Too bad your image is suffering from compression artefacts. You should try to stick to the 150k limit as close as possible. There''s a tutorial in the Learn section.</td>', 'Good idea, great subject ! This has been part of the landscape for how long ?Too bad your image is suffering from compression artefacts. You should try to stick to the 150k limit as close as possible. There''s a tutorial in the Learn section.', '2005-11-09 16:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851779, 255195, 32239, '<td valign="top">Lovely image! Such a pity the sky wasn''t blue, would really have given this shot that extra punch.  Why can''t nature cooperate?? ;-)</td>', 'Lovely image! Such a pity the sky wasn''t blue, would really have given this shot that extra punch.  Why can''t nature cooperate?? ;-)', '2005-11-09 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851783, 254916, 31533, '<td valign="top">Postcard.<br/>Great timing with the light. See any other photographers while you were up there ?</td>', 'Postcard.Great timing with the light. See any other photographers while you were up there ?', '2005-11-09 16:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851788, 254655, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love hot the stream bend around the corner.  Did you try it in black and white?  The brown of the stream just seems a little muddy.  However, the fall colors are very pretty too.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love hot the stream bend around the corner.  Did you try it in black and white?  The brown of the stream just seems a little muddy.  However, the fall colors are very pretty too.', '2005-11-09 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851791, 255536, 31533, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2005-11-09 16:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851793, 255589, 32239, '<td valign="top">Striking image; however the foreground seems blurry...almost like it''s photoshopped in there.  Perhaps a point or two of clarity would help?</td>', 'Striking image; however the foreground seems blurry...almost like it''s photoshopped in there.  Perhaps a point or two of clarity would help?', '2005-11-09 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851798, 255429, 37103, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photo look very muted.  I don''t know if there was fog or if it was overexposed but the mountains look too light.  I like the scene that you chose but you could have maybe placed the tree further to one side of the frame so it doesn''t seem to be the object of attention.  Something about the way it is framed right now it looks too balanced.  Nothing holds my eye long.</td>', 'The colors in this photo look very muted.  I don''t know if there was fog or if it was overexposed but the mountains look too light.  I like the scene that you chose but you could have maybe placed the tree further to one side of the frame so it doesn''t seem to be the object of attention.  Something about the way it is framed right now it looks too balanced.  Nothing holds my eye long.', '2005-11-09 16:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851801, 254846, 32239, '<td valign="top">Striking image and colours!</td>', 'Striking image and colours!', '2005-11-09 16:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
