(1851847, 255054, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  For some reason the stump doesn''t hold my attention.  There seems to be too much going on in the background that my eyes are drawn to.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  For some reason the stump doesn''t hold my attention.  There seems to be too much going on in the background that my eyes are drawn to.', '2005-11-09 16:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
