(1851861, 253834, 43809, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-11-09 16:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851872, 254330, 37103, '<td valign="top">The sky is very dramatic.  I really like the sky.  But I would either have included more of the ground below or no ground.  What you have there now is just enough land that I am staring at it trying to figure out what it is and what that white at the top of the hill is.  The clouds alone would have been impressive.</td>', 'The sky is very dramatic.  I really like the sky.  But I would either have included more of the ground below or no ground.  What you have there now is just enough land that I am staring at it trying to figure out what it is and what that white at the top of the hill is.  The clouds alone would have been impressive.', '2005-11-09 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851877, 253252, 42392, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot-10</td>', 'beautiful shot-10', '2005-11-09 16:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851896, 255047, 2920, '<td valign="top">Even though this picture is 90% sky and only 10% land I think it works really well. The buildings do seem a bit blurred though.</td>', 'Even though this picture is 90% sky and only 10% land I think it works really well. The buildings do seem a bit blurred though.', '2005-11-09 16:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851897, 255156, 45197, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, only voted on 25% of the pictures atm but this is the best one I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'I like the colors, only voted on 25% of the pictures atm but this is the best one I''ve seen so far.', '2005-11-09 16:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851898, 255589, 37103, '<td valign="top">Amazing mountains.  Great subject.  The mountains seem to be lacking in contrast.  And the muted tones of the hill detract from the picture overall.  Maybe try upping the contrast, or converting to black and white.  Or crop the hills out, make the photo a panoramic and just focus on the mountains.</td>', 'Amazing mountains.  Great subject.  The mountains seem to be lacking in contrast.  And the muted tones of the hill detract from the picture overall.  Maybe try upping the contrast, or converting to black and white.  Or crop the hills out, make the photo a panoramic and just focus on the mountains.', '2005-11-09 16:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851899, 254816, 45197, '<td valign="top">common, use the 640 pixels allowed</td>', 'common, use the 640 pixels allowed', '2005-11-09 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851901, 252970, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful palms and sunset.  But the photo feels a little crowded.  It would be nice to get rid of the power lines too.</td>', 'Beautiful palms and sunset.  But the photo feels a little crowded.  It would be nice to get rid of the power lines too.', '2005-11-09 16:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851903, 255115, 45197, '<td valign="top">Kinda gray-ish looking, did you try pumping up the contrast ?</td>', 'Kinda gray-ish looking, did you try pumping up the contrast ?', '2005-11-09 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1851904, 255312, 37103, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Great way to spice up the landscape by adding geese flying.  The back ground is very muted and I don''t know if there was any way for you to increase the contrast without making the birds become silhouettes.  But that might look nice too.</td>', 'Love it!  Great way to spice up the landscape by adding geese flying.  The back ground is very muted and I don''t know if there was any way for you to increase the contrast without making the birds become silhouettes.  But that might look nice too.', '2005-11-09 16:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
