(1852210, 253167, 32457, '<td valign="top">That bridge is very familiar to me.  Nice capture of the bird.</td>', 'That bridge is very familiar to me.  Nice capture of the bird.', '2005-11-09 17:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852212, 255133, 32457, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2005-11-09 17:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852214, 255186, 46448, '<td valign="top">This is a very vivid photo, has lots to look at colors and details. But it doesn''t have that landscape feel, its an over powering wall.</td>', 'This is a very vivid photo, has lots to look at colors and details. But it doesn''t have that landscape feel, its an over powering wall.', '2005-11-09 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852222, 255109, 44534, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this picture, it is true serenity!!! I can hear the quiet! A 10.</td>', 'I LOVE this picture, it is true serenity!!! I can hear the quiet! A 10.', '2005-11-09 18:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852223, 255607, 46448, '<td valign="top">This is a great catch of a rainbow. I think it need more image quality, looks pixelated. The fore-ground is a little busy.</td>', 'This is a great catch of a rainbow. I think it need more image quality, looks pixelated. The fore-ground is a little busy.', '2005-11-09 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852225, 253991, 44534, '<td valign="top">The colors and crispness of this picture are breathtaking!</td>', 'The colors and crispness of this picture are breathtaking!', '2005-11-09 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852226, 254472, 42968, '<td valign="top">Done some jogging there!</td>', 'Done some jogging there!', '2005-11-09 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852227, 253264, 41675, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, your photo is very pixelated on my monitor. Also, I find the sun flares distracting and the colors seem to be a bit on the magenta side. Keep trying though, and double check your resolution (and your entry view) when entering.</td>', 'Unfortunately, your photo is very pixelated on my monitor. Also, I find the sun flares distracting and the colors seem to be a bit on the magenta side. Keep trying though, and double check your resolution (and your entry view) when entering.', '2005-11-09 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852228, 255503, 2920, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been much stronger (and met the challenge better) if it had been cropped much lower, i.e. from just above the bright cloud on the centre/right. This would have added much more emphasis &amp; impact to the main subject area.</td>', 'I think this picture would have been much stronger (and met the challenge better) if it had been cropped much lower, i.e. from just above the bright cloud on the centre/right. This would have added much more emphasis & impact to the main subject area.', '2005-11-09 18:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852230, 254816, 46448, '<td valign="top">Wow! breathtaking, I wish it was bigger so I could really see it.</td>', 'Wow! breathtaking, I wish it was bigger so I could really see it.', '2005-11-09 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852232, 254848, 44534, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, wish I were there!</td>', 'A beautiful picture, wish I were there!', '2005-11-09 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852235, 254104, 41746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light but the image would have been much stronger if you could see the head of the animal.</td>', 'Beautiful light but the image would have been much stronger if you could see the head of the animal.', '2005-11-09 18:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852236, 255426, 44534, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and feel of this picture, if the sign and telephone lines were gone it would be a ten.</td>', 'I really like the color and feel of this picture, if the sign and telephone lines were gone it would be a ten.', '2005-11-09 18:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852239, 254065, 46448, '<td valign="top">I really like how the sun rays are dancing around in this, it kinda erie lighting which gives it effect. The tree is what is bothering my eye, its like un-natural leaf glow.</td>', 'I really like how the sun rays are dancing around in this, it kinda erie lighting which gives it effect. The tree is what is bothering my eye, its like un-natural leaf glow.', '2005-11-09 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852250, 255376, 46448, '<td valign="top">I like the windmill and the green grass(wish the green would be brighter). The sky haze is kinda boring, and a little bit of moire by the fence on the pump house. Otherwise great pic!</td>', 'I like the windmill and the green grass(wish the green would be brighter). The sky haze is kinda boring, and a little bit of moire by the fence on the pump house. Otherwise great pic!', '2005-11-09 18:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852254, 255536, 41746, '<td valign="top">Very impressive sky and beutiful image. However, I find the machine distracting. Without it the photo would have been outstanding. 7.</td>', 'Very impressive sky and beutiful image. However, I find the machine distracting. Without it the photo would have been outstanding. 7.', '2005-11-09 18:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852255, 254449, 46448, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture! I don''t understand why you choose B/W, I would have loved to seen it in color.</td>', 'Awesome picture! I don''t understand why you choose B/W, I would have loved to seen it in color.', '2005-11-09 18:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852261, 254612, 46448, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect here, the title is very fitting. What I don''t like is black (line/shadow/fence?) in the lower left my eye keeps getting pulled to it.</td>', 'I really like the effect here, the title is very fitting. What I don''t like is black (line/shadow/fence?) in the lower left my eye keeps getting pulled to it.', '2005-11-09 18:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852270, 254410, 46448, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection shot! I can''t find nothing nothing wrong with it. Well executed.</td>', 'Very nice reflection shot! I can''t find nothing nothing wrong with it. Well executed.', '2005-11-09 18:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852273, 254704, 41746, '<td valign="top">Pure and simple... and beautiful. I love this. Well done! 9.</td>', 'Pure and simple... and beautiful. I love this. Well done! 9.', '2005-11-09 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852281, 255573, 46448, '<td valign="top">good shot, I like the bridge, I don''t like the chain link though taking away from the landscape, At the end of the bridge there seems to be a crocked pole that keeps catching my eye.</td>', 'good shot, I like the bridge, I don''t like the chain link though taking away from the landscape, At the end of the bridge there seems to be a crocked pole that keeps catching my eye.', '2005-11-09 18:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852292, 253932, 41746, '<td valign="top">Colorful and impressive. Very good. 9.</td>', 'Colorful and impressive. Very good. 9.', '2005-11-09 18:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852320, 255109, 22340, '<td valign="top">peggy''s cove i think</td>', 'peggy''s cove i think', '2005-11-09 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852337, 255186, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun take on "landscape".  I think it would be better if you could include a little bit more of the grass and trees and make the graffiti wall more of a triangle, I think you could probably do that just by changing the angle of the camera.  Still I really like this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a really fun take on "landscape".  I think it would be better if you could include a little bit more of the grass and trees and make the graffiti wall more of a triangle, I think you could probably do that just by changing the angle of the camera.  Still I really like this shot.  Nicely done.', '2005-11-09 18:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852338, 255035, 37103, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overexposed.  You might be able to draw out some detail by increasing the contrast or darkening the image.  The scenery looks very idyllic.</td>', 'Looks a little overexposed.  You might be able to draw out some detail by increasing the contrast or darkening the image.  The scenery looks very idyllic.', '2005-11-09 18:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852340, 253264, 45857, '<td valign="top">This image appears posterized, l see large blocks in areas that should be blended. <br/>Your use of lines is good, the beach in the foreground works very well, so your sense of compostion is good. Its just the techinical aspects that hurt.</td>', 'This image appears posterized, l see large blocks in areas that should be blended. Your use of lines is good, the beach in the foreground works very well, so your sense of compostion is good. Its just the techinical aspects that hurt.', '2005-11-09 18:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852343, 253776, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of scale.  Maybe since the colors are so muted this might be nice in black and white.</td>', 'I like the sense of scale.  Maybe since the colors are so muted this might be nice in black and white.', '2005-11-09 18:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852349, 254369, 37103, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite landscapes.  It might be more dramatic if you have the sky take up less space.  Right now the horizon is smack in the middle of the photo which seems a little odd.</td>', 'One of my favorite landscapes.  It might be more dramatic if you have the sky take up less space.  Right now the horizon is smack in the middle of the photo which seems a little odd.', '2005-11-09 18:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852353, 254772, 37103, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of view.  It''s nice and refreshing to see something from above.  Especially these cute houses.  Beautiful autumn colors.</td>', 'Love the angle of view.  It''s nice and refreshing to see something from above.  Especially these cute houses.  Beautiful autumn colors.', '2005-11-09 18:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852363, 255109, 37103, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Reminds me a little of Maine.  Nice reflections of the boats.  I wonder if it would also be nice in black and white.</td>', 'Love it.  Reminds me a little of Maine.  Nice reflections of the boats.  I wonder if it would also be nice in black and white.', '2005-11-09 18:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1852365, 255253, 45857, '<td valign="top">Certainly unique. I think more dramatic colors would have helped, strong oranges and blues. to balance off all the black space. Still its good 7</td>', 'Certainly unique. I think more dramatic colors would have helped, strong oranges and blues. to balance off all the black space. Still its good 7', '2005-11-09 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
