(1852388, 255400, 45857, '<td valign="top">Striking pure image. Really lke the simplistic style. I think it suffers in basic editing, It would be much stronger with more contrast in the sands. 7</td>', 'Striking pure image. Really lke the simplistic style. I think it suffers in basic editing, It would be much stronger with more contrast in the sands. 7', '2005-11-09 18:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
