(1852770, 255240, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Criticism; I think it is the result of the diagonal sand/foreshore, which makes my ''eyes'' think that the horizon is slightly off, but I ''measured'' it and it seems spot on, plus I like the effect with that ''diagonal'', in fact would like to have seen it even ''sharper''.  Also, especially for the Challenge, I would like to have seen more ''land'', especially with this, again, sharp perspective you''ve garnered.  More sea/ocean, more sand/shells or more ''distant island/land'', not sure.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Criticism; I think it is the result of the diagonal sand/foreshore, which makes my ''eyes'' think that the horizon is slightly off, but I ''measured'' it and it seems spot on, plus I like the effect with that ''diagonal'', in fact would like to have seen it even ''sharper''.  Also, especially for the Challenge, I would like to have seen more ''land'', especially with this, again, sharp perspective you''ve garnered.  More sea/ocean, more sand/shells or more ''distant island/land'', not sure.', '2005-11-09 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
