(1853092, 253324, 46056, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  A shame it wasn''t a larger picture so I could see the details.  I think even cropping this to a more regular (6" x 4" style) shape would still have worked.</td>', 'Great subject.  A shame it wasn''t a larger picture so I could see the details.  I think even cropping this to a more regular (6" x 4" style) shape would still have worked.', '2005-11-09 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
