(1853100, 252558, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Mostly for the potential.  Criticism; like to see it at least 640 on at least one side (preferably width), but possibly height too.  Not sure if you rotated this, or this is how the scene looked, but either way looks like the ''horizon'' needs a slight nudge up on the left hand side.  Unusual view/angle and looks like it has potential and even though the colors are fairly ''drought'' stricken (seemingly), like to see a little bit more contrast or color adjustment, somehow.  Frame detracts in my opinion.  And, if ''sheeps'' was intentional, ''ok'', otherwise, ''sheep''.</td>', '5 - Mostly for the potential.  Criticism; like to see it at least 640 on at least one side (preferably width), but possibly height too.  Not sure if you rotated this, or this is how the scene looked, but either way looks like the ''horizon'' needs a slight nudge up on the left hand side.  Unusual view/angle and looks like it has potential and even though the colors are fairly ''drought'' stricken (seemingly), like to see a little bit more contrast or color adjustment, somehow.  Frame detracts in my opinion.  And, if ''sheeps'' was intentional, ''ok'', otherwise, ''sheep''.', '2005-11-09 22:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853116, 254706, 46177, '<td valign="top">I love the soft feel of the mist, the tree in front adds drama and interest, nicely done shot, good luck hope you do well, I think you deserve to with this very lovely picture.</td>', 'I love the soft feel of the mist, the tree in front adds drama and interest, nicely done shot, good luck hope you do well, I think you deserve to with this very lovely picture.', '2005-11-09 22:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
