(1853293, 255253, 47059, '<td valign="top">nice colors of the sun on the horizon.  The foreground is too dark I think.  I croped out all but about an inch of the black and found the focus to go more towards the sun.  Of course this is my own personal taste, so please don''t take it the wrong way.  Very nice though.</td>', 'nice colors of the sun on the horizon.  The foreground is too dark I think.  I croped out all but about an inch of the black and found the focus to go more towards the sun.  Of course this is my own personal taste, so please don''t take it the wrong way.  Very nice though.', '2005-11-09 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
