(1853623, 255461, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - I like the potential.  Criticism; definitely at least 640, preferably width at least.  Not sure what you did with the sat/contrast, but the tree on the left looks ''too blue'', while you may have been going for a certain look/feel with that, it is not enhanced by the fact you cropped half the tree out.  A different crop, slight nudge rotation up on the right and as stated ''bigger'', would have made this shot much better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - I like the potential.  Criticism; definitely at least 640, preferably width at least.  Not sure what you did with the sat/contrast, but the tree on the left looks ''too blue'', while you may have been going for a certain look/feel with that, it is not enhanced by the fact you cropped half the tree out.  A different crop, slight nudge rotation up on the right and as stated ''bigger'', would have made this shot much better in my opinion.', '2005-11-10 00:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
