(1853632, 255162, 32239, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite fall shot so far (however I''ve only rated about 50 pics *sigh*) lol.  <br/> <br/>Seriously though, Very nice composition, beautiful site and great focus everywhere.  One of the main things I''ve noticed about these fall forrest shots is that leaves here or there will be OOF.  I can almost count them in the foreground. Well done!<br/> <br/>I would suggest perhaps a point or two of clarity to give it more depth though?</td>', 'This is my favourite fall shot so far (however I''ve only rated about 50 pics *sigh*) lol.   Seriously though, Very nice composition, beautiful site and great focus everywhere.  One of the main things I''ve noticed about these fall forrest shots is that leaves here or there will be OOF.  I can almost count them in the foreground. Well done! I would suggest perhaps a point or two of clarity to give it more depth though?', '2005-11-10 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
