(1853978, 254282, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - In my opinion, this is about the roo and not the ''landscape''.  The potential seems to be there for a good landscape shot (with or without the kangaroo), plus what landscape is in this shot, is blurred, out of focus and, in the foreground especially, seemingly ''blown''.</td>', '3 - In my opinion, this is about the roo and not the ''landscape''.  The potential seems to be there for a good landscape shot (with or without the kangaroo), plus what landscape is in this shot, is blurred, out of focus and, in the foreground especially, seemingly ''blown''.', '2005-11-10 05:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853980, 254816, 35720, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a very good shot, but it is much too small.</td>', 'This seems to be a very good shot, but it is much too small.', '2005-11-10 05:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853982, 255549, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good compostion, its a shame it seems so blurry</td>', 'Good compostion, its a shame it seems so blurry', '2005-11-10 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853984, 254646, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential here.  Criticism; should be 640 at in width &amp;/or height, especially for this Challenge.  Different crop too would have helped.</td>', '3 - Good potential here.  Criticism; should be 640 at in width &/or height, especially for this Challenge.  Different crop too would have helped.', '2005-11-10 05:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853986, 254288, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice, and good coloring.  Criticism; not much, undecided if I would like to see more ''light'' on that fore tree, but I do like this ''dark'' effect there too so unsure.  Difficult also to tell if it is ''straight'', or needs a nudge up on the right.  I think just a bit more detail on the right of frame, ''around'' the tree, may have made this even better.</td>', '7 - Nice, and good coloring.  Criticism; not much, undecided if I would like to see more ''light'' on that fore tree, but I do like this ''dark'' effect there too so unsure.  Difficult also to tell if it is ''straight'', or needs a nudge up on the right.  I think just a bit more detail on the right of frame, ''around'' the tree, may have made this even better.', '2005-11-10 05:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853990, 255062, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good, and unusual view.  Criticism; not much, perhaps an even sharper (ground level) angle/perspective.  Maybe a slight bump of the colors, not sure, as they do pop out quite well as is.  Perhaps incorporating more of that fore mud/earth, may have added more of that extra ''element'' that it already does, if that makes sense.</td>', '7 - Good, and unusual view.  Criticism; not much, perhaps an even sharper (ground level) angle/perspective.  Maybe a slight bump of the colors, not sure, as they do pop out quite well as is.  Perhaps incorporating more of that fore mud/earth, may have added more of that extra ''element'' that it already does, if that makes sense.', '2005-11-10 06:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1853993, 253791, 35720, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, sharp and colourful, but I find one thing missing: The landscape. Despite that I can''t rate it low because I like it a lot. Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, sharp and colourful, but I find one thing missing: The landscape. Despite that I can''t rate it low because I like it a lot. Good luck!', '2005-11-10 06:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854007, 252970, 35720, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, great silhouette, beautiful colours. I find the lines a slight distraction, but despite that a very good shot. 7</td>', 'Wonderful shot, great silhouette, beautiful colours. I find the lines a slight distraction, but despite that a very good shot. 7', '2005-11-10 06:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
