(1854077, 254936, 28029, '<td valign="top">I like it!  I think that you would do better with this pic in a different challenge, but I find this very creative and well-done. Perfect lighting.</td>', 'I like it!  I think that you would do better with this pic in a different challenge, but I find this very creative and well-done. Perfect lighting.', '2005-11-10 07:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854078, 253105, 28029, '<td valign="top">At first,  I thought your title was, "Morning Enhancement" which made sense when I then looked at the colors of the sky.  Seriously though, this is a very nice shot. Some might object to the centered horizon. Others might say the the point of interest is misplaced. Still others might detect a little graininess. But not me. I like it. 8</td>', 'At first,  I thought your title was, "Morning Enhancement" which made sense when I then looked at the colors of the sky.  Seriously though, this is a very nice shot. Some might object to the centered horizon. Others might say the the point of interest is misplaced. Still others might detect a little graininess. But not me. I like it. 8', '2005-11-10 07:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
