(1854097, 255156, 28029, '<td valign="top">Tilted horizon. I really like this shot, besides the horizon. I am no expert, so I will just suggest that I am left with the feeling that this great composition could have been better with some lighting/ contrast tweaking. Not sure again, but I might have cropped out the nearest pole as well. Very nice shot. I might have tried to get a little more sky in. 8</td>', 'Tilted horizon. I really like this shot, besides the horizon. I am no expert, so I will just suggest that I am left with the feeling that this great composition could have been better with some lighting/ contrast tweaking. Not sure again, but I might have cropped out the nearest pole as well. Very nice shot. I might have tried to get a little more sky in. 8', '2005-11-10 07:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854098, 254754, 45558, '<td valign="top">good improve use of the curtain for framing. Just a little off on the window ledge - sloping a little</td>', 'good improve use of the curtain for framing. Just a little off on the window ledge - sloping a little', '2005-11-10 07:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854099, 253891, 3569, '<td valign="top">I know dark is in these days, but I would lighten the subject green conifers a bit more to really draw the eye in.  I like the shot though.</td>', 'I know dark is in these days, but I would lighten the subject green conifers a bit more to really draw the eye in.  I like the shot though.', '2005-11-10 07:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854100, 253011, 45558, '<td valign="top">great photo, good natural light and contrast</td>', 'great photo, good natural light and contrast', '2005-11-10 07:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
