(1854109, 255565, 28029, '<td valign="top">I did not like the blown out highlights but when linking it to the title, I guess it works (Dreamy?) If that is true then the heavy frame detracts from that mood. Nice shot.</td>', 'I did not like the blown out highlights but when linking it to the title, I guess it works (Dreamy?) If that is true then the heavy frame detracts from that mood. Nice shot.', '2005-11-10 07:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
