(1854285, 255504, 47059, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  This looks like one of those waterfalls that are not on a map, and only locals know about.  I love the deep rich colors of the leaves above the falls.  The scene is not your "typical" wide open landscape that leaves you exposed to the vastness of nature.   It''s more like a warm, cozy pocket in the blanket of nature.  I could easily see myself sitting on the rocks in the foreground eating lunch, taking in the sounds of the water fall and the colors of the leaves, and being at complete peace by myself, yet not alone.</td>', 'Nice picture.  This looks like one of those waterfalls that are not on a map, and only locals know about.  I love the deep rich colors of the leaves above the falls.  The scene is not your "typical" wide open landscape that leaves you exposed to the vastness of nature.   It''s more like a warm, cozy pocket in the blanket of nature.  I could easily see myself sitting on the rocks in the foreground eating lunch, taking in the sounds of the water fall and the colors of the leaves, and being at complete peace by myself, yet not alone.', '2005-11-10 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854286, 253682, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT shot!!  Love the beauty of the clouds and sky!!  One of the best in the challenge!! 10 :)</td>', 'This is a GREAT shot!!  Love the beauty of the clouds and sky!!  One of the best in the challenge!! 10 :)', '2005-11-10 09:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
