(1854481, 255058, 40386, '<td valign="top">I would have been inclined to crop a bit of the bottom of this photo out (the dark landmass).  It may just be my monitor compared to yours but it appears very dark in general to me and if I am seeing it as you do then I would be inclined to lighten the shot a tad too to bring out a bit more detail.  Nice cityscape nonetheless.</td>', 'I would have been inclined to crop a bit of the bottom of this photo out (the dark landmass).  It may just be my monitor compared to yours but it appears very dark in general to me and if I am seeing it as you do then I would be inclined to lighten the shot a tad too to bring out a bit more detail.  Nice cityscape nonetheless.', '2005-11-10 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854486, 254225, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and beautiful colors.  I like the portrait version of landscape but dont know if everyone will see it that way LOL.  Dont you just love autumn colors!  Good luck 8</td>', 'Nice framing and beautiful colors.  I like the portrait version of landscape but dont know if everyone will see it that way LOL.  Dont you just love autumn colors!  Good luck 8', '2005-11-10 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854491, 255426, 40386, '<td valign="top">I bet you are going to get lots of comments about the power lines but they just cant be avoided sometimes!!  This is a lovely shot, the man on the bench just gives it that finishing touch. 8</td>', 'I bet you are going to get lots of comments about the power lines but they just cant be avoided sometimes!!  This is a lovely shot, the man on the bench just gives it that finishing touch. 8', '2005-11-10 11:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
