(1854533, 255620, 40386, '<td valign="top">This shot would be nicer if it was a bit sharper in my opinion also I would have cropped a bit of the bottom of the shot off and maybe straightened the horizon a few degrees.</td>', 'This shot would be nicer if it was a bit sharper in my opinion also I would have cropped a bit of the bottom of the shot off and maybe straightened the horizon a few degrees.', '2005-11-10 11:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854534, 255307, 46920, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice place to play golf.  Very nice colors.</td>', 'Looks like a nice place to play golf.  Very nice colors.', '2005-11-10 11:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854537, 254821, 16950, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective.  Took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at.</td>', 'Neat perspective.  Took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at.', '2005-11-10 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854543, 253271, 46920, '<td valign="top">A truly nice landscape photograph.</td>', 'A truly nice landscape photograph.', '2005-11-10 11:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854545, 253962, 40386, '<td valign="top">Very pretty setting, it appears a bit on the dark side on my monitor.  Try adding  a bit of contrast and lighten slightly which will make it pop a bit more</td>', 'Very pretty setting, it appears a bit on the dark side on my monitor.  Try adding  a bit of contrast and lighten slightly which will make it pop a bit more', '2005-11-10 11:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854552, 255360, 44172, '<td valign="top">very nice image - wish I were there to see this in person, maybe a little more clarity though it almost seems like it was taken while on the water, I do not care for all the extra borders and the thickness of them - I think it takes away from the image, meets the challenge though good job :)</td>', 'very nice image - wish I were there to see this in person, maybe a little more clarity though it almost seems like it was taken while on the water, I do not care for all the extra borders and the thickness of them - I think it takes away from the image, meets the challenge though good job :)', '2005-11-10 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854555, 255450, 46920, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph from the place I was born...Brazil.  Good idea framing Cristo Redentor within the limbs of the tree.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph from the place I was born...Brazil.  Good idea framing Cristo Redentor within the limbs of the tree.', '2005-11-10 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854562, 253000, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, pity the sky wasnt a bit more interesting.  Also I would have straightened the horizon/pathway a few degrees so it doesnt appear to be tilting to the left.  Crop a bit of the bottom off the shot too.  Not too sure about the sharpness either.</td>', 'Nice reflection, pity the sky wasnt a bit more interesting.  Also I would have straightened the horizon/pathway a few degrees so it doesnt appear to be tilting to the left.  Crop a bit of the bottom off the shot too.  Not too sure about the sharpness either.', '2005-11-10 11:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854563, 255355, 46920, '<td valign="top">A very familiar view.  Colorado...what a beautiful place to live and take photographs.</td>', 'A very familiar view.  Colorado...what a beautiful place to live and take photographs.', '2005-11-10 11:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854565, 255203, 44172, '<td valign="top">a stunning image, meets the challenge, good title and border, I guess my only preference would be the sky - I don''t care for the grain or noise effect - wish it were very smooth - good work though :)</td>', 'a stunning image, meets the challenge, good title and border, I guess my only preference would be the sky - I don''t care for the grain or noise effect - wish it were very smooth - good work though :)', '2005-11-10 11:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854566, 255402, 46920, '<td valign="top">The title of your photo says it all.</td>', 'The title of your photo says it all.', '2005-11-10 11:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854569, 255549, 44172, '<td valign="top">stunning sky and colors, a little too blurry for my taste, meets the challenge though :)</td>', 'stunning sky and colors, a little too blurry for my taste, meets the challenge though :)', '2005-11-10 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854576, 255579, 44172, '<td valign="top">my opinion is that this is too small and does not meet the challenge :(</td>', 'my opinion is that this is too small and does not meet the challenge :(', '2005-11-10 11:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854577, 253572, 40386, '<td valign="top">The slight tilt in the road (?) is a bit offputting.</td>', 'The slight tilt in the road (?) is a bit offputting.', '2005-11-10 11:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854580, 255565, 739, '<td valign="top">maybe placing the horizon and the house away from the center would have given this picture more impact.  Still deciding how I feel about the overexposed rocks in the foreground.</td>', 'maybe placing the horizon and the house away from the center would have given this picture more impact.  Still deciding how I feel about the overexposed rocks in the foreground.', '2005-11-10 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854586, 255607, 44172, '<td valign="top">a little too blurry and grainy and the border is strange not being the same all the way around, great capture of a pretty rainbow though :)</td>', 'a little too blurry and grainy and the border is strange not being the same all the way around, great capture of a pretty rainbow though :)', '2005-11-10 11:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854588, 253891, 44172, '<td valign="top">wow - stunning - would love to see this for real - good work :)</td>', 'wow - stunning - would love to see this for real - good work :)', '2005-11-10 11:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854593, 253770, 47487, '<td valign="top">a longer exposure on this shot, with a tripod, would have been really interesting.</td>', 'a longer exposure on this shot, with a tripod, would have been really interesting.', '2005-11-10 11:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854597, 255373, 739, '<td valign="top">the picture is pixelated...technical issue?</td>', 'the picture is pixelated...technical issue?', '2005-11-10 11:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854603, 254936, 739, '<td valign="top">indoor shots misses the landscape mark, I think.</td>', 'indoor shots misses the landscape mark, I think.', '2005-11-10 11:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854607, 255565, 44172, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the rocks on the bottom, a little too bright for my taste. Like the frame or border, and it''s a very pretty image though :)</td>', 'I don''t care for the rocks on the bottom, a little too bright for my taste. Like the frame or border, and it''s a very pretty image though :)', '2005-11-10 11:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854612, 253946, 44172, '<td valign="top">good title - see the "x" and "spots" right away - kind of neat - very pretty image to look at, nice work :)</td>', 'good title - see the "x" and "spots" right away - kind of neat - very pretty image to look at, nice work :)', '2005-11-10 12:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854618, 255402, 44172, '<td valign="top">poor tree, nice idea having the tree be the focal point and landscape as backdrop - tree is a bit bright for my taste, meets the challenge though - good job :)</td>', 'poor tree, nice idea having the tree be the focal point and landscape as backdrop - tree is a bit bright for my taste, meets the challenge though - good job :)', '2005-11-10 12:02:16.000000', NULL, 1);
