(1854906, 255260, 44924, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot. It may just be me, but it makes my eyes squint trying to correct for that dark area on the right. Still a great shot with that bright white tower against the darker scenery.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot. It may just be me, but it makes my eyes squint trying to correct for that dark area on the right. Still a great shot with that bright white tower against the darker scenery.', '2005-11-10 13:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
