(1854935, 254919, 44924, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot of a beautiful scenery. The shadows lead me to believe it''s early or late in the day, so I don''t know if you could have played with the colors a bit in photoshop to bring out more of the sunset orange feel to it that I believe was there in reality. Hope to see this in the top 20 still. Good luck with this awesome picture.</td>', 'Awesome shot of a beautiful scenery. The shadows lead me to believe it''s early or late in the day, so I don''t know if you could have played with the colors a bit in photoshop to bring out more of the sunset orange feel to it that I believe was there in reality. Hope to see this in the top 20 still. Good luck with this awesome picture.', '2005-11-10 13:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854937, 254983, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.', '2005-11-10 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854940, 254110, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.', '2005-11-10 13:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854944, 255215, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great autumncolours.</td>', 'Great autumncolours.', '2005-11-10 13:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854945, 255358, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.', '2005-11-10 13:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854946, 255426, 44924, '<td valign="top">Not that you can do anything about it, but if it wasn''t for those power lines disturbing the peace ... then again that may just be me. Still a great simple picture.</td>', 'Not that you can do anything about it, but if it wasn''t for those power lines disturbing the peace ... then again that may just be me. Still a great simple picture.', '2005-11-10 13:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854950, 254859, 36060, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp landscape and great view.', '2005-11-10 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854990, 255547, 44924, '<td valign="top">I love the scenery, colors and the lines of the fence. But speaking of the fence, I would have probably stepped 6 feet (2m - wherever you are from) to the right to make that fence line start little above the left corner and then show it flowing into the picture at a slight diagonal level. And that''s just a suggestion coming from a fellow amateur photographer though. LOL</td>', 'I love the scenery, colors and the lines of the fence. But speaking of the fence, I would have probably stepped 6 feet (2m - wherever you are from) to the right to make that fence line start little above the left corner and then show it flowing into the picture at a slight diagonal level. And that''s just a suggestion coming from a fellow amateur photographer though. LOL', '2005-11-10 14:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1854997, 254498, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a strong composition on its own; however, the colors seem to wash into each other. I''m not sure if the picture has a lot of noise just from your camera or if you used a watercolor-type effect in Photoshop but it takes away from the colors and the beauty of what looks like a great scene. I would also suggest (if you can get one for your camera) using a Polarizing filter. It would make your sky that much more blue naturally so you don''t have to worry about adjusting colors after the fact. Hope this helps - it''s a really nice image, but wanted to let you know my impression. 5</td>', 'This is a strong composition on its own; however, the colors seem to wash into each other. I''m not sure if the picture has a lot of noise just from your camera or if you used a watercolor-type effect in Photoshop but it takes away from the colors and the beauty of what looks like a great scene. I would also suggest (if you can get one for your camera) using a Polarizing filter. It would make your sky that much more blue naturally so you don''t have to worry about adjusting colors after the fact. Hope this helps - it''s a really nice image, but wanted to let you know my impression. 5', '2005-11-10 14:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855001, 254449, 15207, '<td valign="top">Bravo. I''ve voted on about 100 so far and this is BY FAR the best. I cannot believe the detail you''ve achieved and the mist/fog/light rays are fantastic. Bravo. 10</td>', 'Bravo. I''ve voted on about 100 so far and this is BY FAR the best. I cannot believe the detail you''ve achieved and the mist/fog/light rays are fantastic. Bravo. 10', '2005-11-10 14:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855004, 254706, 15207, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I just love fog shots like this. 10</td>', 'Beautiful. I just love fog shots like this. 10', '2005-11-10 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
