(1855075, 254288, 42845, '<td valign="top">It seems oversharpened.  And while I like the idea of the tree in silhouette, there''s so much detail in the rest of the picture that it makes the darkened tree seem like just an obstacle that couldn''t be overcome, rather than the central point of focus.</td>', 'It seems oversharpened.  And while I like the idea of the tree in silhouette, there''s so much detail in the rest of the picture that it makes the darkened tree seem like just an obstacle that couldn''t be overcome, rather than the central point of focus.', '2005-11-10 14:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855078, 255585, 44924, '<td valign="top">Great composition and scenery. I love this picture. If there is one thing I can think of for improvement it would be to play with the colors in Photoshop to slightly add some intensity to the red color range. That would be a definite 10 after my taste with those green trees against red rocks. Right now they look slightly pale. Still a great rating though ;)</td>', 'Great composition and scenery. I love this picture. If there is one thing I can think of for improvement it would be to play with the colors in Photoshop to slightly add some intensity to the red color range. That would be a definite 10 after my taste with those green trees against red rocks. Right now they look slightly pale. Still a great rating though ;)', '2005-11-10 14:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855086, 254680, 15305, '<td valign="top">Poor focus, light and resolution. Poor picture overall.</td>', 'Poor focus, light and resolution. Poor picture overall.', '2005-11-10 14:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
