(1855129, 255091, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow really pretty. i love how hazy it looks. the bottom of the picture reminds me of one of monet''s paintings. awesome color scheme. great job!</td>', 'wow really pretty. i love how hazy it looks. the bottom of the picture reminds me of one of monet''s paintings. awesome color scheme. great job!', '2005-11-10 14:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855131, 255272, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the soft focus.  It''s consistent throughout the picture, and I think adds to the tone.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the soft focus.  It''s consistent throughout the picture, and I think adds to the tone.', '2005-11-10 14:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855132, 255121, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. It reminds me of a place I like to visit in Cost aRica - although I like that it could be anywhere - it just calls you in. one little picky thing -- the horizon line is slightly off. I believe you can correct this by cropping and turnign the picture a bit without breaking the basic editing rules. Your score could possibly improve in the future with that small trick. Hope you do well!</td>', 'I really like this picture. It reminds me of a place I like to visit in Cost aRica - although I like that it could be anywhere - it just calls you in. one little picky thing -- the horizon line is slightly off. I believe you can correct this by cropping and turnign the picture a bit without breaking the basic editing rules. Your score could possibly improve in the future with that small trick. Hope you do well!', '2005-11-10 14:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855133, 254922, 44924, '<td valign="top">That''s too funny, this exact same picture and composition was taken for this challenge at day time. lol   Well, whoever this other person was, you''ve got him (her) beat cause it looks better at night  ;)</td>', 'That''s too funny, this exact same picture and composition was taken for this challenge at day time. lol   Well, whoever this other person was, you''ve got him (her) beat cause it looks better at night  ;)', '2005-11-10 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855140, 254112, 42845, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I like the creativity, the sort of filtered lighting, and even the glare on either side.</td>', 'Fantastic.  I like the creativity, the sort of filtered lighting, and even the glare on either side.', '2005-11-10 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855146, 254112, 15207, '<td valign="top">Oh man! I love it when you go through hundreds of photos that look all the same and then you come across one like this! Absolutely a cliche-breaker. It jumps out immediately as one of the best. A perfect 10!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Oh man! I love it when you go through hundreds of photos that look all the same and then you come across one like this! Absolutely a cliche-breaker. It jumps out immediately as one of the best. A perfect 10!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2005-11-10 14:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855149, 254015, 44924, '<td valign="top">If the light colors weren''t so faded out I would have rated this in the top. Maybe underexposure in this situation may have worked better, unless the focus of this picture intentionally was to be the dark trees and the building in it. I''m just an amateur too though and have certain taste. I would have liked to see that castle on the cliff to be set for the right exposure.</td>', 'If the light colors weren''t so faded out I would have rated this in the top. Maybe underexposure in this situation may have worked better, unless the focus of this picture intentionally was to be the dark trees and the building in it. I''m just an amateur too though and have certain taste. I would have liked to see that castle on the cliff to be set for the right exposure.', '2005-11-10 14:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855150, 255288, 42574, '<td valign="top">Hey Dad, thats a really nice shot. Wish that I had taken it :^)  Hope you do well!</td>', 'Hey Dad, thats a really nice shot. Wish that I had taken it :^)  Hope you do well!', '2005-11-10 14:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
