(1855174, 255232, 45926, '<td valign="top">i don''t think i love all the negetive space. i think that maybe if the picture had more of the flower bush and less of the building, this would be better. however, nice</td>', 'i don''t think i love all the negetive space. i think that maybe if the picture had more of the flower bush and less of the building, this would be better. however, nice', '2005-11-10 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
