(1855178, 254564, 45194, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice but the  composition needs something and the cars in the parkinglot behind the pond sort of ruin the shot for me.  Could have been a 6 without the cars but I gave you a 5</td>', 'The colors are nice but the  composition needs something and the cars in the parkinglot behind the pond sort of ruin the shot for me.  Could have been a 6 without the cars but I gave you a 5', '2005-11-10 14:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
