(1855362, 255400, 37103, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Amazing textures on the sand.  The moment you captured with the rays from the sun coming over the dune is perfect.  I love the subtle blue in the sky and the way you eye follows the top of the dunes over to where the sun is rising.  10.</td>', 'Love it.  Amazing textures on the sand.  The moment you captured with the rays from the sun coming over the dune is perfect.  I love the subtle blue in the sky and the way you eye follows the top of the dunes over to where the sun is rising.  10.', '2005-11-10 15:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855363, 255451, 35014, '<td valign="top">There are about 5 or 6 Northern Lights shots and the is the best of that bunch and in my opinion one of the best of the whole challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'There are about 5 or 6 Northern Lights shots and the is the best of that bunch and in my opinion one of the best of the whole challenge.  Well done.', '2005-11-10 15:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
