(1855387, 255547, 24454, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful!   An autumn I can only dream about -- and experience vicariously through lovely photography like this!!!!     It looks like an October calendar poto!</td>', 'Just beautiful!   An autumn I can only dream about -- and experience vicariously through lovely photography like this!!!!     It looks like an October calendar poto!', '2005-11-10 15:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855389, 255529, 44860, '<td valign="top">I see, but the theme of the challenge is landscape. Try harder to meet a challenge next time - it''s challenging and it''s interesting - I can assure you. And avoid direct flash - it''s good for snapshot, but not for photo to enjoy.</td>', 'I see, but the theme of the challenge is landscape. Try harder to meet a challenge next time - it''s challenging and it''s interesting - I can assure you. And avoid direct flash - it''s good for snapshot, but not for photo to enjoy.', '2005-11-10 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1855390, 255503, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty.    The objects in your horizon are so clean and sharp.   And for some reason, all the negative space in the sky really works for me on this one.   Great job!</td>', 'This is so pretty.    The objects in your horizon are so clean and sharp.   And for some reason, all the negative space in the sky really works for me on this one.   Great job!', '2005-11-10 15:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
