(1855428, 253932, 2920, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very strong image. However, I wish it had included the tops of the nearest trees. The shape of the road is echoed by the tree trunks but cut flat at the trees.  ( I guess you had crop something else from the top of the road maybe?) Even so the picture is very atmospheric.</td>', 'I think this is a very strong image. However, I wish it had included the tops of the nearest trees. The shape of the road is echoed by the tree trunks but cut flat at the trees.  ( I guess you had crop something else from the top of the road maybe?) Even so the picture is very atmospheric.', '2005-11-10 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
