(1855669, 255508, 24454, '<td valign="top">And where pre tell in the Texas Hill Country did you manage to find this beauty??????   I live at the foot of  the Texas Hill Country myself and have yet to see such autumn beauty  :)    This is just amazing!    I reallywould love to know where it is --Because  I need to head out there and shoot.   There''s a Free Study going on  :)     Beautiful job making Texas look great!!!!!!!!!!!   I''m giving this a 10 first because it''s wonderful, and 2nd because I KNOW how rare it is to find this kind of autumn in Texas!  :)</td>', 'And where pre tell in the Texas Hill Country did you manage to find this beauty??????   I live at the foot of  the Texas Hill Country myself and have yet to see such autumn beauty  :)    This is just amazing!    I reallywould love to know where it is --Because  I need to head out there and shoot.   There''s a Free Study going on  :)     Beautiful job making Texas look great!!!!!!!!!!!   I''m giving this a 10 first because it''s wonderful, and 2nd because I KNOW how rare it is to find this kind of autumn in Texas!  :)', '2005-11-10 16:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
