(1856040, 254623, 40718, '<td valign="top">:( The bridge is totally marred by the overlapped railroad bridge.  It brings back nice memories though as I spent 4 years in Virginia Beach.  The long exposure is nice on the water though.  I love that look.</td>', ':( The bridge is totally marred by the overlapped railroad bridge.  It brings back nice memories though as I spent 4 years in Virginia Beach.  The long exposure is nice on the water though.  I love that look.', '2005-11-10 18:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856042, 254372, 40718, '<td valign="top">Dang.  A beautiful picture marred by poor compression or pixellation (hopefully it''s that and not spot editing).  I''ll still give it a 6.</td>', 'Dang.  A beautiful picture marred by poor compression or pixellation (hopefully it''s that and not spot editing).  I''ll still give it a 6.', '2005-11-10 18:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856044, 255443, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ha, I almost called my entry "Hazy Shade of Winter".  That would have been a faux paux. ;)</td>', 'Ha, I almost called my entry "Hazy Shade of Winter".  That would have been a faux paux. ;)', '2005-11-10 18:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856047, 255156, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the extreme downhill slant and the feeling that you might be rolling downhill.  It''s also great that you could include the vast scenery behind the houses, including the really dramatic mountains and sky.  I love the fog hanging between the hills.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the extreme downhill slant and the feeling that you might be rolling downhill.  It''s also great that you could include the vast scenery behind the houses, including the really dramatic mountains and sky.  I love the fog hanging between the hills.', '2005-11-10 18:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856061, 254976, 42845, '<td valign="top">To me, the color seems a little flat and the tree is the foreground is distracting and unattractive.  But the mountain, the trees in back, sky, and refelction are great.</td>', 'To me, the color seems a little flat and the tree is the foreground is distracting and unattractive.  But the mountain, the trees in back, sky, and refelction are great.', '2005-11-10 18:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856070, 255091, 42845, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but I think it adds to the mood.  I like the blue cast, too.</td>', 'A little grainy, but I think it adds to the mood.  I like the blue cast, too.', '2005-11-10 18:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856072, 255610, 37103, '<td valign="top">I really love this.  The shape of the clouds if just so happy and the deep blue really contrasts nicely with the sand.  I wish there was a little more detail in the sand.  But I imagine there is at a higher resolution.  Great job! 9.</td>', 'I really love this.  The shape of the clouds if just so happy and the deep blue really contrasts nicely with the sand.  I wish there was a little more detail in the sand.  But I imagine there is at a higher resolution.  Great job! 9.', '2005-11-10 18:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856084, 253578, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds and mountains, especially those further back, but the foreground is pretty empty.</td>', 'Nice clouds and mountains, especially those further back, but the foreground is pretty empty.', '2005-11-10 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856140, 254387, 42845, '<td valign="top">The highlights seem blown out and the colors have a bluish hue.  Also, while it''s a different take on a landscape and in that way creative (which is good), the composition and subject matter aren''t.</td>', 'The highlights seem blown out and the colors have a bluish hue.  Also, while it''s a different take on a landscape and in that way creative (which is good), the composition and subject matter aren''t.', '2005-11-10 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856150, 254372, 37103, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful place and a stunning image.  However something seems to be wrong with the lines.  Maybe it was oversharpened?  All the straight lines appear to be fuzzy.</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful place and a stunning image.  However something seems to be wrong with the lines.  Maybe it was oversharpened?  All the straight lines appear to be fuzzy.', '2005-11-10 18:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856179, 255048, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice ride, though hard to sell as a landscape shot</td>', 'nice ride, though hard to sell as a landscape shot', '2005-11-10 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856198, 254287, 11756, '<td valign="top">think more coulda been done with this</td>', 'think more coulda been done with this', '2005-11-10 18:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856205, 255282, 11756, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2005-11-10 18:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856227, 254295, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like where you were headed.  It''s kind of Dali-like.  But I think the execution needs to be a bit better.</td>', 'I like where you were headed.  It''s kind of Dali-like.  But I think the execution needs to be a bit better.', '2005-11-10 18:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856252, 254884, 42845, '<td valign="top">The trees are nice, but the picture doesn''t on the whole work as a landscape for me, especially with the garbage bins.</td>', 'The trees are nice, but the picture doesn''t on the whole work as a landscape for me, especially with the garbage bins.', '2005-11-10 18:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856286, 255607, 42845, '<td valign="top">The image quality is bad and the composition is casual, but I still kinda like it.</td>', 'The image quality is bad and the composition is casual, but I still kinda like it.', '2005-11-10 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856305, 255580, 42845, '<td valign="top">The trees in the background seem overexposed, but it looks like you had very contrasty lighting so I feel your pain.  Maybe a little rotation to the left to level the horizon.</td>', 'The trees in the background seem overexposed, but it looks like you had very contrasty lighting so I feel your pain.  Maybe a little rotation to the left to level the horizon.', '2005-11-10 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856310, 255005, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pastel tones!</td>', 'Beautiful pastel tones!', '2005-11-10 19:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856313, 254136, 42845, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind buildings in landscapes, but this picture seems to be about the landscaping of the grounds around the building, which isn''t very creative or appealing.</td>', 'I don''t mind buildings in landscapes, but this picture seems to be about the landscaping of the grounds around the building, which isn''t very creative or appealing.', '2005-11-10 19:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856318, 255492, 42845, '<td valign="top">Really interesting.  I''m not sure I''m crazy about the lack of detail in the leaves -- it kind of looks like etched glass -- but so what?  Neat.</td>', 'Really interesting.  I''m not sure I''m crazy about the lack of detail in the leaves -- it kind of looks like etched glass -- but so what?  Neat.', '2005-11-10 19:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856326, 254385, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like that you took a chance.  The sky is pretty but the chainlink fence is not, but whoever said all landscapes must be pretty?  Together with the awkward tree and the stumpy fire hydrant, I really like it.  But I wish the lighting were better on the hydrant.  I don''t know if a fill flash would have worked or not, but it''d have been worth a try.</td>', 'I like that you took a chance.  The sky is pretty but the chainlink fence is not, but whoever said all landscapes must be pretty?  Together with the awkward tree and the stumpy fire hydrant, I really like it.  But I wish the lighting were better on the hydrant.  I don''t know if a fill flash would have worked or not, but it''d have been worth a try.', '2005-11-10 19:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856332, 254345, 42845, '<td valign="top">The composition, the lighting, and the landscape are ok.   A little too safe.</td>', 'The composition, the lighting, and the landscape are ok.   A little too safe.', '2005-11-10 19:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856339, 254373, 19944, '<td valign="top">Crooked + blurry + through a window (?) + a big thumb (or other thing?) = not a very high score</td>', 'Crooked + blurry + through a window (?) + a big thumb (or other thing?) = not a very high score', '2005-11-10 19:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856340, 254857, 42845, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice, but I''m not crazy about the cropping or the guard rail.  I like the idea of having a leading line, but maybe placing it lower in the picture would have made it less prominent.  However if you like the look of the rail, I can see why you put it where you did.</td>', 'The sky is nice, but I''m not crazy about the cropping or the guard rail.  I like the idea of having a leading line, but maybe placing it lower in the picture would have made it less prominent.  However if you like the look of the rail, I can see why you put it where you did.', '2005-11-10 19:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856344, 255505, 19944, '<td valign="top">Right place, right time.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Right place, right time.  Congratulations.', '2005-11-10 19:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856349, 254973, 42845, '<td valign="top">The colors seems off in the moon.  Did you have to set the contrast really high to get the inky black and have the headlights pop?  Nice idea, but maybe a better initial exposure would have made the post-processing easier and its execution better.</td>', 'The colors seems off in the moon.  Did you have to set the contrast really high to get the inky black and have the headlights pop?  Nice idea, but maybe a better initial exposure would have made the post-processing easier and its execution better.', '2005-11-10 19:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856350, 254282, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice pan, but it places the focus on the kangaroo rather than the lanscape.   Also, the foreground greens seem oversaturated.</td>', 'Nice pan, but it places the focus on the kangaroo rather than the lanscape.   Also, the foreground greens seem oversaturated.', '2005-11-10 19:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856354, 255595, 42845, '<td valign="top">Sorry but cars, unless they''re the focus of the picture, really break the spell for me.  Too much parking lot in the foreground, but the lighting is very nice, though.</td>', 'Sorry but cars, unless they''re the focus of the picture, really break the spell for me.  Too much parking lot in the foreground, but the lighting is very nice, though.', '2005-11-10 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856357, 255146, 42845, '<td valign="top">Great colors and focus, but to me it''s leaning toward architectural.</td>', 'Great colors and focus, but to me it''s leaning toward architectural.', '2005-11-10 19:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856359, 253809, 42845, '<td valign="top">I think a graduated neutral density filter would have helped keep color in the sky and detail in the highlights of the trees.  But I hate it when it seems the only solution is to spend more money, so I''m at a loss.  Nice blur on the water.</td>', 'I think a graduated neutral density filter would have helped keep color in the sky and detail in the highlights of the trees.  But I hate it when it seems the only solution is to spend more money, so I''m at a loss.  Nice blur on the water.', '2005-11-10 19:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856361, 255549, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the image quality is low and the focus seems off.</td>', 'Nice sky, but the image quality is low and the focus seems off.', '2005-11-10 19:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856367, 255529, 42845, '<td valign="top">The highlights are blown out and I''m not crazy about the cropping.  Nice plant, though.</td>', 'The highlights are blown out and I''m not crazy about the cropping.  Nice plant, though.', '2005-11-10 19:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856373, 255195, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful but I would have cropped some of the foreground out and it would still make a stunning landscape shot.</td>', 'This is beautiful but I would have cropped some of the foreground out and it would still make a stunning landscape shot.', '2005-11-10 19:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856378, 255401, 42845, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition, but something seems off.  I don''t know if it''s oversharpened or too much noise reduction.</td>', 'Really nice composition, but something seems off.  I don''t know if it''s oversharpened or too much noise reduction.', '2005-11-10 19:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856383, 253335, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping.  I would have liked to have seen the desert, though, rather than having its exposure sacrificed for the sky''s.</td>', 'I like the cropping.  I would have liked to have seen the desert, though, rather than having its exposure sacrificed for the sky''s.', '2005-11-10 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856397, 254874, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, so reminds me of my birthplace in Zimbabwe, a place called World''s View in Zimbabwe, taken from on top of a huge granite outcrop where Cecil John Rhodes and other pioneers are buried.</td>', 'This is beautiful, so reminds me of my birthplace in Zimbabwe, a place called World''s View in Zimbabwe, taken from on top of a huge granite outcrop where Cecil John Rhodes and other pioneers are buried.', '2005-11-10 19:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856406, 255121, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great color in your sky. Excellent DOF and sharpness. I would recommend rotating the picture slightly counter clockwise to get a horizontal horizon.</td>', 'Great color in your sky. Excellent DOF and sharpness. I would recommend rotating the picture slightly counter clockwise to get a horizontal horizon.', '2005-11-10 19:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856407, 255294, 40386, '<td valign="top">The odd red tinge that covers the foreground, tree trunks, leaves and benches is too overpowering, a bit unreal?  If this as shot forgive me but it just looks strange.</td>', 'The odd red tinge that covers the foreground, tree trunks, leaves and benches is too overpowering, a bit unreal?  If this as shot forgive me but it just looks strange.', '2005-11-10 19:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856408, 255137, 3306, '<td valign="top">A blue sky would have taken this very nice picture to the next level. Not your fault.</td>', 'A blue sky would have taken this very nice picture to the next level. Not your fault.', '2005-11-10 19:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856410, 255472, 3306, '<td valign="top">nice perspective.</td>', 'nice perspective.', '2005-11-10 19:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856411, 254925, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Criticism; frame is too ''heavy'' for this in my opinion.  Like to see it perhaps ''bigger'' (height obviously), with more ''fore grass'' - just think the size restrictions mean you lose too much for this shot in the Challenge, therefore turn it into a ''different shot'', maybe, depending what you had.  Sure it looks much better ''wider''.</td>', '6 - Criticism; frame is too ''heavy'' for this in my opinion.  Like to see it perhaps ''bigger'' (height obviously), with more ''fore grass'' - just think the size restrictions mean you lose too much for this shot in the Challenge, therefore turn it into a ''different shot'', maybe, depending what you had.  Sure it looks much better ''wider''.', '2005-11-10 19:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856413, 255367, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice effect.  Criticism; perhaps a tighter crop on the left, and more (dependent) on the right, especially for the Challenge.</td>', '6 - Nice effect.  Criticism; perhaps a tighter crop on the left, and more (dependent) on the right, especially for the Challenge.', '2005-11-10 19:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856424, 254816, 28141, '<td valign="top">You get 640 pixels on this site...use them!  I want to see more detail...</td>', 'You get 640 pixels on this site...use them!  I want to see more detail...', '2005-11-10 19:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856467, 255038, 20075, '<td valign="top">Good idea - I think you could have used a little bit of light to brighten up the shadows here.  I think it would still have the effect you want, but here a lot of details are lost.  Might want to play around with ''Levels'' a bit.</td>', 'Good idea - I think you could have used a little bit of light to brighten up the shadows here.  I think it would still have the effect you want, but here a lot of details are lost.  Might want to play around with ''Levels'' a bit.', '2005-11-10 19:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
