(1856504, 255579, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the curls in the hair and the straight lines of the background, and the composition of the face is nice.  Feel free to make your image bigger!  That allows voters to see more detail and more of your pic :-)</td>', 'I like the contrast between the curls in the hair and the straight lines of the background, and the composition of the face is nice.  Feel free to make your image bigger!  That allows voters to see more detail and more of your pic :-)', '2005-11-10 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
