(1856531, 254842, 35513, '<td valign="top">Everything looks to be in focus here and I like that the text on the monument is not centered.  I''m not sure that this meets my ideas of a landscape, though I can see some trees in the reflection of the monument.  The reflection of the clouds looks especially nice and gives some texture to the photo.</td>', 'Everything looks to be in focus here and I like that the text on the monument is not centered.  I''m not sure that this meets my ideas of a landscape, though I can see some trees in the reflection of the monument.  The reflection of the clouds looks especially nice and gives some texture to the photo.', '2005-11-10 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856532, 254295, 40106, '<td valign="top">wowza! the grain/noise looks really rad!  it definitely sets your photo apart from the others! great blue in the sky and i love the cracking of the dry mud.  7</td>', 'wowza! the grain/noise looks really rad!  it definitely sets your photo apart from the others! great blue in the sky and i love the cracking of the dry mud.  7', '2005-11-10 20:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856533, 255524, 35513, '<td valign="top">The stars in this photo came out pretty well!  However, it''s hard to see any detail in the land portion of the pic.  Perhaps a sillhouette of a tree mingled with the stars would be nice for the Landscape theme.</td>', 'The stars in this photo came out pretty well!  However, it''s hard to see any detail in the land portion of the pic.  Perhaps a sillhouette of a tree mingled with the stars would be nice for the Landscape theme.', '2005-11-10 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856538, 254812, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in this photo.  There seems to be some distortion (maybe from compression?) and a little bit of noise in the sky.  The lights on the bridge and the skyscrapers look nice.  I might suggest (if you do a reshoot) moving the photo a little bit to the right to bring the bridge support farther to the left and away from the center of the pic.</td>', 'Very nice colors in this photo.  There seems to be some distortion (maybe from compression?) and a little bit of noise in the sky.  The lights on the bridge and the skyscrapers look nice.  I might suggest (if you do a reshoot) moving the photo a little bit to the right to bring the bridge support farther to the left and away from the center of the pic.', '2005-11-10 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856539, 255587, 40106, '<td valign="top">love the colors in the sky and in the trees.  great clouds.  but the photo seems somewhat dull, in the words of Emeril... "kick it up a notch"</td>', 'love the colors in the sky and in the trees.  great clouds.  but the photo seems somewhat dull, in the words of Emeril... "kick it up a notch"', '2005-11-10 20:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
