(1856758, 254225, 47091, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2005-11-10 21:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856760, 255412, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice shot and effects.  Criticism; the frame may be a touch too ''heavy'' for this scene, in my opinion, not sure.  Like the contrasting ''scapes.</td>', '7 - Nice shot and effects.  Criticism; the frame may be a touch too ''heavy'' for this scene, in my opinion, not sure.  Like the contrasting ''scapes.', '2005-11-10 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856763, 255035, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very pretty landscape and nice composition, however, the color is a little muted - may have been because of the haze, but makes the picture look at blurry and a little dull.  Another day with better lighting and this would be an awesome shot!</td>', 'Very pretty landscape and nice composition, however, the color is a little muted - may have been because of the haze, but makes the picture look at blurry and a little dull.  Another day with better lighting and this would be an awesome shot!', '2005-11-10 21:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856765, 255306, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture - unique.  Exposed a little too much for the light though, to the detriment shadows - the cows are almost non existent.  Exposing towards middle gray would have made this a really cool picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture - unique.  Exposed a little too much for the light though, to the detriment shadows - the cows are almost non existent.  Exposing towards middle gray would have made this a really cool picture.', '2005-11-10 21:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856777, 255224, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - would have been great on a day were there was more color in the sky.  As it stands, the pictures a little gray for me.  I like the composition though - would be fun to see the same comp on different days with different skies.</td>', 'Nice composition - would have been great on a day were there was more color in the sky.  As it stands, the pictures a little gray for me.  I like the composition though - would be fun to see the same comp on different days with different skies.', '2005-11-10 21:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856782, 254516, 40019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  I would have liked to see more detail/color from the tree in the forefront to contrast against the red trees in the valley. Looks like it was a fun hike to get there though!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  I would have liked to see more detail/color from the tree in the forefront to contrast against the red trees in the valley. Looks like it was a fun hike to get there though!', '2005-11-10 21:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856784, 255577, 27770, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the person on the rock gives great perspective</td>', 'Very nice, the person on the rock gives great perspective', '2005-11-10 21:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856786, 255222, 40019, '<td valign="top">This looks familiar!  Nice sharpness on and saturation on the buildings.  Too bad it was foggy, I really love the red/orange glow of the bridge against the green hills and Cityscape.</td>', 'This looks familiar!  Nice sharpness on and saturation on the buildings.  Too bad it was foggy, I really love the red/orange glow of the bridge against the green hills and Cityscape.', '2005-11-10 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856790, 254925, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely landscape.  I like the inclusion of the house.  Too bad the tree on the left blends in so much with the foilage in the background, could have been a nice contrast if it stood out more.  Colors are a little over saturated as well (IMO).</td>', 'Wow, lovely landscape.  I like the inclusion of the house.  Too bad the tree on the left blends in so much with the foilage in the background, could have been a nice contrast if it stood out more.  Colors are a little over saturated as well (IMO).', '2005-11-10 21:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856793, 255039, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - a little underexposed though.</td>', 'Nice picture - a little underexposed though.', '2005-11-10 21:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856798, 254971, 40019, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice area, but this picture''s not representing it too well.  Way underexposed in the foreground - which wouldn''t have been too bad, but you have the two trees included in the shot, not sure why?  May have been a nicer composition if you would have walked up next to the farthest tree and just took a picture of the hillside.  Your automatic exposure would probably have metered the scene better as well.</td>', 'Looks like a nice area, but this picture''s not representing it too well.  Way underexposed in the foreground - which wouldn''t have been too bad, but you have the two trees included in the shot, not sure why?  May have been a nicer composition if you would have walked up next to the farthest tree and just took a picture of the hillside.  Your automatic exposure would probably have metered the scene better as well.', '2005-11-10 21:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856802, 254459, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Good exposure.</td>', 'Lovely.  Good exposure.', '2005-11-10 21:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856804, 255549, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, just a little too blurry and a LOT of noise.</td>', 'Nice picture, just a little too blurry and a LOT of noise.', '2005-11-10 21:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856805, 254571, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  A little dark in some areas, but a lovely site.</td>', 'Great picture.  A little dark in some areas, but a lovely site.', '2005-11-10 21:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856806, 255504, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture.  I would have cropped out a little more of the foreground rocks in favor of the more colorful foilage - but that''s just me. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Lovely picture.  I would have cropped out a little more of the foreground rocks in favor of the more colorful foilage - but that''s just me. <7>', '2005-11-10 21:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856807, 253946, 40019, '<td valign="top">Mystical picture, very cool!</td>', 'Mystical picture, very cool!', '2005-11-10 21:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856808, 255505, 40019, '<td valign="top">Oh wow!  That is totally cool!  What a great sky and capture!  Nice job!</td>', 'Oh wow!  That is totally cool!  What a great sky and capture!  Nice job!', '2005-11-10 21:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856812, 254054, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture - a little underexposed on the left.</td>', 'Lovely picture - a little underexposed on the left.', '2005-11-10 22:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856867, 254041, 19178, '<td valign="top">I think this photo will be criticized because it is so dark.  It would help if there were a single<br/>"white key" somewhere in the photo.  As it is, it looks a bit "muddy."</td>', 'I think this photo will be criticized because it is so dark.  It would help if there were a single"white key" somewhere in the photo.  As it is, it looks a bit "muddy."', '2005-11-10 22:32:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1856876, 253801, 19178, '<td valign="top">Because the shoreline and the buildings are such a strong dividing element in this composition, I think it would  be better if the shoreline were about 1/3 of the way from the top or the bottom of the frame.  Empty skies don''t work too well, so it probably would be better to try having more water and less sky.</td>', 'Because the shoreline and the buildings are such a strong dividing element in this composition, I think it would  be better if the shoreline were about 1/3 of the way from the top or the bottom of the frame.  Empty skies don''t work too well, so it probably would be better to try having more water and less sky.', '2005-11-10 22:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856878, 255565, 31403, '<td valign="top">the overexposed rocks are such a huge presence I can barely look past them to the house</td>', 'the overexposed rocks are such a huge presence I can barely look past them to the house', '2005-11-10 22:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856887, 255284, 19178, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  Breaks the rules -- and works!</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  Breaks the rules -- and works!', '2005-11-10 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856909, 254884, 45802, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2005-11-10 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856914, 254706, 47091, '<td valign="top">Great picture love the fog.</td>', 'Great picture love the fog.', '2005-11-10 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856941, 255412, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice - great exposure!  I like how you were able to capture ''some'' color and not overexpose the shot.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice - great exposure!  I like how you were able to capture ''some'' color and not overexpose the shot.  Nice job.', '2005-11-10 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856948, 255461, 40019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful area, but way over saturated.  The blue tree on the left should have given a hint there was a problem.  Pretty blurry as well.</td>', 'Beautiful area, but way over saturated.  The blue tree on the left should have given a hint there was a problem.  Pretty blurry as well.', '2005-11-10 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856950, 254816, 40019, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice picture, but it''s too small to tell.</td>', 'Looks like a nice picture, but it''s too small to tell.', '2005-11-10 22:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856952, 253893, 31403, '<td valign="top">cropping the railing out would have gotten you another point from me 4</td>', 'cropping the railing out would have gotten you another point from me 4', '2005-11-10 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856956, 255464, 45802, '<td valign="top">Super shot.</td>', 'Super shot.', '2005-11-10 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856957, 255254, 40019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful area. Colors are a little muted.</td>', 'Beautiful area. Colors are a little muted.', '2005-11-10 22:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
