(1856962, 253100, 41520, '<td valign="top">That is cool, but I can''t decide if I like the road or not.  I like how it draws your eye to the background, but it also seems out of place. Nice job</td>', 'That is cool, but I can''t decide if I like the road or not.  I like how it draws your eye to the background, but it also seems out of place. Nice job', '2005-11-10 22:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856963, 254936, 31403, '<td valign="top">there''s some thing sticking into your really cool photo from the left - bet you would have loved to do more editing there - I would.  The windows are very cool, great color and a nice take on the challenge, the dark left side hurts me :-) 6</td>', 'there''s some thing sticking into your really cool photo from the left - bet you would have loved to do more editing there - I would.  The windows are very cool, great color and a nice take on the challenge, the dark left side hurts me :-) 6', '2005-11-10 22:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856964, 255315, 41520, '<td valign="top">Thats cool, where was it taken?<br/></td>', 'Thats cool, where was it taken?', '2005-11-10 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856965, 255187, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I don''t think I have ever seen someone put a water tower and moon together in the same pic.  :-)</td>', 'Interesting.  I don''t think I have ever seen someone put a water tower and moon together in the same pic.  :-)', '2005-11-10 22:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856969, 255121, 41520, '<td valign="top">Where is this? It looks great. I blues are awesome<br/></td>', 'Where is this? It looks great. I blues are awesome', '2005-11-10 22:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856973, 255587, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I would have metered for the trees a little more, to bring out their rich colors.  A polarizing filter would have been good to bring out the sky and clouds a little more.  If you did use one, I would have rotated it a little more.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I would have metered for the trees a little more, to bring out their rich colors.  A polarizing filter would have been good to bring out the sky and clouds a little more.  If you did use one, I would have rotated it a little more.', '2005-11-10 22:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856978, 255541, 41520, '<td valign="top">Wow, where was this taken.  It reminds me of when I went to the Bahamas</td>', 'Wow, where was this taken.  It reminds me of when I went to the Bahamas', '2005-11-10 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856982, 254616, 40019, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great location, but pic is underexposed.</td>', 'Looks like a great location, but pic is underexposed.', '2005-11-10 23:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856983, 254812, 41520, '<td valign="top">Too grainy, it makes the picture hard to focus on, if that makes any sense</td>', 'Too grainy, it makes the picture hard to focus on, if that makes any sense', '2005-11-10 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856986, 254420, 45802, '<td valign="top">I wish the contrast were a bit better. And maybe the saturation.</td>', 'I wish the contrast were a bit better. And maybe the saturation.', '2005-11-10 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856987, 254623, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I''m not sure if that''s fog on the water or just the angle of reflection making it gray.  Nice effect!</td>', 'Interesting. I''m not sure if that''s fog on the water or just the angle of reflection making it gray.  Nice effect!', '2005-11-10 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1856992, 254106, 31403, '<td valign="top">that cloud looks like a sailing ship - bet you had to wait a LONG time for that!<br/> <br/>How''s that for an insightful comment on how to be a better photog?  :-)</td>', 'that cloud looks like a sailing ship - bet you had to wait a LONG time for that! How''s that for an insightful comment on how to be a better photog?  :-)', '2005-11-10 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857004, 254330, 41520, '<td valign="top">That is cool, very nice job.</td>', 'That is cool, very nice job.', '2005-11-10 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857005, 255326, 40019, '<td valign="top">That''s cool - what a funky tree!  Nice capture.  This would have been an interesting shot if you stood back a little further and positioned the tree using the rule of thirds.  I like this - good DOF as well.</td>', 'That''s cool - what a funky tree!  Nice capture.  This would have been an interesting shot if you stood back a little further and positioned the tree using the rule of thirds.  I like this - good DOF as well.', '2005-11-10 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857016, 255313, 45802, '<td valign="top">I wish this weren''t so hazy.</td>', 'I wish this weren''t so hazy.', '2005-11-10 23:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857017, 255229, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice location, a little too much of the hill in silhouette (IMO), most of the picture is just black.</td>', 'Nice location, a little too much of the hill in silhouette (IMO), most of the picture is just black.', '2005-11-10 23:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857018, 254859, 6477, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat image... of a gorgeous place!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Pretty neat image... of a gorgeous place! ', '2005-11-10 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857019, 254600, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it''s a little blurry.</td>', 'Nice composition, but it''s a little blurry.', '2005-11-10 23:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857020, 255400, 40019, '<td valign="top">Outstanding picture!  Colors, texture, flare - awesome! &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Outstanding picture!  Colors, texture, flare - awesome! <10>', '2005-11-10 23:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857021, 253358, 41520, '<td valign="top">I see a flower that grows from the ground, but not the landscape...</td>', 'I see a flower that grows from the ground, but not the landscape...', '2005-11-10 23:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857024, 253790, 45802, '<td valign="top">Too heavy a magenta cast makes the photo seem to murky.</td>', 'Too heavy a magenta cast makes the photo seem to murky.', '2005-11-10 23:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857029, 254689, 5885, '<td valign="top">Good use of color, I do wis the banks had gone to black though</td>', 'Good use of color, I do wis the banks had gone to black though', '2005-11-10 23:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857033, 253300, 5885, '<td valign="top">Don''t ever get to see that here in the South, beautiful and great exposure !0</td>', 'Don''t ever get to see that here in the South, beautiful and great exposure !0', '2005-11-10 23:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857035, 255256, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!  The bird really adds to the whole image - nice capture!</td>', 'Lovely shot!  The bird really adds to the whole image - nice capture!', '2005-11-10 23:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857038, 255565, 41520, '<td valign="top">I like the effect with the light, looks good</td>', 'I like the effect with the light, looks good', '2005-11-10 23:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857040, 254410, 5885, '<td valign="top">They say if you can hold a photo upside down and it''s still good, that it''s a great photo. This one works and the idea is both creative and funny. 10</td>', 'They say if you can hold a photo upside down and it''s still good, that it''s a great photo. This one works and the idea is both creative and funny. 10', '2005-11-10 23:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857042, 255450, 41520, '<td valign="top">Oh, that frame is awesome, great job.</td>', 'Oh, that frame is awesome, great job.', '2005-11-10 23:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857043, 255373, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice try - looks pretty pixelated - especially on the tree tops.  Was this an extreme crop, or just a really low resolution setting?</td>', 'Nice try - looks pretty pixelated - especially on the tree tops.  Was this an extreme crop, or just a really low resolution setting?', '2005-11-10 23:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857044, 254057, 5885, '<td valign="top">Your use of b&amp;w was very appropriate for the mood of this shot in my eyes. Stunning. Good Luck! 10</td>', 'Your use of b&w was very appropriate for the mood of this shot in my eyes. Stunning. Good Luck! 10', '2005-11-10 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857045, 253464, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - would have liked it a little bigger.</td>', 'Nice picture - would have liked it a little bigger.', '2005-11-10 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857047, 253043, 5885, '<td valign="top">The city lights are distracting to me, but overall this is a good composition with excellent color. 8</td>', 'The city lights are distracting to me, but overall this is a good composition with excellent color. 8', '2005-11-10 23:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857050, 254676, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Little vignetting in the upper corners.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Little vignetting in the upper corners.', '2005-11-10 23:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857051, 254112, 11756, '<td valign="top">like the symmetric composition, not sure if it fits as a landscape</td>', 'like the symmetric composition, not sure if it fits as a landscape', '2005-11-10 23:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857053, 255404, 5885, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the castle slightly further into the top left of this photo. Also a polarizer would have been nice for that white sky. Overall, this is a good photo though. 8</td>', 'I''d like to see the castle slightly further into the top left of this photo. Also a polarizer would have been nice for that white sky. Overall, this is a good photo though. 8', '2005-11-10 23:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857054, 254983, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast.  Blue skies and mountains in the bacground look a little weird.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice contrast.  Blue skies and mountains in the bacground look a little weird.  Nice composition.', '2005-11-10 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857058, 254674, 11756, '<td valign="top">El Yunque is great, but you shoulda got to the top or at least drove to the observation tower for a shot.  It''s far better a view there.</td>', 'El Yunque is great, but you shoulda got to the top or at least drove to the observation tower for a shot.  It''s far better a view there.', '2005-11-10 23:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857060, 255432, 5885, '<td valign="top">Good composition, although it may have been stronger without the grass on the near bank. Overall great photo. 9</td>', 'Good composition, although it may have been stronger without the grass on the near bank. Overall great photo. 9', '2005-11-10 23:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857061, 255472, 11756, '<td valign="top">love the wide dof.  stunning</td>', 'love the wide dof.  stunning', '2005-11-10 23:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857062, 255623, 11756, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition</td>', 'great colors and composition', '2005-11-10 23:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857064, 254612, 5885, '<td valign="top">Red filter? Love the contrast and composition and the choice of black &amp; white works really well. 10. Great work.</td>', 'Red filter? Love the contrast and composition and the choice of black & white works really well. 10. Great work.', '2005-11-10 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857065, 253040, 11756, '<td valign="top">woops too bright for your lens given the artifacts at the top right</td>', 'woops too bright for your lens given the artifacts at the top right', '2005-11-10 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857068, 255232, 40019, '<td valign="top">Looks like you found the prettiest subject in the picture to focus on.  Unfortunately, I think you are in for some steep competition here.  A similar composition of a flower in a park may have been a better choice.</td>', 'Looks like you found the prettiest subject in the picture to focus on.  Unfortunately, I think you are in for some steep competition here.  A similar composition of a flower in a park may have been a better choice.', '2005-11-10 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857069, 254248, 40019, '<td valign="top">Classic reflection picture - nicely done.</td>', 'Classic reflection picture - nicely done.', '2005-11-10 23:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857071, 254015, 5885, '<td valign="top">I wish you could have kept that mountain from washing out at the top. Not sure if a polarizer would have helped or not though. Overall great pic. 9</td>', 'I wish you could have kept that mountain from washing out at the top. Not sure if a polarizer would have helped or not though. Overall great pic. 9', '2005-11-10 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857073, 254593, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great picture! (Got the subject!) Love the texture in the clouds!</td>', 'Great picture! (Got the subject!) Love the texture in the clouds!', '2005-11-10 23:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857074, 254015, 11756, '<td valign="top">the top is overexposed.  I woulda cut that part out as it detraccts from a otherwise nice scene</td>', 'the top is overexposed.  I woulda cut that part out as it detraccts from a otherwise nice scene', '2005-11-10 23:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857075, 255224, 5885, '<td valign="top">I wish the ground in front of the tree were completely blacked out. Otherwise this is stunningly beautiful. Great work. 9</td>', 'I wish the ground in front of the tree were completely blacked out. Otherwise this is stunningly beautiful. Great work. 9', '2005-11-10 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857078, 255039, 5885, '<td valign="top">I like how you let the curve of the beach arch off the shot. Good composition. I would''ve liked to seen the horizon a little higher into the top third of the photo, but overall the shot is beautiful. 9</td>', 'I like how you let the curve of the beach arch off the shot. Good composition. I would''ve liked to seen the horizon a little higher into the top third of the photo, but overall the shot is beautiful. 9', '2005-11-10 23:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857079, 253011, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, however the sky looks a weird - not sure if you tried something in Photoshop or what.</td>', 'Nice capture, however the sky looks a weird - not sure if you tried something in Photoshop or what.', '2005-11-10 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857083, 255476, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Looks like a great neighborhood to live in!  I''d love to make this my Sunday morning walk - nicely done.</td>', 'Nice capture!  Looks like a great neighborhood to live in!  I''d love to make this my Sunday morning walk - nicely done.', '2005-11-10 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857084, 254873, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job on bringing out the colors - very cool!</td>', 'Wow, great job on bringing out the colors - very cool!', '2005-11-10 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857085, 253735, 5885, '<td valign="top">Sure that''s not a painting? :-) I''d love to see this as a large print. Looks beautiful. Perhaps a crop into a panorama would have strengthened the composition some. 9</td>', 'Sure that''s not a painting? :-) I''d love to see this as a large print. Looks beautiful. Perhaps a crop into a panorama would have strengthened the composition some. 9', '2005-11-10 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857087, 254345, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, wish that was my backyard!  :-)   Nice picture.</td>', 'Wow, wish that was my backyard!  :-)   Nice picture.', '2005-11-10 23:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857088, 255529, 5885, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a landscape, not exactly in focus.</td>', 'Not exactly a landscape, not exactly in focus.', '2005-11-10 23:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857091, 255589, 5885, '<td valign="top">Why can''t I walk out my door and see scenes like that? It''s just not fair I tell ya. Great shot. 10</td>', 'Why can''t I walk out my door and see scenes like that? It''s just not fair I tell ya. Great shot. 10', '2005-11-10 23:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
