(1857209, 253087, 20075, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, but lacks a definite subject.  My eyes are drawn to the barn, because it''s bright red and in an otherwise "empty" part of the photo, but then they get pulled down to the trees at the bottom because there are just so many of them.  I think if this shot were composed a bit differently, it would work.  I do like your attempt to do something out of the ordinary by shooting a landscape vertically, though.</td>', 'Pretty colors, but lacks a definite subject.  My eyes are drawn to the barn, because it''s bright red and in an otherwise "empty" part of the photo, but then they get pulled down to the trees at the bottom because there are just so many of them.  I think if this shot were composed a bit differently, it would work.  I do like your attempt to do something out of the ordinary by shooting a landscape vertically, though.', '2005-11-11 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
