(1857504, 255284, 44751, '<td valign="top">Nailed! 9.</td>', 'Nailed! 9.', '2005-11-11 06:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857505, 255156, 27440, '<td valign="top">I haven''t seen all the photographs so far but I think none will be so fantastic. It''s not just that the view is so breath taking,it''s that this shot combines both line - shape composition and colour composition.  The roof of the house provides  a nice transition to the background which very strongly corresponds to the direction the fence provides. It''s like from the first plane the fence is leading us strait to the middle plain. In the middle plain there is the house which leads us to the background.<br/> <br/>All the colours are of similar saturation and it seems that the scene almost completely fits the "exposure range" ( don''t know the english word ).<br/> <br/>I could go on and on - I am so amazed by this shot.<br/> <br/>I give it a definite 10.</td>', 'I haven''t seen all the photographs so far but I think none will be so fantastic. It''s not just that the view is so breath taking,it''s that this shot combines both line - shape composition and colour composition.  The roof of the house provides  a nice transition to the background which very strongly corresponds to the direction the fence provides. It''s like from the first plane the fence is leading us strait to the middle plain. In the middle plain there is the house which leads us to the background. All the colours are of similar saturation and it seems that the scene almost completely fits the "exposure range" ( don''t know the english word ). I could go on and on - I am so amazed by this shot. I give it a definite 10.', '2005-11-11 06:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857506, 255253, 44860, '<td valign="top">Telezoom lens could help here.</td>', 'Telezoom lens could help here.', '2005-11-11 06:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857508, 254410, 44860, '<td valign="top">Up side down? On purpose?</td>', 'Up side down? On purpose?', '2005-11-11 06:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857510, 254612, 27440, '<td valign="top">I like the view point. The white crest of the wave gives so much dynamic.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like it the post processing. I can see that this was done to emphasize thw water but in the process balance was lost. It has beed over done.  I think that you chose a place where these waves are not random. It seems that they re-appear. You could have taken adventage of having a digital camera and you could have studied the subject more thoroughly. In this case a film camera would be better, as it would force you to think about the scene while making the shot not after. <br/> <br/>It''s a 7</td>', 'I like the view point. The white crest of the wave gives so much dynamic. What I don''t like it the post processing. I can see that this was done to emphasize thw water but in the process balance was lost. It has beed over done.  I think that you chose a place where these waves are not random. It seems that they re-appear. You could have taken adventage of having a digital camera and you could have studied the subject more thoroughly. In this case a film camera would be better, as it would force you to think about the scene while making the shot not after.  It''s a 7', '2005-11-11 06:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857511, 253788, 44751, '<td valign="top">Don''t you love our Australia!!!!!  Well done.  That''s a 9 from me.</td>', 'Don''t you love our Australia!!!!!  Well done.  That''s a 9 from me.', '2005-11-11 06:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857512, 255307, 44751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great colour in the tree.  Stunning composition. 8.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great colour in the tree.  Stunning composition. 8.', '2005-11-11 06:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857514, 253300, 44860, '<td valign="top">I am rating al least fourth similiar photo of green polar lights. High as usual :)...9</td>', 'I am rating al least fourth similiar photo of green polar lights. High as usual :)...9', '2005-11-11 06:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857519, 255492, 20330, '<td valign="top">unusual...</td>', 'unusual...', '2005-11-11 06:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857521, 255307, 27440, '<td valign="top">A nice composition of a tree and an (aqueduct?), however the crop is a bit tight to the left of the tree. <br/> <br/>You decided to make a colour photograph but to me the shot lacks colour composition. It seems as if you focused on the shape and didn''t think of colours. I can see both saturated rich colours ( so vivid and saturated that they hurt my eyes ) and pastel colours. This composition gives me a feel of contrast and dynamics but at the same time the object composition gives me a strong feeling of peace and order.  I don''t know exactely which way should I interpret. <br/> <br/>This shot would have gone down way better with only pastels<br/> <br/>I think that this is beacuse of the post processing. Maybe my monitor doesn''t display it they way it should. <br/> <br/>Don''t take my comment as "This is a bad image" On the contrary  I like it. It just lacks one  component. I like everything about this image ... but the colours :) <br/> <br/>It''s a 7 from me.</td>', 'A nice composition of a tree and an (aqueduct?), however the crop is a bit tight to the left of the tree.  You decided to make a colour photograph but to me the shot lacks colour composition. It seems as if you focused on the shape and didn''t think of colours. I can see both saturated rich colours ( so vivid and saturated that they hurt my eyes ) and pastel colours. This composition gives me a feel of contrast and dynamics but at the same time the object composition gives me a strong feeling of peace and order.  I don''t know exactely which way should I interpret.  This shot would have gone down way better with only pastels I think that this is beacuse of the post processing. Maybe my monitor doesn''t display it they way it should.  Don''t take my comment as "This is a bad image" On the contrary  I like it. It just lacks one  component. I like everything about this image ... but the colours :)  It''s a 7 from me.', '2005-11-11 06:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857523, 255313, 20330, '<td valign="top">beautiful! looks like a view from the parkway. love all the fall colors... 9</td>', 'beautiful! looks like a view from the parkway. love all the fall colors... 9', '2005-11-11 06:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
