(1857529, 255371, 27440, '<td valign="top">A very nice silhouette shot.  One thing I don''t like is the black cloud. You could have either changed the view distance or croped that cloud out. It gives me a feeling of constraint where the whole image shows me peace and freedome.<br/> <br/>It''s a 7</td>', 'A very nice silhouette shot.  One thing I don''t like is the black cloud. You could have either changed the view distance or croped that cloud out. It gives me a feeling of constraint where the whole image shows me peace and freedome. It''s a 7', '2005-11-11 06:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
