(1857681, 255492, 12827, '<td valign="top">Landscape to me is all about the natural environment.  Some editing is just fine, but I feel this is a bit much.  I would really like to see this unedited!  Because I''m sure that it is an excellent pic.</td>', 'Landscape to me is all about the natural environment.  Some editing is just fine, but I feel this is a bit much.  I would really like to see this unedited!  Because I''m sure that it is an excellent pic.', '2005-11-11 08:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857685, 254973, 12827, '<td valign="top">Exposure, contrast, or something seems a little off here.  It''s difficult to form an opinion because there is no detail.  Shadows are black and the highlights are blown.</td>', 'Exposure, contrast, or something seems a little off here.  It''s difficult to form an opinion because there is no detail.  Shadows are black and the highlights are blown.', '2005-11-11 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1857688, 255529, 12827, '<td valign="top">It''s a little small, and because of that it seems, or maybe it is, out of focus.<br/>I''m not seeing the landscape either.</td>', 'It''s a little small, and because of that it seems, or maybe it is, out of focus.I''m not seeing the landscape either.', '2005-11-11 08:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
