(1858082, 255275, 37858, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color and lines.  The tree works well too.  One of my favorite shots this week.</td>', 'Excellent use of color and lines.  The tree works well too.  One of my favorite shots this week.', '2005-11-11 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858084, 253771, 36397, '<td valign="top">The middle part of the picture is relatively dominant and doesn''t contain much interestig structures. The mountain top is however spectacular and the reflections as well.</td>', 'The middle part of the picture is relatively dominant and doesn''t contain much interestig structures. The mountain top is however spectacular and the reflections as well.', '2005-11-11 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858088, 254247, 36397, '<td valign="top">Picture looks a bit oversaturated. Nice reflections maybe a little lack of depth.</td>', 'Picture looks a bit oversaturated. Nice reflections maybe a little lack of depth.', '2005-11-11 12:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858094, 253776, 36397, '<td valign="top">Uncommon landscape but in that respect also very interesting.  The house is very prominent and draws the eye a bit too much imo. The windmills are the interesting part.</td>', 'Uncommon landscape but in that respect also very interesting.  The house is very prominent and draws the eye a bit too much imo. The windmills are the interesting part.', '2005-11-11 12:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858102, 255402, 35739, '<td valign="top">Too much orange, plus the composition of the image is not striking too me.  Perhaps just a image of the town and what appears to be a river below would have been better. IMO</td>', 'Too much orange, plus the composition of the image is not striking too me.  Perhaps just a image of the town and what appears to be a river below would have been better. IMO', '2005-11-11 12:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858110, 253991, 33732, '<td valign="top">Just perfecto even in this small file.   I like the colors but the trees are not brilliant.  Maybe not late enough for those bright colors.  Good luck.  This should be top 5.  Maybe higher.</td>', 'Just perfecto even in this small file.   I like the colors but the trees are not brilliant.  Maybe not late enough for those bright colors.  Good luck.  This should be top 5.  Maybe higher.', '2005-11-11 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858111, 254373, 35739, '<td valign="top">Sorry!  I really do not know what to say about this image.  It does not belong here in this challenge.</td>', 'Sorry!  I really do not know what to say about this image.  It does not belong here in this challenge.', '2005-11-11 12:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858115, 253300, 33732, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal at the least.  Thanks for sharing.  This must be intense light since the start did not streak.  The crop is great.  It is nice to see the foreground for size prespective.</td>', 'Phenomenal at the least.  Thanks for sharing.  This must be intense light since the start did not streak.  The crop is great.  It is nice to see the foreground for size prespective.', '2005-11-11 12:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858117, 253252, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very attractive.  One of the top.  I see it has been validated.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very attractive.  One of the top.  I see it has been validated.  Good luck.', '2005-11-11 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858121, 255225, 33732, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Your moon is impressive.  I thought about a moon shot low on the horizon but opted to do some else.  Good luck.  I rate this high.</td>', 'This is great.  Your moon is impressive.  I thought about a moon shot low on the horizon but opted to do some else.  Good luck.  I rate this high.', '2005-11-11 12:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858126, 255284, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very clean and attractive.  Less is more?</td>', 'Very clean and attractive.  Less is more?', '2005-11-11 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858127, 255536, 33732, '<td valign="top">Location?  A lot of sky but it has detail.  Very dramatic.  The clouds have 3D.  Top 10 to me.</td>', 'Location?  A lot of sky but it has detail.  Very dramatic.  The clouds have 3D.  Top 10 to me.', '2005-11-11 13:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858130, 255524, 35739, '<td valign="top">I have wanted to do this shot, however yours is not very appealing.  I think if there was something to reference the sky too like a partually lighted house or something.  The lower section of the image is very dark.  If there was something there perhaps it would be better.  IMO</td>', 'I have wanted to do this shot, however yours is not very appealing.  I think if there was something to reference the sky too like a partually lighted house or something.  The lower section of the image is very dark.  If there was something there perhaps it would be better.  IMO', '2005-11-11 13:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858131, 254508, 33732, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I am not sure about the tall grass up front.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I am not sure about the tall grass up front.', '2005-11-11 13:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858133, 255558, 33732, '<td valign="top">Color combo is nice.  Clouds are a little over.</td>', 'Color combo is nice.  Clouds are a little over.', '2005-11-11 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
