(1858135, 255565, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but not the quality of the image.  It is too bright on the rocks, too yellow and appears to be oversharpened.  I like the cropping of this image and I do not like the frame you added.  Take this shot again.  It is a nice area.</td>', 'I like the composition but not the quality of the image.  It is too bright on the rocks, too yellow and appears to be oversharpened.  I like the cropping of this image and I do not like the frame you added.  Take this shot again.  It is a nice area.', '2005-11-11 13:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858136, 255319, 33732, '<td valign="top">The color is good on the leaves.  The sky seems off.</td>', 'The color is good on the leaves.  The sky seems off.', '2005-11-11 13:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858137, 255579, 35739, '<td valign="top">Landscape?  Nice looking model.</td>', 'Landscape?  Nice looking model.', '2005-11-11 13:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
