(1858149, 255588, 33732, '<td valign="top">Second look.  Darker would help.  Faster shutter maybe.  DOF seems good.  Thanks for getting this photo for us.</td>', 'Second look.  Darker would help.  Faster shutter maybe.  DOF seems good.  Thanks for getting this photo for us.', '2005-11-11 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
