(1858261, 255371, 40019, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Outstanding shot!  This HAS to be near the top, if not ribbon.  Love the silhouette of the trees and the dark framing created by the clouds and ground.  Great exposure, with minimal noise in the lower right corner.  Very cool! &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'WOW!  Outstanding shot!  This HAS to be near the top, if not ribbon.  Love the silhouette of the trees and the dark framing created by the clouds and ground.  Great exposure, with minimal noise in the lower right corner.  Very cool! <10>', '2005-11-11 13:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858262, 254681, 38549, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. love the trees, that is the main point, good focus and composition.</td>', 'This is a great shot. love the trees, that is the main point, good focus and composition.', '2005-11-11 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858265, 253791, 38549, '<td valign="top">Hey i was just there not too long ago, i like the color and composition, good shot.</td>', 'Hey i was just there not too long ago, i like the color and composition, good shot.', '2005-11-11 13:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858266, 254485, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Good detail in the reflection of the sun.  I would have liked to seen the exposure one stop up, just to see more detail in the clouds.  Did you bracket this picture? Perhaps one stop up created too much glare from the sun.</td>', 'Nicely done!  Good detail in the reflection of the sun.  I would have liked to seen the exposure one stop up, just to see more detail in the clouds.  Did you bracket this picture? Perhaps one stop up created too much glare from the sun.', '2005-11-11 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
