(1858284, 254704, 28141, '<td valign="top">I think for this type of shot to work it needs to be very crisp, but here the moon is a little fuzzy and there''s some blue haze over the mountains and a lot of noise in the sky.  All that distracts and detracts from what would otherwise be a nice subtle scene (the composition is good).</td>', 'I think for this type of shot to work it needs to be very crisp, but here the moon is a little fuzzy and there''s some blue haze over the mountains and a lot of noise in the sky.  All that distracts and detracts from what would otherwise be a nice subtle scene (the composition is good).', '2005-11-11 14:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
