(1858355, 255529, 34481, '<td valign="top">Your composition would be helped if you did not center the flower right in the middle of the frame.  Also the on-camera flash is a bit harsh.  You might try it with natural light and a tripod.  Keep at it.</td>', 'Your composition would be helped if you did not center the flower right in the middle of the frame.  Also the on-camera flash is a bit harsh.  You might try it with natural light and a tripod.  Keep at it.', '2005-11-11 14:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858358, 254372, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the color and composition very much, but there''s something unsettling about the rather jagged edges on the stumps.  I''m not sure if this is a resolution thing or oversharpening or what, but it hurts what could be an excellent photo.</td>', 'I like the color and composition very much, but there''s something unsettling about the rather jagged edges on the stumps.  I''m not sure if this is a resolution thing or oversharpening or what, but it hurts what could be an excellent photo.', '2005-11-11 14:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858359, 255547, 34481, '<td valign="top">I think your composition would have been helped if the fences were seen at an angle.  Also, the colors in the trees don''t look quite natural.</td>', 'I think your composition would have been helped if the fences were seen at an angle.  Also, the colors in the trees don''t look quite natural.', '2005-11-11 14:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
