(1858365, 255227, 42100, '<td valign="top">The sunrays coming over the top of the hills are very beautiful.  The strong sun at this angle has taken all the detail out of the hills and sky.  Perhaps a composition that enhanced what is happening at the valley near the sunrays.</td>', 'The sunrays coming over the top of the hills are very beautiful.  The strong sun at this angle has taken all the detail out of the hills and sky.  Perhaps a composition that enhanced what is happening at the valley near the sunrays.', '2005-11-11 14:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
