(1858378, 255355, 42100, '<td valign="top">Know this location well, looks like the bison weren''t grazing when you took this.  Or the maybe they were just camera shy that day.  I like the the setup with the interstate in the photo, but a position that eliminated the foreground evergreens would of been nicer.</td>', 'Know this location well, looks like the bison weren''t grazing when you took this.  Or the maybe they were just camera shy that day.  I like the the setup with the interstate in the photo, but a position that eliminated the foreground evergreens would of been nicer.', '2005-11-11 14:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
