(1858450, 254852, 5885, '<td valign="top">I like that some people are still using good black and white technique with digital. Yours is a great example of a skilled black and white photographer with a digital camera. 10</td>', 'I like that some people are still using good black and white technique with digital. Yours is a great example of a skilled black and white photographer with a digital camera. 10', '2005-11-11 15:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
