(1858465, 255367, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice soft picture with rich colors, I like it.</td>', 'Nice soft picture with rich colors, I like it.', '2005-11-11 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858466, 255156, 24846, '<td valign="top">I believe you captured the the essence of landscape here. Great how the fence pulls you down and in the image. So much to see. You did a wonderful job with the colors too. The only nit pick is the angle between the sky and peaks, it just gives me a slight off feeling. Good job and good luck with this masterful work. -10-</td>', 'I believe you captured the the essence of landscape here. Great how the fence pulls you down and in the image. So much to see. You did a wonderful job with the colors too. The only nit pick is the angle between the sky and peaks, it just gives me a slight off feeling. Good job and good luck with this masterful work. -10-', '2005-11-11 15:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858467, 254326, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like Eastern Washington. Could this be the Colorado river? Wonderful open territory in that part of the state....</td>', 'looks like Eastern Washington. Could this be the Colorado river? Wonderful open territory in that part of the state....', '2005-11-11 15:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858468, 254104, 17507, '<td valign="top">great exposure, colors, and composition - I expect to see this finish near the top.</td>', 'great exposure, colors, and composition - I expect to see this finish near the top.', '2005-11-11 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858473, 254681, 24846, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite "panorama" from the challenge. Love the orange trees, wish the 1st had the top covered. Great capture, good luck. -10-</td>', 'This is my favorite "panorama" from the challenge. Love the orange trees, wish the 1st had the top covered. Great capture, good luck. -10-', '2005-11-11 15:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858476, 253836, 24846, '<td valign="top">The light pulls me right in the image. Like the framing with the trunks, great colors too. Great capture and good luck. -10-</td>', 'The light pulls me right in the image. Like the framing with the trunks, great colors too. Great capture and good luck. -10-', '2005-11-11 15:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858477, 254661, 17507, '<td valign="top">I too submitted an urban scene, and though I like the picture, its score is poor... granted, the literal definition of a landscape involves NATURE not MAN-MADE subjects - so you and I both turned the challenge description on its head. good perhaps from a conceptual standpoint, if not a scoring standpoint! good luck in the rankings - perhaps yours is doing better than mine. WRT the photo itself, I think a bit of sharpening to enhance the clarity of all the windows would have made this photo pop a lot more and generally improve its impact.</td>', 'I too submitted an urban scene, and though I like the picture, its score is poor... granted, the literal definition of a landscape involves NATURE not MAN-MADE subjects - so you and I both turned the challenge description on its head. good perhaps from a conceptual standpoint, if not a scoring standpoint! good luck in the rankings - perhaps yours is doing better than mine. WRT the photo itself, I think a bit of sharpening to enhance the clarity of all the windows would have made this photo pop a lot more and generally improve its impact.', '2005-11-11 15:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858478, 255348, 32609, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. It looks almost fake. Too bad the clouds weren''t a little sharper and more interesting. Did you mean for the title to be quiet instead of quite?</td>', 'This is awesome. It looks almost fake. Too bad the clouds weren''t a little sharper and more interesting. Did you mean for the title to be quiet instead of quite?', '2005-11-11 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858479, 253043, 24846, '<td valign="top">Best of the "icelanders" Great colors with just the twinge of green. Great capure, good luck. -10-</td>', 'Best of the "icelanders" Great colors with just the twinge of green. Great capure, good luck. -10-', '2005-11-11 15:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858480, 252571, 32609, '<td valign="top">Looks a little washed out from the color of the light but I love the composition!</td>', 'Looks a little washed out from the color of the light but I love the composition!', '2005-11-11 15:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858481, 255451, 5885, '<td valign="top">One of the best submission of the Aurora borealis 10</td>', 'One of the best submission of the Aurora borealis 10', '2005-11-11 15:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
