(1858585, 254705, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors! Interesting framing, although the bare tree seems a little too prominent in the picture (IMO).</td>', 'Nice rich colors! Interesting framing, although the bare tree seems a little too prominent in the picture (IMO).', '2005-11-11 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858587, 253011, 36397, '<td valign="top">Overexposure in the sky, too bad because the structures in the clouds are nice.</td>', 'Overexposure in the sky, too bad because the structures in the clouds are nice.', '2005-11-11 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858589, 255623, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome!  Love the rich colors!  Great framing with the dark cloud and ground.  Sole tree adds scale - very nicely done! &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Wow, awesome!  Love the rich colors!  Great framing with the dark cloud and ground.  Sole tree adds scale - very nicely done! <9>', '2005-11-11 16:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858594, 255260, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!  Right side is a little dark though - looks like you might have burned it in a little (too much). IMO</td>', 'Nice composition!  Right side is a little dark though - looks like you might have burned it in a little (too much). IMO', '2005-11-11 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858597, 252558, 40019, '<td valign="top">Landscape with lines may be a better title, as the juxaposition of the lines (wires, grass, horizon) is pretty interesting.  Those white dots you call sheep could have been boulders from what I can see.  :-)  A little saturation to add some color would be cool.</td>', 'Landscape with lines may be a better title, as the juxaposition of the lines (wires, grass, horizon) is pretty interesting.  Those white dots you call sheep could have been boulders from what I can see.  :-)  A little saturation to add some color would be cool.', '2005-11-11 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858598, 255472, 40019, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - nicely done!</td>', 'Gorgeous - nicely done!', '2005-11-11 16:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858600, 255450, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool framing!  I wish there were more color in the picture (maybe on a better day).</td>', 'Cool framing!  I wish there were more color in the picture (maybe on a better day).', '2005-11-11 16:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858603, 255577, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!  Love the rich colors, DOF, shutter effect.  I''m still thinking about whether or not I like the person in red in the shot - can''t decide if it detracts from the picture, or adds a sense of wanting to be there.  Nice picture overall though.</td>', 'Very nice picture!  Love the rich colors, DOF, shutter effect.  I''m still thinking about whether or not I like the person in red in the shot - can''t decide if it detracts from the picture, or adds a sense of wanting to be there.  Nice picture overall though.', '2005-11-11 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1858608, 255158, 40019, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture!</td>', 'Gorgeous picture!', '2005-11-11 16:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
