(1858682, 255450, 29474, '<td valign="top">Although I can see what you are trying to do with the positioning of the cross, I think it would have been better in the space just above or below where it is now.</td>', 'Although I can see what you are trying to do with the positioning of the cross, I think it would have been better in the space just above or below where it is now.', '2005-11-11 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
