(1858711, 253991, 37893, '<td valign="top">Holy crap! The color contrast in this image is phenomenal. I''m not too fond of over sharpening but it really works for this image. I''ll give you an 11. Ok so 10 is the highest I can go :)</td>', 'Holy crap! The color contrast in this image is phenomenal. I''m not too fond of over sharpening but it really works for this image. I''ll give you an 11. Ok so 10 is the highest I can go :)', '2005-11-11 17:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
