(1859106, 255306, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hmm hmm, where could this be. The bridge loos familiar. Is this anywhere near Ransdorp, just North of Amsterdam? There is this kind of bridge where you can jump with your motorcycle on a very small road in the ''polderland''.<br/> <br/>The contrast/light is a bit strange. While the view is nice to cows deserve more exposure attention. I like it how you positioned the bridge to contain what could be one of the two skyscrapers in Amsterdam.<br/> <br/>Have you seen the Amsterdam GTG discussion yet? Check the Out and About forum.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hmm hmm, where could this be. The bridge loos familiar. Is this anywhere near Ransdorp, just North of Amsterdam? There is this kind of bridge where you can jump with your motorcycle on a very small road in the ''polderland''. The contrast/light is a bit strange. While the view is nice to cows deserve more exposure attention. I like it how you positioned the bridge to contain what could be one of the two skyscrapers in Amsterdam. Have you seen the Amsterdam GTG discussion yet? Check the Out and About forum.   ', '2005-11-11 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
