(1859144, 255133, 40718, '<td valign="top">Mmm, the old Golden Triangle from Mt. Washington.  I''ve done many shots from here, but I have to say the two entered in this challenge are superior to anything I''ve been able to pull off.  You caught a nice light on this one.</td>', 'Mmm, the old Golden Triangle from Mt. Washington.  I''ve done many shots from here, but I have to say the two entered in this challenge are superior to anything I''ve been able to pull off.  You caught a nice light on this one.', '2005-11-11 20:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
