(1859174, 254955, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Wow.  Very nice contrast of landscapes.  Criticism; not much, mostly the sky detracts in my opinion in this shot.  Whether you were able to adjust it (contrast etc) not sure, but perhaps an even tighter crop (less sky) would have made this a better shot in my opinion, although I realize you''d lose some ''context''.  Like the shadow play on the dunes and mountains, but wonder if just a fraction more ''lightness'' overall, possibly showing some more of the green in the mountains may have also made it better.  Perhaps even more of the fore ''plain'' too, especially if cropping out more sky, not sure, who knows.  Good shot.</td>', '8 - Wow.  Very nice contrast of landscapes.  Criticism; not much, mostly the sky detracts in my opinion in this shot.  Whether you were able to adjust it (contrast etc) not sure, but perhaps an even tighter crop (less sky) would have made this a better shot in my opinion, although I realize you''d lose some ''context''.  Like the shadow play on the dunes and mountains, but wonder if just a fraction more ''lightness'' overall, possibly showing some more of the green in the mountains may have also made it better.  Perhaps even more of the fore ''plain'' too, especially if cropping out more sky, not sure, who knows.  Good shot.', '2005-11-11 20:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859215, 254570, 44172, '<td valign="top">oh! I''d be curious to know where this is specifically - I''ve lived in different ares of Hudson Valley for several years now, I certainly like the colors, nice work :)</td>', 'oh! I''d be curious to know where this is specifically - I''ve lived in different ares of Hudson Valley for several years now, I certainly like the colors, nice work :)', '2005-11-11 20:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859218, 254816, 44172, '<td valign="top">oh - sooo pretty, but, and you''re probably sick of hearing it - (too small) - seems like a lovely capture of that moving water - from what I can make out :)</td>', 'oh - sooo pretty, but, and you''re probably sick of hearing it - (too small) - seems like a lovely capture of that moving water - from what I can make out :)', '2005-11-11 20:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
