(1859227, 253358, 44172, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel this fits the challenge - perhaps if it were shown in a nice landscaped garden, the bud in the background is a bit distracting as is the white at the bottom, it could be a little clearer also - but I love the color and the drops of water (I think that''s what that is) - a very nice image of a pretty flower - wish I could sniff it :)</td>', 'I don''t feel this fits the challenge - perhaps if it were shown in a nice landscaped garden, the bud in the background is a bit distracting as is the white at the bottom, it could be a little clearer also - but I love the color and the drops of water (I think that''s what that is) - a very nice image of a pretty flower - wish I could sniff it :)', '2005-11-11 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859229, 255137, 36988, '<td valign="top">beautiful comp highlighted by magnificent color and warm almost surreal feel... very well done and a top10 in my opinion... :)</td>', 'beautiful comp highlighted by magnificent color and warm almost surreal feel... very well done and a top10 in my opinion... :)', '2005-11-11 21:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859232, 254054, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice scene/landscape.  Criticism; just seems it needs a bit of a ''boost'', somehow, especially with the reds/yellows, not sure.</td>', '7 - Nice scene/landscape.  Criticism; just seems it needs a bit of a ''boost'', somehow, especially with the reds/yellows, not sure.', '2005-11-11 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859258, 253913, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Great shot.  Criticism; difficult as I am not sure how you did this nor the time of day it was, and am certainly no expert in lighting, but would like to have been able to discern more ''color'' in the volcano/mountain.  Also to see the ''river'' enhanced more, ''somehow'', even just the color, would have been great.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the left, incorporating a fraction more on the right (dependent of course what is there), may have made this even better in my opinion.  Certainly unique in the Challenge.  As for a ''true landscape'', again no expert on that, but sure comes close, just ''different'' in my opinion.   edit: post challenge - you fooled me - I had no idea - but I just learnt more about long exposure - thanks<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-16 00:33:08.</i></td>', '8 - Great shot.  Criticism; difficult as I am not sure how you did this nor the time of day it was, and am certainly no expert in lighting, but would like to have been able to discern more ''color'' in the volcano/mountain.  Also to see the ''river'' enhanced more, ''somehow'', even just the color, would have been great.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the left, incorporating a fraction more on the right (dependent of course what is there), may have made this even better in my opinion.  Certainly unique in the Challenge.  As for a ''true landscape'', again no expert on that, but sure comes close, just ''different'' in my opinion.   edit: post challenge - you fooled me - I had no idea - but I just learnt more about long exposure - thanks', '2005-11-11 21:15:59.000000', '2005-11-16 00:33:08.000000', 1),
(1859269, 253836, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice scene.  One that is easy to imagine as a painting.  Criticism; to really nit-pick, those 2 extra pixels would have made a difference (this is only 638).  Perhaps a slightly different ''choice'' of crop (if possible), not sure.  Colors tweaked slightly to get them a little richer, may have also made this better in my opinion, however I am sure that is difficult with the shadows and color of the house/shed, and the ''blow out'' issues that would result.</td>', '8 - Very nice scene.  One that is easy to imagine as a painting.  Criticism; to really nit-pick, those 2 extra pixels would have made a difference (this is only 638).  Perhaps a slightly different ''choice'' of crop (if possible), not sure.  Colors tweaked slightly to get them a little richer, may have also made this better in my opinion, however I am sure that is difficult with the shadows and color of the house/shed, and the ''blow out'' issues that would result.', '2005-11-11 21:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859274, 253932, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice scene.  Criticism; undecided, but likely would prefer it with more height, especially with the road/lines, but realize you were probably going for this framing, just that the 640w restrictions do not do justice to this shot.  Nice colors, and as mentioned, like the ''lines'' and use of them.</td>', '7 - Nice scene.  Criticism; undecided, but likely would prefer it with more height, especially with the road/lines, but realize you were probably going for this framing, just that the 640w restrictions do not do justice to this shot.  Nice colors, and as mentioned, like the ''lines'' and use of them.', '2005-11-11 21:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859277, 253893, 44172, '<td valign="top">nice title, the reflection in this image is very good, the colors seem a little drab to me (just my taste) perhaps they could have been brightened a little bit more in editing and I would have cropped the bottom off - perhaps this is straight out of the camera though and it does meet the challenge :)</td>', 'nice title, the reflection in this image is very good, the colors seem a little drab to me (just my taste) perhaps they could have been brightened a little bit more in editing and I would have cropped the bottom off - perhaps this is straight out of the camera though and it does meet the challenge :)', '2005-11-11 21:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859280, 255412, 44172, '<td valign="top">wow! post card or national geographic quality image - I want to be able to take images like this - nice work :)</td>', 'wow! post card or national geographic quality image - I want to be able to take images like this - nice work :)', '2005-11-11 21:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859285, 254754, 44172, '<td valign="top">Wow! the portrait out my kitchen window is my neighbor''s crappy siding, great idea framing your landscape image in such a manner :)</td>', 'Wow! the portrait out my kitchen window is my neighbor''s crappy siding, great idea framing your landscape image in such a manner :)', '2005-11-11 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1859287, 255409, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Ok, the clouds and sky look amazing, colors are nice and rich, but, criticism; whilst no expert on ''Landscapes'', to me this is more about the sky, and there is not enough ''land'' (or even land/ocean) incorporated in this shot.  A sharper perspective perhaps, ground up, not sure, may have made this a better shot for the Challenge.  Down to 5 from 6 on ''review'', based on my above comments and learning of ''landscapes'', tough call for this Challenge.</td>', '5 - Ok, the clouds and sky look amazing, colors are nice and rich, but, criticism; whilst no expert on ''Landscapes'', to me this is more about the sky, and there is not enough ''land'' (or even land/ocean) incorporated in this shot.  A sharper perspective perhaps, ground up, not sure, may have made this a better shot for the Challenge.  Down to 5 from 6 on ''review'', based on my above comments and learning of ''landscapes'', tough call for this Challenge.', '2005-11-11 21:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859315, 255373, 46056, '<td valign="top">This photo comes up on my screen as very pixilated, I''m afraid.  Perhaps there was a problem when you resized it?</td>', 'This photo comes up on my screen as very pixilated, I''m afraid.  Perhaps there was a problem when you resized it?', '2005-11-11 21:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859333, 255156, 46056, '<td valign="top">Like a picture postcard - stunning!  I''m giving you a 10 =;-)</td>', 'Like a picture postcard - stunning!  I''m giving you a 10 =;-)', '2005-11-11 21:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859340, 255049, 44086, '<td valign="top">Very serene image. Your buildings have a green cast to them. Maybe run a color correction? IMHO</td>', 'Very serene image. Your buildings have a green cast to them. Maybe run a color correction? IMHO', '2005-11-11 22:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859392, 253033, 47277, '<td valign="top">I like it.  As a beginner I''d like to hear how you took the shot and processed it.   Some may not like the light effects, but I do.</td>', 'I like it.  As a beginner I''d like to hear how you took the shot and processed it.   Some may not like the light effects, but I do.', '2005-11-11 22:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859395, 253324, 47277, '<td valign="top">The settting looks like it had a lot of potential, but a close miss IMO.  Maybe not enough gray tones.   Sorry, until I get a little better at this that''s all I can offer.</td>', 'The settting looks like it had a lot of potential, but a close miss IMO.  Maybe not enough gray tones.   Sorry, until I get a little better at this that''s all I can offer.', '2005-11-11 22:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859396, 254998, 47277, '<td valign="top">I like the title.  Colors are very nice</td>', 'I like the title.  Colors are very nice', '2005-11-11 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859397, 254328, 45776, '<td valign="top">Your sensor might need cleaning.</td>', 'Your sensor might need cleaning.', '2005-11-11 22:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859399, 254057, 45776, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but very low contrast.</td>', 'Good shot, but very low contrast.', '2005-11-11 22:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859400, 255524, 34309, '<td valign="top">what the...?</td>', 'what the...?', '2005-11-11 22:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859401, 255395, 45776, '<td valign="top">Good shot composition, but the focus looks a bit soft, and it seems a bit underexposed.</td>', 'Good shot composition, but the focus looks a bit soft, and it seems a bit underexposed.', '2005-11-11 22:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859402, 255561, 45776, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! But the focus seems kind soft all around.</td>', 'I love this shot! But the focus seems kind soft all around.', '2005-11-11 22:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859403, 255494, 45776, '<td valign="top">Good job on getting the color.</td>', 'Good job on getting the color.', '2005-11-11 22:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859407, 255150, 45776, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but it looks like you may have had the same problem I did. The wind moved the leaves and made them blurry, and makes the whole picture look out of focus. It may be benefited from rotating it about 1.5 degrees to the left, too.</td>', 'I like this shot, but it looks like you may have had the same problem I did. The wind moved the leaves and made them blurry, and makes the whole picture look out of focus. It may be benefited from rotating it about 1.5 degrees to the left, too.', '2005-11-11 22:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859409, 254998, 45776, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but could it have been bigger?</td>', 'Great shot, but could it have been bigger?', '2005-11-11 22:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859410, 254687, 45776, '<td valign="top">Very evocative, I like it.</td>', 'Very evocative, I like it.', '2005-11-11 22:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859412, 255186, 45776, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of lines!</td>', 'Awesome use of lines!', '2005-11-11 22:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859413, 255388, 45776, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, looks kind of grainy or underexposed to me though.</td>', 'This is a great shot, looks kind of grainy or underexposed to me though.', '2005-11-11 22:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859414, 254936, 47277, '<td valign="top">Hard for me to comment on the photographic quality, but I gave this a high rating because I could hang it on my wall.   I really like your eye.  Just a beginner, would appreciate more info on filters/processing.</td>', 'Hard for me to comment on the photographic quality, but I gave this a high rating because I could hang it on my wall.   I really like your eye.  Just a beginner, would appreciate more info on filters/processing.', '2005-11-11 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859415, 255446, 45776, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, good choice on the tone and composition.</td>', 'Amazing shot, good choice on the tone and composition.', '2005-11-11 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859416, 255260, 45776, '<td valign="top">What happened to the right side of the photo?</td>', 'What happened to the right side of the photo?', '2005-11-11 22:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859418, 252968, 45776, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, borders a bit thick for my taste but I''m not taking off for that. I would have loved to see this in color.</td>', 'Love this shot, borders a bit thick for my taste but I''m not taking off for that. I would have loved to see this in color.', '2005-11-11 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859420, 255573, 45776, '<td valign="top">I love shots with leading lines, may be pushing the landscape category a bit though.</td>', 'I love shots with leading lines, may be pushing the landscape category a bit though.', '2005-11-11 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859422, 254939, 45776, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus.</td>', 'Very soft focus.', '2005-11-11 22:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859423, 255404, 45776, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2005-11-11 22:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859425, 254936, 45776, '<td valign="top">Love it, simply love it.</td>', 'Love it, simply love it.', '2005-11-11 22:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859426, 253358, 45776, '<td valign="top">This isn''t landscape at all.</td>', 'This isn''t landscape at all.', '2005-11-11 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859428, 253913, 45776, '<td valign="top">What is this? I like it though, I just wish I could figure out what it is.</td>', 'What is this? I like it though, I just wish I could figure out what it is.', '2005-11-11 22:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859429, 254409, 34309, '<td valign="top">There is something i really like about this photo but dont really know what it is.<br/>But i like it a lot:)</td>', 'There is something i really like about this photo but dont really know what it is.But i like it a lot:)', '2005-11-11 22:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859431, 253735, 45776, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, good sharpness, very good capture of evocative lightning, good composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, good sharpness, very good capture of evocative lightning, good composition.', '2005-11-11 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859432, 255587, 45776, '<td valign="top">This shot is kind of boring, I can see trees anywhere.</td>', 'This shot is kind of boring, I can see trees anywhere.', '2005-11-11 22:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859433, 255439, 47277, '<td valign="top">Sometimes shots with everything out of focus work for me.  This one close, but not quite.  Would have liked a different perspective also, to frame your human subjects against the vast openness a little better.  I can sense it, but can''t quite see it.</td>', 'Sometimes shots with everything out of focus work for me.  This one close, but not quite.  Would have liked a different perspective also, to frame your human subjects against the vast openness a little better.  I can sense it, but can''t quite see it.', '2005-11-11 22:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859437, 253252, 45776, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did it, says it was validated so that''s amazing.</td>', 'I don''t know how you did it, says it was validated so that''s amazing.', '2005-11-11 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859440, 255376, 47277, '<td valign="top">You got a few points just because I don''t have one of those near me.  Hard to beat pastoral serenity, interesting architecture, nice color and a little mist.  Looks very quiet there.</td>', 'You got a few points just because I don''t have one of those near me.  Hard to beat pastoral serenity, interesting architecture, nice color and a little mist.  Looks very quiet there.', '2005-11-11 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859442, 255486, 34309, '<td valign="top">This is nice but you definitely should have cloned out the light brownish thing in the middle of the picture. It stands out so the attention is drawn to this plant more than the water. Other that that i this it''s a grat picture.</td>', 'This is nice but you definitely should have cloned out the light brownish thing in the middle of the picture. It stands out so the attention is drawn to this plant more than the water. Other that that i this it''s a grat picture.', '2005-11-11 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859443, 254137, 45776, '<td valign="top">This would have been great with a little bit more contrast.</td>', 'This would have been great with a little bit more contrast.', '2005-11-11 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859451, 254955, 45776, '<td valign="top">Bravo, Coleridge wouldn''t have pictured a better place for his Xanadu.</td>', 'Bravo, Coleridge wouldn''t have pictured a better place for his Xanadu.', '2005-11-11 22:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859453, 255319, 34309, '<td valign="top">I love it!! The colours are great. Another one of my favourites:)</td>', 'I love it!! The colours are great. Another one of my favourites:)', '2005-11-11 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859455, 254987, 34309, '<td valign="top">Nice one!! I think slowing down the shutter speed would add more interest to the water. Well done;)</td>', 'Nice one!! I think slowing down the shutter speed would add more interest to the water. Well done;)', '2005-11-11 23:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859456, 254328, 47277, '<td valign="top">As a novice, I''m loathe to criticize, but hey you can dismiss it cause I don''t know what I''m talking about.   For me, landscapes need either bright color, sharp detail, majestic grandeur, or intriguing contrast.  This looks like an interesting setting, but didn''t capture any of those for me.  Not a bomb (I can''t bring myself to be overly critical of anyone that''s probably a better photographer than myself), just not that eyecatching.</td>', 'As a novice, I''m loathe to criticize, but hey you can dismiss it cause I don''t know what I''m talking about.   For me, landscapes need either bright color, sharp detail, majestic grandeur, or intriguing contrast.  This looks like an interesting setting, but didn''t capture any of those for me.  Not a bomb (I can''t bring myself to be overly critical of anyone that''s probably a better photographer than myself), just not that eyecatching.', '2005-11-11 23:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859460, 255409, 32239, '<td valign="top">Striking image.</td>', 'Striking image.', '2005-11-11 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859462, 255482, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice yellow leaves</td>', 'nice yellow leaves', '2005-11-11 23:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859464, 254053, 32239, '<td valign="top">Lovely Autumn and country scene.  Good composition.</td>', 'Lovely Autumn and country scene.  Good composition.', '2005-11-11 23:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859465, 253271, 34309, '<td valign="top">I love it!!</td>', 'I love it!!', '2005-11-11 23:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859468, 255391, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2005-11-11 23:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859469, 255509, 32239, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Love the warm, yellow sky...</td>', 'Very nice capture. Love the warm, yellow sky...', '2005-11-11 23:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859473, 255414, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice composition n colors</td>', 'nice composition n colors', '2005-11-11 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859475, 253100, 34309, '<td valign="top">This is soooo interesting. I just want to keep looking at this picture all day long.<br/>i wonder how long was the exposure.</td>', 'This is soooo interesting. I just want to keep looking at this picture all day long.i wonder how long was the exposure.', '2005-11-11 23:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859476, 253498, 32239, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours and good composition; however, it''s fuzzy, and could use a point or two of clarity to give it more depth.</td>', 'Nice bright colours and good composition; however, it''s fuzzy, and could use a point or two of clarity to give it more depth.', '2005-11-11 23:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859477, 254409, 43546, '<td valign="top">cool pic</td>', 'cool pic', '2005-11-11 23:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859478, 254485, 47277, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome setting.</td>', 'Wow, awesome setting.', '2005-11-11 23:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859479, 255124, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice view and DOF</td>', 'nice view and DOF', '2005-11-11 23:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859480, 254410, 32239, '<td valign="top">Is this purposelly supposed to be upside down? O.o</td>', 'Is this purposelly supposed to be upside down? O.o', '2005-11-11 23:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859482, 255062, 32239, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!  Where was this taken?? It reminds me of paradise!</td>', 'Breathtaking!  Where was this taken?? It reminds me of paradise!', '2005-11-11 23:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859483, 255284, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice reflection</td>', 'nice reflection', '2005-11-11 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859484, 253190, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful rich colors!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderful rich colors!  Nicely done.', '2005-11-11 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859486, 255180, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-11-11 23:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859488, 253252, 32239, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but the  blown out white spot on the top is distracting.</td>', 'Lovely, but the  blown out white spot on the top is distracting.', '2005-11-11 23:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859490, 255041, 43546, '<td valign="top">cool dof.. nice shot</td>', 'cool dof.. nice shot', '2005-11-11 23:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859491, 255561, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interesting blur.</td>', 'Nice colors and interesting blur.', '2005-11-11 23:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859493, 255435, 32239, '<td valign="top">The colours of the trees and the dreary sky in this image brings me down. Seems really oversharpened and grainy as well.<br/> <br/>Nice composition though.</td>', 'The colours of the trees and the dreary sky in this image brings me down. Seems really oversharpened and grainy as well. Nice composition though.', '2005-11-11 23:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859495, 254754, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Can I come and visit?!  :-)</td>', 'Wow!  Can I come and visit?!  :-)', '2005-11-11 23:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859496, 255294, 43546, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2005-11-11 23:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859497, 254859, 32239, '<td valign="top">Wow! One of my favourites thus far!  Great composition and nice exposure.</td>', 'Wow! One of my favourites thus far!  Great composition and nice exposure.', '2005-11-11 23:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859500, 255467, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Looks like a poster.</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Looks like a poster.', '2005-11-11 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859501, 254966, 47277, '<td valign="top">Man I''d love to go duck hunting again.  Haven''t been in 30 years.  However, I''d hazard a guess that your title cost you a few points with the antihunting folks.  As for the picture, not quite enough contrast or visual variation across the scene to satisfy my preferences in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Man I''d love to go duck hunting again.  Haven''t been in 30 years.  However, I''d hazard a guess that your title cost you a few points with the antihunting folks.  As for the picture, not quite enough contrast or visual variation across the scene to satisfy my preferences in B&W.', '2005-11-11 23:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859502, 253932, 43546, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2005-11-11 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859505, 253991, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, love the rich colors.  Looks a tad bit too sharpened on the tops of the trees, but not points off for that - great picture.</td>', 'Wow, love the rich colors.  Looks a tad bit too sharpened on the tops of the trees, but not points off for that - great picture.', '2005-11-11 23:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859506, 253893, 32239, '<td valign="top">Good reflection, but no real bright colours to stand out and grab your attention, you know?  Perhaps this shot taken a couple of weeks earlier, when the leaves are in prime colour?  The trees also appear to either be oversharpened/grainy, or out of focus.</td>', 'Good reflection, but no real bright colours to stand out and grab your attention, you know?  Perhaps this shot taken a couple of weeks earlier, when the leaves are in prime colour?  The trees also appear to either be oversharpened/grainy, or out of focus.', '2005-11-11 23:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859507, 255423, 40019, '<td valign="top">Twin Peaks?  Nice conversion - made the picture interesting.</td>', 'Twin Peaks?  Nice conversion - made the picture interesting.', '2005-11-11 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859509, 255360, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the creative border!</td>', 'Nice.  I like the creative border!', '2005-11-11 23:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859510, 255091, 47277, '<td valign="top">I guess if I was a technically schooled photographer I could find something to criticize, but I just like this mood.  Very nice.</td>', 'I guess if I was a technically schooled photographer I could find something to criticize, but I just like this mood.  Very nice.', '2005-11-11 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859511, 253836, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors.  Looks like a painting - nicely done.</td>', 'Nice rich colors.  Looks like a painting - nicely done.', '2005-11-11 23:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859514, 255275, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting natural color gamut - don''t see that too often - I like this.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting natural color gamut - don''t see that too often - I like this.  Nice composition.', '2005-11-11 23:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859516, 255409, 40019, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors!</td>', 'Lovely colors!', '2005-11-11 23:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859519, 255426, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Bummer about the sign and phone lines.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Bummer about the sign and phone lines.', '2005-11-11 23:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859522, 252702, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I just wish it were a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I just wish it were a little sharper.', '2005-11-11 23:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859525, 254498, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  A little over-exposed though.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  A little over-exposed though.', '2005-11-11 23:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859526, 254916, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ah, the classic GGB shot!  Looks like you got a beautiful night for it!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Ah, the classic GGB shot!  Looks like you got a beautiful night for it!  Nicely done!', '2005-11-11 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859529, 254295, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Looks like an album/CD cover.  Nicely titled.</td>', 'Interesting.  Looks like an album/CD cover.  Nicely titled.', '2005-11-11 23:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859531, 254387, 40019, '<td valign="top">Way over-exposed.  These types of shots are usually nice when you can see the deep rich colors of the leafs and grass.</td>', 'Way over-exposed.  These types of shots are usually nice when you can see the deep rich colors of the leafs and grass.', '2005-11-11 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859534, 255391, 34309, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place. Well captured!!</td>', 'What a beautiful place. Well captured!!', '2005-11-11 23:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859535, 253358, 47277, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  I guess one could envision the terrain of any well textured object as a "landscape" of the object itself, but that stretches my imagination just a bit.</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  I guess one could envision the terrain of any well textured object as a "landscape" of the object itself, but that stretches my imagination just a bit.', '2005-11-11 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859539, 255225, 34309, '<td valign="top">The mountains are out of focus. I find this picture rather empty.<br/>The moon adds a nice feature to it.</td>', 'The mountains are out of focus. I find this picture rather empty.The moon adds a nice feature to it.', '2005-11-11 23:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859543, 255587, 47277, '<td valign="top">It is beautiful countryside, but the picture needed something to draw my eye.</td>', 'It is beautiful countryside, but the picture needed something to draw my eye.', '2005-11-11 23:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859556, 255494, 47277, '<td valign="top">I really like it; simple, effective.</td>', 'I really like it; simple, effective.', '2005-11-11 23:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1859558, 255035, 47277, '<td valign="top">Needs some texture, IMO</td>', 'Needs some texture, IMO', '2005-11-11 23:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
