(1859620, 255348, 36299, '<td valign="top">Dynamic.  The colours in the living dead plant match those, but for an octave, those of the mountain.  Brilliant capture.  The textures snow enhances this capture.  Snow vs land, cloud vs sky, plant vs rock.  Just grand. 9</td>', 'Dynamic.  The colours in the living dead plant match those, but for an octave, those of the mountain.  Brilliant capture.  The textures snow enhances this capture.  Snow vs land, cloud vs sky, plant vs rock.  Just grand. 9', '2005-11-12 00:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
