(1860220, 254295, 10515, '<td valign="top">I like the mood or lack of mood you created in editing.  Is this just basic editing? i</td>', 'I like the mood or lack of mood you created in editing.  Is this just basic editing? i', '2005-11-12 10:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
