(1861506, 255371, 19066, '<td valign="top">What I really like about this photo is that it hurts to stare it it because of the sun.  It''s a perfect representation of staring into brilliant sunset -- beautiful, but somewhat painful.  I think it would be more effective, though, if you cropped the 1/2 inch or so of dark clouds from the top.</td>', 'What I really like about this photo is that it hurts to stare it it because of the sun.  It''s a perfect representation of staring into brilliant sunset -- beautiful, but somewhat painful.  I think it would be more effective, though, if you cropped the 1/2 inch or so of dark clouds from the top.', '2005-11-12 23:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861513, 253264, 19066, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but too pixelated... Perhaps something went awry in "optimizing" it for the web?</td>', 'Nice shot but too pixelated... Perhaps something went awry in "optimizing" it for the web?', '2005-11-13 00:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
