(1861553, 255371, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed sunset. Use of telephoto to make a large sun in the sky always works well for a sunset. The reds were a little overprocessed as evidenced by the reddish hue in the branches of the trees.</td>', 'Well composed sunset. Use of telephoto to make a large sun in the sky always works well for a sunset. The reds were a little overprocessed as evidenced by the reddish hue in the branches of the trees.', '2005-11-13 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861554, 255549, 36462, '<td valign="top">focus is of</td>', 'focus is of', '2005-11-13 00:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861557, 253021, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and a decent composition with good clouds in the sky. Colors seem on the dull side and the clouds are overexposed. Focus is soft for an image with so much fine detail. These type images, as you wil see with others in this challenge, are exceptionally difficult to get good sharpness.</td>', 'Nice idea and a decent composition with good clouds in the sky. Colors seem on the dull side and the clouds are overexposed. Focus is soft for an image with so much fine detail. These type images, as you wil see with others in this challenge, are exceptionally difficult to get good sharpness.', '2005-11-13 00:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861561, 255158, 44172, '<td valign="top">one of my highest votes and probably a top 5 favorite for this challenge - love it in B&amp;W. love the mistiness, just stunning - nice work :)<br/>(adding to favorites)</td>', 'one of my highest votes and probably a top 5 favorite for this challenge - love it in B&W. love the mistiness, just stunning - nice work :)(adding to favorites)', '2005-11-13 00:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861562, 255496, 44172, '<td valign="top">I love this image, very nice composition, the quality is just superb - I don''t know if it comes out of the camera like this, or is it editing, but I truly wish to be able to create work like this.  Top 5 favorite for this challenge - Adding to favorites :)</td>', 'I love this image, very nice composition, the quality is just superb - I don''t know if it comes out of the camera like this, or is it editing, but I truly wish to be able to create work like this.  Top 5 favorite for this challenge - Adding to favorites :)', '2005-11-13 00:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861564, 255412, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptional seascape. Your highlighting works very well and the slower shutterspeed (or noise reduction) used for soft focus on the ocean surface is nice.</td>', 'Exceptional seascape. Your highlighting works very well and the slower shutterspeed (or noise reduction) used for soft focus on the ocean surface is nice.', '2005-11-13 00:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861567, 255400, 44172, '<td valign="top">wow - you just don''t see this around here - and I can truly appreciate that alone as well as the quality, coloring, smoothness and detail, stunning image - great job :)</td>', 'wow - you just don''t see this around here - and I can truly appreciate that alone as well as the quality, coloring, smoothness and detail, stunning image - great job :)', '2005-11-13 00:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861569, 254295, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting twist on a lanscape for this challenge. Use of grain to emphasize the desolation of the scene is a good idea that works well. There is a bend toward smooth neat imaged landscapes to do well so expect some voters to give this a lowere score. They will view the grain as coverup for a poor quality image. The light haloing around the big tree at left of center is a big of a distraction in this fine concept.</td>', 'Interesting twist on a lanscape for this challenge. Use of grain to emphasize the desolation of the scene is a good idea that works well. There is a bend toward smooth neat imaged landscapes to do well so expect some voters to give this a lowere score. They will view the grain as coverup for a poor quality image. The light haloing around the big tree at left of center is a big of a distraction in this fine concept.', '2005-11-13 00:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861571, 254445, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good composition. Contrast is low and colors seem weak.</td>', 'Good idea, good composition. Contrast is low and colors seem weak.', '2005-11-13 00:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861573, 254225, 5792, '<td valign="top">Color, composition, focus and overall image quality are far better tha most images in this challenge. Horizon is not level which is a distraction to this high quality photograph.</td>', 'Color, composition, focus and overall image quality are far better tha most images in this challenge. Horizon is not level which is a distraction to this high quality photograph.', '2005-11-13 00:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
