(1861588, 255586, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Nice work on the subject. This photo really says something. The colors are amazing for such a desolate looking photo. I do think that the sharpness could be improved considerably and possibly a different angle to isolate the central tree.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Nice work on the subject. This photo really says something. The colors are amazing for such a desolate looking photo. I do think that the sharpness could be improved considerably and possibly a different angle to isolate the central tree.', '2005-11-13 01:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861589, 255360, 43671, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2005-11-13 01:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861592, 255486, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Wow! Great water shot, and excellent composition with the rocks in the water. The bushes in front are very distracting though, and it would probably look better without them. If you have a copy, I''d like to see one after the challenge voting is over. Nice work.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Composition: 1/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Wow! Great water shot, and excellent composition with the rocks in the water. The bushes in front are very distracting though, and it would probably look better without them. If you have a copy, I''d like to see one after the challenge voting is over. Nice work.', '2005-11-13 01:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861594, 254846, 43671, '<td valign="top">Narly tree! nice shot 10</td>', 'Narly tree! nice shot 10', '2005-11-13 01:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861595, 255318, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>Awesome! Is that moss on the water or what? Where is this?<br/> <br/>Nice work on the photo. It''s too bad the sky had to be so bright. Also, not sure what f-stop, but the foreground right looks a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 Awesome! Is that moss on the water or what? Where is this? Nice work on the photo. It''s too bad the sky had to be so bright. Also, not sure what f-stop, but the foreground right looks a bit out of focus.', '2005-11-13 01:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
