(1861627, 254932, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>The panoramic is nice, but too small for many voters on this site. Even though you took full advantage of the 640 width, the panoramic makes it so short that details are few and far between. I''m not trying to discourage you from shooting panoramas, as this is a great shot. But if you look in the top 10 photos for practically any challenge, none of them are panoramas. Just something to think about for future challenges.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 The panoramic is nice, but too small for many voters on this site. Even though you took full advantage of the 640 width, the panoramic makes it so short that details are few and far between. I''m not trying to discourage you from shooting panoramas, as this is a great shot. But if you look in the top 10 photos for practically any challenge, none of them are panoramas. Just something to think about for future challenges.', '2005-11-13 01:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
