(1861644, 253790, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 0/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Aerial shot. Interesting. The angle makes it look as though it is crooked, and the shadows are extremely dark. The tint seems a bit unnatural, and the haze too distracting, making the picture have too soft of a feel.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 0/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Aerial shot. Interesting. The angle makes it look as though it is crooked, and the shadows are extremely dark. The tint seems a bit unnatural, and the haze too distracting, making the picture have too soft of a feel.', '2005-11-13 01:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
