(1861799, 252970, 34481, '<td valign="top">I think the composition could be improved by cropping the top of the picture near the top of the palms, making it close to square.  I love the contrasting dark foreground and the beautiful blue of the ocean and sky.  Of course cloning out the lines would help clean it up as well if this were allowed in the rules.</td>', 'I think the composition could be improved by cropping the top of the picture near the top of the palms, making it close to square.  I love the contrasting dark foreground and the beautiful blue of the ocean and sky.  Of course cloning out the lines would help clean it up as well if this were allowed in the rules.', '2005-11-13 07:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
