(1861838, 253392, 45316, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2005-11-13 08:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861863, 254485, 19978, '<td valign="top">What is that? If that''s a badly sensor bloomed sunset than for shame. If it''s a rocket launch from the Cape or Vandenburg, than bravo! I can''t wait to read the note on this image.</td>', 'What is that? If that''s a badly sensor bloomed sunset than for shame. If it''s a rocket launch from the Cape or Vandenburg, than bravo! I can''t wait to read the note on this image.', '2005-11-13 09:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861868, 254612, 44268, '<td valign="top">The shadows are very dark, the highlights bright... conventionally speaking I''d say this is too contrasty, but it does have a strong impact here.</td>', 'The shadows are very dark, the highlights bright... conventionally speaking I''d say this is too contrasty, but it does have a strong impact here.', '2005-11-13 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861883, 255167, 39664, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Your DOF is off making the b/g too soft.  The only thing in focus is the tree on the left and it really doesn''t add anything to this shot.  In my opinion, for what it is worth, this beautiful scenery would have been best captured if you moved to the left and concentrated on the lake and the trees across from it because they are making lovely reflections on the water and this foreground you have now is just not that appealing.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Your DOF is off making the b/g too soft.  The only thing in focus is the tree on the left and it really doesn''t add anything to this shot.  In my opinion, for what it is worth, this beautiful scenery would have been best captured if you moved to the left and concentrated on the lake and the trees across from it because they are making lovely reflections on the water and this foreground you have now is just not that appealing.', '2005-11-13 10:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861888, 255488, 39664, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors and  nice refections.  Focus is a bit soft and  composition too centered.</td>', 'Pretty colors and  nice refections.  Focus is a bit soft and  composition too centered.', '2005-11-13 10:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861896, 255620, 39664, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t much sky in this photo.....more like the night reflections of those buildings.  I like the three stars.  IMHO, if you would have cropped the entire right 1/3rd out or left 1/3rd, making the 3 stars your focal point and not centered, this would have been more effective.  Where is this, BTW?</td>', 'There really isn''t much sky in this photo.....more like the night reflections of those buildings.  I like the three stars.  IMHO, if you would have cropped the entire right 1/3rd out or left 1/3rd, making the 3 stars your focal point and not centered, this would have been more effective.  Where is this, BTW?', '2005-11-13 10:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861901, 255423, 39664, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this is so lovely....very Amsel Adams-ish. My eye is drawn to the structure thing on the hill in the b/g, then I notice the cars and buildings.  I wish those things weren''t there and this would truely emulate Adams.</td>', 'At first glance, this is so lovely....very Amsel Adams-ish. My eye is drawn to the structure thing on the hill in the b/g, then I notice the cars and buildings.  I wish those things weren''t there and this would truely emulate Adams.', '2005-11-13 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861904, 254815, 39664, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus and the clouds have midtones (reddish/purplish noise) coming through.  I think your composition is all wrong because the only thing is sharp focus is the bush on the right.  The border adds nothing but another distraction to the photo.<br/> <br/>Such a lovely site but technically, this could have been a lot better.</td>', 'Very soft focus and the clouds have midtones (reddish/purplish noise) coming through.  I think your composition is all wrong because the only thing is sharp focus is the bush on the right.  The border adds nothing but another distraction to the photo. Such a lovely site but technically, this could have been a lot better.', '2005-11-13 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861905, 255048, 29474, '<td valign="top">A well taken photograph, but not a landscape. It is about the car and owner(?) and not the beautiful countryside.</td>', 'A well taken photograph, but not a landscape. It is about the car and owner(?) and not the beautiful countryside.', '2005-11-13 10:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861906, 254618, 29474, '<td valign="top">This must be gibun. I like the colours and the framing. Not sure that it exactly conforms to the challenge. But then I''m strict about things like that.</td>', 'This must be gibun. I like the colours and the framing. Not sure that it exactly conforms to the challenge. But then I''m strict about things like that.', '2005-11-13 10:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861907, 255294, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very bright and  hot fall colors here against such a blue sky.  I think you need to back off the saturation a bit....your orange is bleeding into your midtones in the sky in a halo effect all around the two tress, especially more evident on the left and right corners where the skies and clouds meet the background.</td>', 'Wow!  Very bright and  hot fall colors here against such a blue sky.  I think you need to back off the saturation a bit....your orange is bleeding into your midtones in the sky in a halo effect all around the two tress, especially more evident on the left and right corners where the skies and clouds meet the background.', '2005-11-13 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861908, 255091, 29474, '<td valign="top">The framing really works. Without it I think that this would be bland and uninteresting.</td>', 'The framing really works. Without it I think that this would be bland and uninteresting.', '2005-11-13 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
