(1861921, 255318, 39664, '<td valign="top">-1 for spelling! Sorry, the teacher in me came out!  :-)<br/> <br/>Cool photo.  Everything looks pretty good until you get to your sky and it is too bright with too much digital noise in your midtones (see purple and reddish cast?)  I also think the rock formation sloping off the right in the foreground is a bit distracting from the colors of the green slimy stuff and the beautiful Autumn colors on the trees.  If you could have just gotten the river/pond/swamp? and trees  and worked out the white balance and digital noise in your sky, this would have (IMHO) been a great shot.</td>', '-1 for spelling! Sorry, the teacher in me came out!  :-) Cool photo.  Everything looks pretty good until you get to your sky and it is too bright with too much digital noise in your midtones (see purple and reddish cast?)  I also think the rock formation sloping off the right in the foreground is a bit distracting from the colors of the green slimy stuff and the beautiful Autumn colors on the trees.  If you could have just gotten the river/pond/swamp? and trees  and worked out the white balance and digital noise in your sky, this would have (IMHO) been a great shot.', '2005-11-13 10:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1861922, 255315, 43671, '<td valign="top">sweet shot.Good luck</td>', 'sweet shot.Good luck', '2005-11-13 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
