(1861931, 252558, 39664, '<td valign="top">Sheep.  Not sheeps.  The black border detracts from this shot.  The colors are lovely, soft and muted.  The horizon divides this shot in half, which isn''t good composition but I really like the fence, grasses and hill and the smattering of sheep.</td>', 'Sheep.  Not sheeps.  The black border detracts from this shot.  The colors are lovely, soft and muted.  The horizon divides this shot in half, which isn''t good composition but I really like the fence, grasses and hill and the smattering of sheep.', '2005-11-13 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
