(1862496, 255558, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of the long, skinny format, but is there any way you could have made the picture larger?  It''s hard to pick out all the detail.</td>', 'I really like the use of the long, skinny format, but is there any way you could have made the picture larger?  It''s hard to pick out all the detail.', '2005-11-13 17:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862497, 254498, 35545, '<td valign="top">With all of the deal trees and branches in the foreground, it''s hard to see the wetlands.</td>', 'With all of the deal trees and branches in the foreground, it''s hard to see the wetlands.', '2005-11-13 17:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862498, 254373, 43565, '<td valign="top">Watch out for fingers (or other things that can get in front of the lens).   It''s good that the snowman is not in the center of the shot--that helps add interest.  Try to keep the horizon line, in this case the street, level.  That is quite a snowman since it doesn''t look like there was a lot of snow to work with!</td>', 'Watch out for fingers (or other things that can get in front of the lens).   It''s good that the snowman is not in the center of the shot--that helps add interest.  Try to keep the horizon line, in this case the street, level.  That is quite a snowman since it doesn''t look like there was a lot of snow to work with!', '2005-11-13 17:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862504, 255549, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in focus.</td>', 'Needs to be in focus.', '2005-11-13 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
