(1862511, 253836, 35545, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great depth of field, but I son''t think the tree trunk in the right front really adds much to the composition.  It overwhelms the house in the valley.</td>', 'Wow.  Great depth of field, but I son''t think the tree trunk in the right front really adds much to the composition.  It overwhelms the house in the valley.', '2005-11-13 17:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862514, 255568, 35545, '<td valign="top">Kennebunkport?  I think I get what you were trying to do with the foliage in the foreground, but it really doesn''t add to the picture.  I''d get rid of it.</td>', 'Kennebunkport?  I think I get what you were trying to do with the foliage in the foreground, but it really doesn''t add to the picture.  I''d get rid of it.', '2005-11-13 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862521, 253682, 24546, '<td valign="top">I love the beautiful clouds on this one.  Pretty setting.  My only suggestion for improvement would have been the use of the rule of thirds. I wish that the horizon line had followed more closely on the lower horizontal thirds line.</td>', 'I love the beautiful clouds on this one.  Pretty setting.  My only suggestion for improvement would have been the use of the rule of thirds. I wish that the horizon line had followed more closely on the lower horizontal thirds line.', '2005-11-13 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862522, 255588, 24546, '<td valign="top">Pretty cityscape.</td>', 'Pretty cityscape.', '2005-11-13 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862523, 253358, 24546, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower photo - in a different challenge I would vote this higher. But it does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely flower photo - in a different challenge I would vote this higher. But it does not meet the challenge.', '2005-11-13 17:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862524, 253663, 42574, '<td valign="top">Would be a bit nicer if the image were larger.</td>', 'Would be a bit nicer if the image were larger.', '2005-11-13 17:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862525, 255156, 24546, '<td valign="top">Very nice work - lovely leading line with the fence and road leading us through the photo.</td>', 'Very nice work - lovely leading line with the fence and road leading us through the photo.', '2005-11-13 17:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862528, 255227, 24546, '<td valign="top">There is no detail any where in this shot - not in the sky, not in the hills, not in the foreground.</td>', 'There is no detail any where in this shot - not in the sky, not in the hills, not in the foreground.', '2005-11-13 17:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862532, 254345, 24546, '<td valign="top">Pretty fall colors against a beautiful blue sky.  I could wish that this were an advanced challenge or that you had taken a couple of steps forward so we did no have the branches in the upper left corner.</td>', 'Pretty fall colors against a beautiful blue sky.  I could wish that this were an advanced challenge or that you had taken a couple of steps forward so we did no have the branches in the upper left corner.', '2005-11-13 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862533, 253891, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is very artistic.  I like the use of lighting on the cliffs here, but I wish that we had more detail in the lower left corner. Since this was a Basic Editing Challenge, the use of a ND gradient filter when shooting would have given you more detail in the shadows.</td>', 'This is very artistic.  I like the use of lighting on the cliffs here, but I wish that we had more detail in the lower left corner. Since this was a Basic Editing Challenge, the use of a ND gradient filter when shooting would have given you more detail in the shadows.', '2005-11-13 17:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862536, 253495, 24546, '<td valign="top">Very pretty fall shot.  Water is nicely blurred - colors are lovely..</td>', 'Very pretty fall shot.  Water is nicely blurred - colors are lovely..', '2005-11-13 17:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862541, 254592, 24546, '<td valign="top">You need to level your horizon on this one. I think I would have framed this sunset differently also - the sun is directly in the center of the frame. If you had shot horizontally instead of vertically you would have caught more of the clouds on the left and could have placed the sun in the upper right thirds intersection for a stronger composition.</td>', 'You need to level your horizon on this one. I think I would have framed this sunset differently also - the sun is directly in the center of the frame. If you had shot horizontally instead of vertically you would have caught more of the clouds on the left and could have placed the sun in the upper right thirds intersection for a stronger composition.', '2005-11-13 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862542, 255579, 24546, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice shot - it really does not meet the challenge for "Landscape"</td>', 'While this is a nice shot - it really does not meet the challenge for "Landscape"', '2005-11-13 17:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862544, 253000, 24546, '<td valign="top">You need to be sure your water line is level - this shot needs a clockwise rotation.</td>', 'You need to be sure your water line is level - this shot needs a clockwise rotation.', '2005-11-13 17:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862545, 254901, 47483, '<td valign="top">good one, i wish i paint this.</td>', 'good one, i wish i paint this.', '2005-11-13 17:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862546, 255409, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is a strong entry - I love the bold rich colors of the sunset and that I can see the shape of that brilliant sun. My only suggestion for imporovement would be to have had the water line on the lower thirds horizontal line for a stronger composition.</td>', 'This is a strong entry - I love the bold rich colors of the sunset and that I can see the shape of that brilliant sun. My only suggestion for imporovement would be to have had the water line on the lower thirds horizontal line for a stronger composition.', '2005-11-13 17:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
