(1862847, 254754, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice view from your Kitchen. The only thing that I would have done different is to move the curtain a littel to the left to not split the natural picture frame, just a thought. I have seen that view when I was in Honolulu at the Mariott and the end of the strip. PS: Love the coconuts.</td>', 'Nice view from your Kitchen. The only thing that I would have done different is to move the curtain a littel to the left to not split the natural picture frame, just a thought. I have seen that view when I was in Honolulu at the Mariott and the end of the strip. PS: Love the coconuts.', '2005-11-13 19:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862852, 254816, 19944, '<td valign="top">Kind of small and blurry.  Hard to really judge it.</td>', 'Kind of small and blurry.  Hard to really judge it.', '2005-11-13 19:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862854, 255306, 46778, '<td valign="top">My guess, friesland (Holland or north Germany) probably Holland because of the draw bridge. The light from the sky give the cow a very holly glow. Great job.</td>', 'My guess, friesland (Holland or north Germany) probably Holland because of the draw bridge. The light from the sky give the cow a very holly glow. Great job.', '2005-11-13 19:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
