(1862917, 254041, 24546, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as more of a still life than a landscape. I like the details and the spirit of this photo. I would rank it much higher in a different challenge.</td>', 'This strikes me as more of a still life than a landscape. I like the details and the spirit of this photo. I would rank it much higher in a different challenge.', '2005-11-13 19:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
