(1862922, 254410, 24546, '<td valign="top">This one looks upside down to me. . . . . .Pretty shot. -1 for upside down - since I have no clue that this is a reflection . . . . . .6</td>', 'This one looks upside down to me. . . . . .Pretty shot. -1 for upside down - since I have no clue that this is a reflection . . . . . .6', '2005-11-13 19:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
