(1862972, 254866, 24546, '<td valign="top">When I think of landscape - I think of something where the scenery whether city or country is the main feature in the shot.  People naturally draw our attention in a photo - and this story is more about this girl than it is the scenic beauty.</td>', 'When I think of landscape - I think of something where the scenery whether city or country is the main feature in the shot.  People naturally draw our attention in a photo - and this story is more about this girl than it is the scenic beauty.', '2005-11-13 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
