(1862982, 255451, 40155, '<td valign="top">You are so lucky.  I have not witnessed these in a decade.  Thanks. 10.</td>', 'You are so lucky.  I have not witnessed these in a decade.  Thanks. 10.', '2005-11-13 20:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862995, 254387, 24546, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice shot - certainly gives me the feeling of autumn and approaching winter- I don''t think it meets the challenge. When I think of landscapes, I think of intimate settings in the woods or by a stream or a broader view of mountains, lakes, and rivers. The same is true with cityscapes - a broader view than say just a sidewalk or planter. I would have voted this higher in a different challenge.</td>', 'While this is a nice shot - certainly gives me the feeling of autumn and approaching winter- I don''t think it meets the challenge. When I think of landscapes, I think of intimate settings in the woods or by a stream or a broader view of mountains, lakes, and rivers. The same is true with cityscapes - a broader view than say just a sidewalk or planter. I would have voted this higher in a different challenge.', '2005-11-13 20:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1862998, 255595, 24546, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset, the trees are autumn colored, but the parking lot, stadium lights, and cars detract from the tranquil mood.</td>', 'Pretty sunset, the trees are autumn colored, but the parking lot, stadium lights, and cars detract from the tranquil mood.', '2005-11-13 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863003, 253324, 40155, '<td valign="top">Very effective.  9.</td>', 'Very effective.  9.', '2005-11-13 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863005, 255509, 24546, '<td valign="top">While you have a very pretty sunset and setting, the prominence of the people detracts from the landscape theme. And the lightpoles also pull my eye away from the beauty of the scene.</td>', 'While you have a very pretty sunset and setting, the prominence of the people detracts from the landscape theme. And the lightpoles also pull my eye away from the beauty of the scene.', '2005-11-13 20:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863007, 254372, 40155, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, the fog is captured and the stumps add interest.  10.</td>', 'I love the colors, the fog is captured and the stumps add interest.  10.', '2005-11-13 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863009, 255288, 40155, '<td valign="top">Focus is off and the rear end of the truck could be cropped out.</td>', 'Focus is off and the rear end of the truck could be cropped out.', '2005-11-13 20:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863010, 255568, 24546, '<td valign="top">The unfocused brush in the foreground caused me to score this one low.  Also it seems more of a photojournalism photo (I am assuming this is George Bush''s Maine residence) than a scenic landscape or cityscape.</td>', 'The unfocused brush in the foreground caused me to score this one low.  Also it seems more of a photojournalism photo (I am assuming this is George Bush''s Maine residence) than a scenic landscape or cityscape.', '2005-11-13 20:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863015, 254680, 24546, '<td valign="top">Too much empty space in this shot- over half the frame is empty - no pretty vibrant clouds or color in the top part - and the rest of the shot is not strong enough or themed well enough to carry that empty space.</td>', 'Too much empty space in this shot- over half the frame is empty - no pretty vibrant clouds or color in the top part - and the rest of the shot is not strong enough or themed well enough to carry that empty space.', '2005-11-13 20:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863019, 255402, 24546, '<td valign="top">When I think of landscape - I think of an intimate setting in the woods or by a stream, or a wide vista with mountains.  I voted this one lower because I did not feel it met the challenge very well.</td>', 'When I think of landscape - I think of an intimate setting in the woods or by a stream, or a wide vista with mountains.  I voted this one lower because I did not feel it met the challenge very well.', '2005-11-13 20:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863023, 254613, 24546, '<td valign="top">This shot has too much dynamic range for your camera.  You have areas on both the right and the left that all the detail has been washed away by the bright sunlight.  The shaded areas don''t get enough light for the beauty of the fallen leaves to grab my attention. This type of shot is better on a cloudy day where the sunlight is filtered and there are no deep shadows to fight.</td>', 'This shot has too much dynamic range for your camera.  You have areas on both the right and the left that all the detail has been washed away by the bright sunlight.  The shaded areas don''t get enough light for the beauty of the fallen leaves to grab my attention. This type of shot is better on a cloudy day where the sunlight is filtered and there are no deep shadows to fight.', '2005-11-13 20:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863028, 252968, 24546, '<td valign="top">The blurrede bushes in the foreground really pull my eye away from this sweet child and her cart and the pumpkin patch.  The composition would be stronger if she was placed in the right hand vertical thirds area.</td>', 'The blurrede bushes in the foreground really pull my eye away from this sweet child and her cart and the pumpkin patch.  The composition would be stronger if she was placed in the right hand vertical thirds area.', '2005-11-13 20:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863034, 255187, 24546, '<td valign="top">Whereas this is a pretty shot, nicely composed with the water tower running up the right thirds area, I would rather have had a bettter picture of the entire scene for a "landscape" photo.</td>', 'Whereas this is a pretty shot, nicely composed with the water tower running up the right thirds area, I would rather have had a bettter picture of the entire scene for a "landscape" photo.', '2005-11-13 20:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863038, 253495, 47151, '<td valign="top">Another one that must go into my faveroties to study. I love the flow.</td>', 'Another one that must go into my faveroties to study. I love the flow.', '2005-11-13 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863040, 253292, 24546, '<td valign="top">I voted this one lower because I really could not determine what your point of interest was. If it was the sign - then I would rather have seen it at one of the power positions with the rule of thirds,  If it was the water - then I would rather not have seen so much of the boardwalk. If it was the objects and fountain in the water and the reflection then I would have preferred that to fill the screen.</td>', 'I voted this one lower because I really could not determine what your point of interest was. If it was the sign - then I would rather have seen it at one of the power positions with the rule of thirds,  If it was the water - then I would rather not have seen so much of the boardwalk. If it was the objects and fountain in the water and the reflection then I would have preferred that to fill the screen.', '2005-11-13 20:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
