(1863223, 255254, 40155, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the textures in this shot.</td>', 'I appreciate the textures in this shot.', '2005-11-13 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863226, 255115, 40155, '<td valign="top">Interesting right through out.</td>', 'Interesting right through out.', '2005-11-13 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863260, 255121, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very clear image, and very photogenic subjects. Depth of field and exposure seem just right here.</td>', 'Very clear image, and very photogenic subjects. Depth of field and exposure seem just right here.', '2005-11-13 22:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863267, 254057, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this photo. It might be fun to experiment with adding darks to the darks, especially in the clouds,and perhaps lights to the lights. Nice, effective composition.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this photo. It might be fun to experiment with adding darks to the darks, especially in the clouds,and perhaps lights to the lights. Nice, effective composition.', '2005-11-13 22:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863269, 254449, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dramatic photo. Congratulations for capturing not ony the sun rays, but also the varied levels and textures of these interesting trees. 9</td>', 'Dramatic photo. Congratulations for capturing not ony the sun rays, but also the varied levels and textures of these interesting trees. 9', '2005-11-13 22:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863272, 255610, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce and simple. I like it! Effective composition by the book at thirds. Lovely, dramatic sky.</td>', 'NIce and simple. I like it! Effective composition by the book at thirds. Lovely, dramatic sky.', '2005-11-13 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863276, 253683, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely image. SIlky sky with birds, and spot on textbook composition. It works!</td>', 'Very lovely image. SIlky sky with birds, and spot on textbook composition. It works!', '2005-11-13 22:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863279, 255623, 6870, '<td valign="top">Extreme composition puts weight and thoughts to the sky and also to the lone tree. Very nice work with negative space here. 9</td>', 'Extreme composition puts weight and thoughts to the sky and also to the lone tree. Very nice work with negative space here. 9', '2005-11-13 22:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863296, 254680, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I like the details in the foreground, though I do think it''s worth experimenting with a deeper depth of field to see what it would be like to get those trees in focus, too. Lovely colors. To get your photo larger for the web, if using Photoshop, try resizing to 72 dpi and the size allowed by DPC (such as 640 px on the longest edge). Then use the Save For Web.... feature, and adjust the quality until it''s under 150 mb. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice work. I like the details in the foreground, though I do think it''s worth experimenting with a deeper depth of field to see what it would be like to get those trees in focus, too. Lovely colors. To get your photo larger for the web, if using Photoshop, try resizing to 72 dpi and the size allowed by DPC (such as 640 px on the longest edge). Then use the Save For Web.... feature, and adjust the quality until it''s under 150 mb. Good luck!', '2005-11-13 22:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863299, 254873, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and engaging textures here, and colors. Nice exposure, too. It would be nice to see this with spot editing allowed.</td>', 'Very interesting and engaging textures here, and colors. Nice exposure, too. It would be nice to see this with spot editing allowed.', '2005-11-13 22:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863311, 253770, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  If you close down the aperture alot of the time those purple halos go away.</td>', 'nice shot.  If you close down the aperture alot of the time those purple halos go away.', '2005-11-13 23:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863315, 255464, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with the sunset light on that snow. The clouds make for interesting light patterns on the mountain tips, too! Without spot editing allowed, you chose wisely to expose for the snow, leaving the foreground quite dark. Nice composition; the mountains fill the frame quite nicely. Nice work! 8</td>', 'Nice capture with the sunset light on that snow. The clouds make for interesting light patterns on the mountain tips, too! Without spot editing allowed, you chose wisely to expose for the snow, leaving the foreground quite dark. Nice composition; the mountains fill the frame quite nicely. Nice work! 8', '2005-11-13 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863336, 255469, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the effect but don''t get the challenge...sorry.</td>', 'I like the effect but don''t get the challenge...sorry.', '2005-11-13 23:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863337, 255275, 47432, '<td valign="top">Nicely Done.</td>', 'Nicely Done.', '2005-11-13 23:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863339, 255158, 33672, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t need a title.</td>', 'Doesn''t need a title.', '2005-11-13 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863340, 255119, 47432, '<td valign="top">Nice use of cropping.</td>', 'Nice use of cropping.', '2005-11-13 23:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863342, 255432, 47432, '<td valign="top">Very good, I loke the clouds.</td>', 'Very good, I loke the clouds.', '2005-11-13 23:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863343, 254054, 47432, '<td valign="top">Beutiful picture.  Well layed out and good use of foreground.</td>', 'Beutiful picture.  Well layed out and good use of foreground.', '2005-11-13 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863391, 255486, 20330, '<td valign="top">wow i love this, but the foreground stuff has gotta go</td>', 'wow i love this, but the foreground stuff has gotta go', '2005-11-13 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863394, 253358, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail on this shot.  I think I would like the bud in the background to be completely in the photo, rather than cut off.</td>', 'Nice color and detail on this shot.  I think I would like the bud in the background to be completely in the photo, rather than cut off.', '2005-11-13 23:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863399, 254816, 20330, '<td valign="top">size matters.. this looks to be great but i cant see it well enough</td>', 'size matters.. this looks to be great but i cant see it well enough', '2005-11-13 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863401, 255547, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors on the trees!  The sky looks a little blown out (probabaly overcast, which happened to me too!)  I would perhaps move the shot to include the tree on the left and leave a little bit of the fence out on the right.  Otherwise, good detail and a lovely scene.</td>', 'Good colors on the trees!  The sky looks a little blown out (probabaly overcast, which happened to me too!)  I would perhaps move the shot to include the tree on the left and leave a little bit of the fence out on the right.  Otherwise, good detail and a lovely scene.', '2005-11-13 23:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863406, 255124, 20330, '<td valign="top">love the colors, the sky, the vanishing point of the pier.. awesome 10</td>', 'love the colors, the sky, the vanishing point of the pier.. awesome 10', '2005-11-13 23:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863408, 254282, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really love the kangaroo!!!  I think I might like to see the background less blurred, though those kangaroo cuties probably move pretty darn quick! :-)  Colors look very good.  I might suggest cropping out a little at the bottom where the yellow seems very bright.</td>', 'I really love the kangaroo!!!  I think I might like to see the background less blurred, though those kangaroo cuties probably move pretty darn quick! :-)  Colors look very good.  I might suggest cropping out a little at the bottom where the yellow seems very bright.', '2005-11-13 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863416, 254808, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great job on the sky!  The ground looks a little dark...I don''t know if some levels adjustment would help or not.</td>', 'Great job on the sky!  The ground looks a little dark...I don''t know if some levels adjustment would help or not.', '2005-11-13 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863427, 253809, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice motion on the waterfall!!  The sky in the upper right hand corner is a bit distracting.  Other than that, looks good.</td>', 'Very nice motion on the waterfall!!  The sky in the upper right hand corner is a bit distracting.  Other than that, looks good.', '2005-11-13 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863428, 254816, 35513, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve captured some nice motion on the water, but I wish the photo was larger so I could see more detail.</td>', 'It looks like you''ve captured some nice motion on the water, but I wish the photo was larger so I could see more detail.', '2005-11-13 23:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863431, 255595, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in the sky!  The parking lot and cars don''t really fit my ideal of landscape, but I think that the trees beyond the fence look very lovely!</td>', 'Very nice colors in the sky!  The parking lot and cars don''t really fit my ideal of landscape, but I think that the trees beyond the fence look very lovely!', '2005-11-13 23:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863434, 253991, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very bright colors in the sky!  The colors in the trees look nice as well, but I think the photo is a little oversharpened or perhaps oversaturated for my taste...the texture of the trees looks a little unnatural.  I LOVE the reflection of the trees in the water...looks really nice!</td>', 'Very bright colors in the sky!  The colors in the trees look nice as well, but I think the photo is a little oversharpened or perhaps oversaturated for my taste...the texture of the trees looks a little unnatural.  I LOVE the reflection of the trees in the water...looks really nice!', '2005-11-13 23:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863438, 255240, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the shells and sand and great colors in the sky.  I like the angle as well :-)</td>', 'Good detail on the shells and sand and great colors in the sky.  I like the angle as well :-)', '2005-11-13 23:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863445, 255580, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors in the trees!  I feel like I would like to see more of the treetops, but the reflections in the water look cool too.</td>', 'Very nice colors in the trees!  I feel like I would like to see more of the treetops, but the reflections in the water look cool too.', '2005-11-13 23:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1863450, 255294, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!  The scene looks a bit on the red side to me.  Sky looks good and the green in the grass looks good as well.</td>', 'Very nice composition!  The scene looks a bit on the red side to me.  Sky looks good and the green in the grass looks good as well.', '2005-11-13 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864070, 255162, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is very appealling, I love the subdued yet somehow bright orange and yellow colors. It has an air of mystery that is nice.</td>', 'Your picture is very appealling, I love the subdued yet somehow bright orange and yellow colors. It has an air of mystery that is nice.', '2005-11-14 02:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864071, 255109, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty. It looks like Nova Scotia or Maine or somewhere like that. I like it a lot.</td>', 'This is very pretty. It looks like Nova Scotia or Maine or somewhere like that. I like it a lot.', '2005-11-14 02:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864073, 254287, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2005-11-14 02:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864093, 254445, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I like all the fall colors. It kind of looks like an impressionist painting. The lady on the bridge is a nice little surprise that I didn''t even notice at first.</td>', 'This is nice. I like all the fall colors. It kind of looks like an impressionist painting. The lady on the bridge is a nice little surprise that I didn''t even notice at first.', '2005-11-14 02:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864098, 254965, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pretty fall landscape, the path really adds to the composition which is very strong and appealling.</td>', 'Very pretty fall landscape, the path really adds to the composition which is very strong and appealling.', '2005-11-14 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864099, 255575, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I love the lighting.</td>', 'Very pretty. I love the lighting.', '2005-11-14 02:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864101, 254053, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a pretty fall scene! The country road really draws you right into this picture. I wish I would take a walk here.</td>', 'What a pretty fall scene! The country road really draws you right into this picture. I wish I would take a walk here.', '2005-11-14 02:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864103, 255391, 18552, '<td valign="top">Not a typical open landscape but it is very visually appealling. The little bridge really adds to the photo. Very nice.</td>', 'Not a typical open landscape but it is very visually appealling. The little bridge really adds to the photo. Very nice.', '2005-11-14 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864108, 254983, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a cool, interesting place.  The rocky parts have a great warm color which contrasts well with the cool color of the sky. On my monitor the sky has a slightly un-natural purple cast in the dark clouds. Your composition is very nice.</td>', 'What a cool, interesting place.  The rocky parts have a great warm color which contrasts well with the cool color of the sky. On my monitor the sky has a slightly un-natural purple cast in the dark clouds. Your composition is very nice.', '2005-11-14 02:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864111, 255150, 18552, '<td valign="top">This really does have such a peaceful feeling. The water is lovely with all the colors reflected in it.</td>', 'This really does have such a peaceful feeling. The water is lovely with all the colors reflected in it.', '2005-11-14 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864113, 254593, 18552, '<td valign="top">This really does look like a painting. A lot of sky for a landscape but it is really lovely.</td>', 'This really does look like a painting. A lot of sky for a landscape but it is really lovely.', '2005-11-14 02:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864116, 253815, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, excellent composition.</td>', 'Very pretty, excellent composition.', '2005-11-14 02:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864121, 254639, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I like all the differnt colors that make up the land, so many different greens, browns and golds.</td>', 'This is really nice. I like all the differnt colors that make up the land, so many different greens, browns and golds.', '2005-11-14 02:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864124, 253891, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very different and interesting. Am looking forward to seeing where this is at the end of the challenge.</td>', 'Very different and interesting. Am looking forward to seeing where this is at the end of the challenge.', '2005-11-14 03:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864125, 255312, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is nice. It looks so cold - almost makes me shiver when I look at it!</td>', 'Your picture is nice. It looks so cold - almost makes me shiver when I look at it!', '2005-11-14 03:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864128, 254369, 18552, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the canyon.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the canyon.', '2005-11-14 03:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864157, 253303, 18552, '<td valign="top">This picture is well taken, the exposure is good. However, I don''t think tilting it added anything to the visual appeal. Most of the picture is a big featureless expanse of grey colored water which is not very pretty. The leaves in the top of the picture are a nice touch but that great big chunk of grey water just overwhelms this picture.</td>', 'This picture is well taken, the exposure is good. However, I don''t think tilting it added anything to the visual appeal. Most of the picture is a big featureless expanse of grey colored water which is not very pretty. The leaves in the top of the picture are a nice touch but that great big chunk of grey water just overwhelms this picture.', '2005-11-14 03:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864165, 255588, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, stunning picture. I wish it had been in a Cityscape challenge because it would have been a 10 - for a Landscape it is okay but not really a LANDscape. It is so lovely.</td>', 'This is a beautiful, stunning picture. I wish it had been in a Cityscape challenge because it would have been a 10 - for a Landscape it is okay but not really a LANDscape. It is so lovely.', '2005-11-14 03:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864173, 255529, 18552, '<td valign="top">It is really a stretch to think of a picture of a flower as a landscape. The flash glare on this flower is really obvious and creates hot spots. Also, the focus is not clear and the composition is far too centered.</td>', 'It is really a stretch to think of a picture of a flower as a landscape. The flash glare on this flower is really obvious and creates hot spots. Also, the focus is not clear and the composition is far too centered.', '2005-11-14 03:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864178, 255282, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is pretty. The light on the hills is nice, I like the slightly pink tinge in the color. The light on the hills kind of draws your eye there rather than to the falls which the focus of the picture.</td>', 'This is pretty. The light on the hills is nice, I like the slightly pink tinge in the color. The light on the hills kind of draws your eye there rather than to the falls which the focus of the picture.', '2005-11-14 03:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864181, 253358, 18552, '<td valign="top">It is really a stretch to think of a picture of a rose as a landscape!</td>', 'It is really a stretch to think of a picture of a rose as a landscape!', '2005-11-14 03:28:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1864184, 253836, 18552, '<td valign="top">What lovely lighting! I like the dark sky yet the bright sun on the ground. The two big trees framing the scene are very nice.</td>', 'What lovely lighting! I like the dark sky yet the bright sun on the ground. The two big trees framing the scene are very nice.', '2005-11-14 03:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864186, 254516, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty - it is very restful to look at. I love the contrast of the red tones with the green. Excellent compostion.</td>', 'This is very pretty - it is very restful to look at. I love the contrast of the red tones with the green. Excellent compostion.', '2005-11-14 03:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864188, 253659, 18552, '<td valign="top">How pretty. The colors are gorgeous.</td>', 'How pretty. The colors are gorgeous.', '2005-11-14 03:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864192, 254954, 18552, '<td valign="top">What lovely, delicate lighting. The water looks so beautiful. Your picture looks like a pretty painting. I wish this was an advanced editing challenge so you could have cloned out that wire.</td>', 'What lovely, delicate lighting. The water looks so beautiful. Your picture looks like a pretty painting. I wish this was an advanced editing challenge so you could have cloned out that wire.', '2005-11-14 03:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864195, 254851, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very appealling picture. I like it.</td>', 'Very appealling picture. I like it.', '2005-11-14 03:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864206, 255326, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, you can almost hear the wind in it. I think it would have even been more effective if the front tree was more to the right in the picture instead of in the middle.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, you can almost hear the wind in it. I think it would have even been more effective if the front tree was more to the right in the picture instead of in the middle.', '2005-11-14 03:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864209, 255229, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very attractive silhouette. I''m not sure if the yellowish color in the sky is natural or not - it might look better with a slightly different tone.</td>', 'Very attractive silhouette. I''m not sure if the yellowish color in the sky is natural or not - it might look better with a slightly different tone.', '2005-11-14 03:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864210, 255508, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very attractive colors!</td>', 'Very attractive colors!', '2005-11-14 03:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864212, 254054, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a pretty, peaceful scene. It looks like a lovely old painting. Great picture.</td>', 'What a pretty, peaceful scene. It looks like a lovely old painting. Great picture.', '2005-11-14 03:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864214, 254335, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture has such understated beauty. It really looks like a beautiful old painting. The water is lovely and so are the colors. The sky is so nice and muted looking.</td>', 'Your picture has such understated beauty. It really looks like a beautiful old painting. The water is lovely and so are the colors. The sky is so nice and muted looking.', '2005-11-14 03:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864216, 255358, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a different and unusual place. The lighting is great.</td>', 'What a different and unusual place. The lighting is great.', '2005-11-14 03:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864218, 254848, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture is really gentle and nice - I can almost hear the sounds of birds and insects. The yellows and greens are very visually appealling.</td>', 'Your picture is really gentle and nice - I can almost hear the sounds of birds and insects. The yellows and greens are very visually appealling.', '2005-11-14 03:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864219, 254655, 18552, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wonderful autumn painting. The reflections in the water are lovely so are all the warm colors.</td>', 'This looks like a wonderful autumn painting. The reflections in the water are lovely so are all the warm colors.', '2005-11-14 03:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864220, 253683, 18552, '<td valign="top">How stunning. This is beautiful.</td>', 'How stunning. This is beautiful.', '2005-11-14 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864221, 253940, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great sky! The red flowers in the front are very nice and so is the fence.</td>', 'Great sky! The red flowers in the front are very nice and so is the fence.', '2005-11-14 03:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864222, 255307, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Such a simple scene but so well done and appealling.</td>', 'Lovely. Such a simple scene but so well done and appealling.', '2005-11-14 03:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864314, 253300, 42606, '<td valign="top">Amazing!<br/> <br/>Wonderful light.</td>', 'Amazing! Wonderful light.', '2005-11-14 06:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864377, 254570, 30392, '<td valign="top">lovely colors but looks oversharpened, it''s a shame!</td>', 'lovely colors but looks oversharpened, it''s a shame!', '2005-11-14 07:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864378, 255294, 30392, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene but the orange looks a bit overdone</td>', 'Lovely scene but the orange looks a bit overdone', '2005-11-14 07:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864391, 255413, 30392, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene but I can see sharpening/neatimage artifacts?</td>', 'Beautiful scene but I can see sharpening/neatimage artifacts?', '2005-11-14 07:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864393, 255467, 30392, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s amazing! It looks a bit oversharpened/oversaturated to me though. Still a beautiful scene</td>', 'Wow, that''s amazing! It looks a bit oversharpened/oversaturated to me though. Still a beautiful scene', '2005-11-14 07:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864455, 253726, 36606, '<td valign="top">this is a tad dark on my screen! nice autumn colours thoug</td>', 'this is a tad dark on my screen! nice autumn colours thoug', '2005-11-14 08:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864458, 254661, 36606, '<td valign="top">love the colours of the windows with lights on the buildinigs</td>', 'love the colours of the windows with lights on the buildinigs', '2005-11-14 08:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864460, 254987, 36606, '<td valign="top">i like this one. Only thing I would change IMHO is the branch at the bottom left. Nice colours</td>', 'i like this one. Only thing I would change IMHO is the branch at the bottom left. Nice colours', '2005-11-14 08:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864461, 254971, 36606, '<td valign="top">For me there is no real foreground interest. Also on my monitor this is too dark.</td>', 'For me there is no real foreground interest. Also on my monitor this is too dark.', '2005-11-14 08:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864462, 255577, 36606, '<td valign="top">wow that water looks very cool! nice image</td>', 'wow that water looks very cool! nice image', '2005-11-14 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864463, 254936, 36606, '<td valign="top">intertesting viewpoint of a landscape. Different!</td>', 'intertesting viewpoint of a landscape. Different!', '2005-11-14 08:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864466, 254282, 36606, '<td valign="top">This is a landscape challenge, so I reckon the landscape should be most imporatnt in the picture. Nice wildlife shot though</td>', 'This is a landscape challenge, so I reckon the landscape should be most imporatnt in the picture. Nice wildlife shot though', '2005-11-14 08:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1864468, 255509, 36606, '<td valign="top">love the title</td>', 'love the title', '2005-11-14 08:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
