(1865148, 254611, 47919, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo conceptually. The pose is perfect. The boat looks impossibly small and adds to the sense of vastness of the water. Unfortunately, the figure and boat look over zoomed and flat.</td>', 'I really love this photo conceptually. The pose is perfect. The boat looks impossibly small and adds to the sense of vastness of the water. Unfortunately, the figure and boat look over zoomed and flat.', '2005-11-14 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
