(1865187, 255156, 2920, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning picture by any standards. The composition is excellent; using lines, focal points and colour to guide the viewer around the landscape. The image also has an amazing ethereal quality. My only advice would be to make posters and start selling them!  10  :-)</td>', 'This is a stunning picture by any standards. The composition is excellent; using lines, focal points and colour to guide the viewer around the landscape. The image also has an amazing ethereal quality. My only advice would be to make posters and start selling them!  10  :-)', '2005-11-14 13:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
