(1867021, 253324, 39243, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot - would have been nice to either crop out or clone out (not sure on the rules) the building in the upper left of the shot. Other than that a great and mysterious shot ''9'' - Ok went an looked and see only basic editing so I guess I would opt for a crop. Then of course you are centering the shot and that would be worse so I guess it is what it is. Good Job. (aren''t you glad you got to see my thought process).</td>', 'beautiful shot - would have been nice to either crop out or clone out (not sure on the rules) the building in the upper left of the shot. Other than that a great and mysterious shot ''9'' - Ok went an looked and see only basic editing so I guess I would opt for a crop. Then of course you are centering the shot and that would be worse so I guess it is what it is. Good Job. (aren''t you glad you got to see my thought process).', '2005-11-14 23:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867026, 252571, 39243, '<td valign="top">Great picture - beautifully framed - My guess is that you are not from the United States and English is your second language but I think the title you were looking for was "A nice view split in two" but I am not positive. I give you an 8</td>', 'Great picture - beautifully framed - My guess is that you are not from the United States and English is your second language but I think the title you were looking for was "A nice view split in two" but I am not positive. I give you an 8', '2005-11-14 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
