(1867488, 255306, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like some strange things may have happened with the curves... the cows are a funny tone</td>', 'looks like some strange things may have happened with the curves... the cows are a funny tone', '2005-11-15 04:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867490, 253982, 17507, '<td valign="top">gorgeous piece of work, making excellent use of color, particularly cyan and white. the color palette in this image is very appealing.</td>', 'gorgeous piece of work, making excellent use of color, particularly cyan and white. the color palette in this image is very appealing.', '2005-11-15 04:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867492, 255373, 29462, '<td valign="top">This is very pixellated, I assume this is from the editing to resize, shame as it''s not a bad compesition</td>', 'This is very pixellated, I assume this is from the editing to resize, shame as it''s not a bad compesition', '2005-11-15 04:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867496, 255348, 30364, '<td valign="top">Odd title but a terrific photograph.  I love the juxtaposition of the two dominant structures ... the bush and the mountain have equal billing here, and the photograph is all the better and more interesting for that choice.  Simple decisions like that are what separates memorable photographs (especially landscapes) from all the forgettable two-dimensional postcard shots.  Well done.  8.</td>', 'Odd title but a terrific photograph.  I love the juxtaposition of the two dominant structures ... the bush and the mountain have equal billing here, and the photograph is all the better and more interesting for that choice.  Simple decisions like that are what separates memorable photographs (especially landscapes) from all the forgettable two-dimensional postcard shots.  Well done.  8.', '2005-11-15 05:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867502, 253033, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely photograph that is a little spoiled by the fact that the right hand tree is broken.  Somehow this imperfection interrupts the harmony of the scene for me, and diminishes my enjoyment of it.  Not your fault, of course (unless you broke the tree), but it does make the subject less worthy.  Other than that, you''ve done a beautiful job with composition, capture and processing.  The subtle gradient in the sky is especially nice.  7</td>', 'It''s a lovely photograph that is a little spoiled by the fact that the right hand tree is broken.  Somehow this imperfection interrupts the harmony of the scene for me, and diminishes my enjoyment of it.  Not your fault, of course (unless you broke the tree), but it does make the subject less worthy.  Other than that, you''ve done a beautiful job with composition, capture and processing.  The subtle gradient in the sky is especially nice.  7', '2005-11-15 05:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867508, 254330, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very ambitious landscape, because it has so little land in it!  For me it works very well.  I like the tower ( I don''t think it''s a lighthouse?) ... it gives scale and depth to the marvellous cloudscape.  7</td>', 'This is a very ambitious landscape, because it has so little land in it!  For me it works very well.  I like the tower ( I don''t think it''s a lighthouse?) ... it gives scale and depth to the marvellous cloudscape.  7', '2005-11-15 05:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1867517, 254330, 47483, '<td valign="top">its more of a skyscape</td>', 'its more of a skyscape', '2005-11-15 05:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
