(1869399, 255059, 14620, '<td valign="top">Stellar work.  Excellent b&amp;w treatment, so much detail intact and no real blow outs to speak of.  Well done. Bumped to 10</td>', 'Stellar work.  Excellent b&w treatment, so much detail intact and no real blow outs to speak of.  Well done. Bumped to 10', '2005-11-15 17:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869404, 255275, 14620, '<td valign="top">The divisions of color in this are so pleasing, they just lead you through the whole photo with a nice anchor of the dark tree to bring you back in.  Well done. 9</td>', 'The divisions of color in this are so pleasing, they just lead you through the whole photo with a nice anchor of the dark tree to bring you back in.  Well done. 9', '2005-11-15 17:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869416, 255348, 27164, '<td valign="top">This one is perhaps my favorite of the entire chalklenge.  So much depth and interest is gained by having the bush in the foreground.  I''m amazed that this was all done within basic editing as it looks like it would have been a very hard scene to expose properly without getting lost shadows or blown highlights.<br/> <br/>The texture in the snow is very eye-catching as well.  In particular, I love the lower-right corner transition from snow to dirt.<br/> <br/>Beautiful photo, 10 from me and going in my faves.  Congrats!</td>', 'This one is perhaps my favorite of the entire chalklenge.  So much depth and interest is gained by having the bush in the foreground.  I''m amazed that this was all done within basic editing as it looks like it would have been a very hard scene to expose properly without getting lost shadows or blown highlights. The texture in the snow is very eye-catching as well.  In particular, I love the lower-right corner transition from snow to dirt. Beautiful photo, 10 from me and going in my faves.  Congrats!', '2005-11-15 17:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869418, 255536, 1570, '<td valign="top">wonderful! 10.</td>', 'wonderful! 10.', '2005-11-15 17:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869446, 252970, 10515, '<td valign="top">I love this shot...I have a similar shot I took a few years ago in Waikiki...too bad that man has to ruin such a view with powerline/phonelines</td>', 'I love this shot...I have a similar shot I took a few years ago in Waikiki...too bad that man has to ruin such a view with powerline/phonelines', '2005-11-15 17:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869449, 255156, 47701, '<td valign="top">stunning and evocative</td>', 'stunning and evocative', '2005-11-15 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869459, 255167, 21072, '<td valign="top">The colours of this photograph are lovely, however it only shows a limited view of the landscape of the area.  Moving your position so that the telegraph pole is not in the shot would have helped also because it blocks the view of the chair, which seems to be one of the focus points you were aiming for in the picture.</td>', 'The colours of this photograph are lovely, however it only shows a limited view of the landscape of the area.  Moving your position so that the telegraph pole is not in the shot would have helped also because it blocks the view of the chair, which seems to be one of the focus points you were aiming for in the picture.', '2005-11-15 17:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869466, 255423, 21072, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice scene, I think it works well in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Quite a nice scene, I think it works well in b&w.', '2005-11-15 17:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869473, 252643, 43869, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot.  I even like the stump and trees in the foreground.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is an excellent shot.  I even like the stump and trees in the foreground. ', '2005-11-15 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869475, 255371, 43869, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-11-15 17:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869477, 255508, 43869, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Love the vibrant colors in the trees!</td>', 'Lovely!  Love the vibrant colors in the trees!', '2005-11-15 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869479, 255156, 26756, '<td valign="top">I think this is a shot from Popescu.  An easy 10.  The quality of light is tremendous, it''s a beautiful setting, has interesting lines and soft, interesting color.  Very nice.</td>', 'I think this is a shot from Popescu.  An easy 10.  The quality of light is tremendous, it''s a beautiful setting, has interesting lines and soft, interesting color.  Very nice.', '2005-11-15 18:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869484, 254954, 26756, '<td valign="top">I recognize this scene :-)  And it''s the best photo you''ve ever taken here.  Easy 10 from me, and I truly hope it ribbons.  It should.</td>', 'I recognize this scene :-)  And it''s the best photo you''ve ever taken here.  Easy 10 from me, and I truly hope it ribbons.  It should.', '2005-11-15 18:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869488, 253891, 33732, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The lighting is interesting. Location?</td>', 'I like this.  The lighting is interesting. Location?', '2005-11-15 18:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869489, 254873, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love the color and the expanse of the landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love the color and the expanse of the landscape.', '2005-11-15 18:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869491, 255294, 33732, '<td valign="top">Seems too red.</td>', 'Seems too red.', '2005-11-15 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869492, 255536, 26756, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite.  It''s easy to focus just on the sky and not realize the depth of this photo, with those large mountains in the background.  Gotta love super-wides.  Great job!</td>', 'One of my favorite.  It''s easy to focus just on the sky and not realize the depth of this photo, with those large mountains in the background.  Gotta love super-wides.  Great job!', '2005-11-15 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869495, 255271, 33732, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice. A fence?</td>', 'Colors are nice. A fence?', '2005-11-15 18:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869497, 255109, 26756, '<td valign="top">The light in this photo is outstanding.  Sets the entire mood and does it well.  Gorgeous shot.  Good luck!</td>', 'The light in this photo is outstanding.  Sets the entire mood and does it well.  Gorgeous shot.  Good luck!', '2005-11-15 18:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869503, 255503, 33732, '<td valign="top">Not so much to look at.  More zoom or crop.</td>', 'Not so much to look at.  More zoom or crop.', '2005-11-15 18:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869504, 255222, 21072, '<td valign="top">You have shown the prevailing landscape of the city and surrounds well.  Great picture.</td>', 'You have shown the prevailing landscape of the city and surrounds well.  Great picture.', '2005-11-15 18:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869508, 255124, 33732, '<td valign="top">Nice sky colors.  Why not looking down the walk over the rail to the sun?</td>', 'Nice sky colors.  Why not looking down the walk over the rail to the sun?', '2005-11-15 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869509, 255482, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very yellow and inviting.  LIghter yellow may help.  I can see this in my eye that the dramatic blue-yellow combo is wonderful.  Try some contrast on this.</td>', 'Very yellow and inviting.  LIghter yellow may help.  I can see this in my eye that the dramatic blue-yellow combo is wonderful.  Try some contrast on this.', '2005-11-15 18:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1869513, 255469, 21072, '<td valign="top">I like the textures in the photograph, but feel that it does not give much sense of the landscape of the area you are photographing.</td>', 'I like the textures in the photograph, but feel that it does not give much sense of the landscape of the area you are photographing.', '2005-11-15 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
