(1869954, 255579, 33145, '<td valign="top">Oh what a shame, you have no clue.<br/>1. Always try to have at least one dimension (width or height) be 640 pixels.<br/>2. Try to sumbit a photo that at least slightly falls within the challenge details.<br/>If this was a portrait challenge and the image was at 640px wide then I would have given it a 6, as it is you get a 2.</td>', 'Oh what a shame, you have no clue.1. Always try to have at least one dimension (width or height) be 640 pixels.2. Try to sumbit a photo that at least slightly falls within the challenge details.If this was a portrait challenge and the image was at 640px wide then I would have given it a 6, as it is you get a 2.', '2005-11-15 20:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
