(1870287, 255400, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the deep brown reddish hues on the windswept dunes. And I love how the light carresses the dunes to illuminate the crests and deepen the shadows seen on the dunes. Love the title of the piece as well for it plays into the imagery of the sun just peeking with it''s one great eye over the gentle slope of the hill to sneak a look at the wind as it has breathed it''s whisper upon the sands.</td>', 'Love the deep brown reddish hues on the windswept dunes. And I love how the light carresses the dunes to illuminate the crests and deepen the shadows seen on the dunes. Love the title of the piece as well for it plays into the imagery of the sun just peeking with it''s one great eye over the gentle slope of the hill to sneak a look at the wind as it has breathed it''s whisper upon the sands.', '2005-11-15 21:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
