(1870305, 255467, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the look of that great big yellow sun that seems to be caught and suspended in the lines of the bridge. Coupled with the view of the river/ocean with boats drifting on the waves it makes me think upon the fishermen and the nets that they cast to catch fish. It is not hard at all for me to transfer that imagery as I gaze upon the sun caught in the "net" of the bridge. The hues are also lovely with warm oranges and yellows.</td>', 'Love the look of that great big yellow sun that seems to be caught and suspended in the lines of the bridge. Coupled with the view of the river/ocean with boats drifting on the waves it makes me think upon the fishermen and the nets that they cast to catch fish. It is not hard at all for me to transfer that imagery as I gaze upon the sun caught in the "net" of the bridge. The hues are also lovely with warm oranges and yellows.', '2005-11-15 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870317, 255388, 43463, '<td valign="top">The thing that strikes me the most about this photo is the crisp cleaness of the shot. The blues of the sky and the whites of the snow on the ground and the clouds. I feel myself walking on this trail and I really get the sensation of chill sinking into my skin. Great job. I can feel the cold as I gaze upon this picture.</td>', 'The thing that strikes me the most about this photo is the crisp cleaness of the shot. The blues of the sky and the whites of the snow on the ground and the clouds. I feel myself walking on this trail and I really get the sensation of chill sinking into my skin. Great job. I can feel the cold as I gaze upon this picture.', '2005-11-15 21:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870326, 255119, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W of this shot. The composition also is very appealing. This, to me, appears to be a very nostalgic shot. Transporting the viewer back to days gone by when they were younger and used to take a stroll down to the lakeside. I like how you see just a peek of the lake between the reeds for if you want to gaze upon the lake you need to stroll down this boardwalk to get there - and our eyes must do that exploring.</td>', 'I like the B&W of this shot. The composition also is very appealing. This, to me, appears to be a very nostalgic shot. Transporting the viewer back to days gone by when they were younger and used to take a stroll down to the lakeside. I like how you see just a peek of the lake between the reeds for if you want to gaze upon the lake you need to stroll down this boardwalk to get there - and our eyes must do that exploring.', '2005-11-15 22:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870342, 255124, 43463, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely sunset picture. There is one thing that could turn this from a good shot to something that is spectacular and makes the image speak of something more. Had you moved your angle such that you had all the same elements there EXCEPt the sunset woud be positioned right at the end of the dock. Visually this would add poetic imagery of a trail that when followed to the end leads to the sunset ( a symbolic imagery about the life cycle).</td>', 'This is a lovely sunset picture. There is one thing that could turn this from a good shot to something that is spectacular and makes the image speak of something more. Had you moved your angle such that you had all the same elements there EXCEPt the sunset woud be positioned right at the end of the dock. Visually this would add poetic imagery of a trail that when followed to the end leads to the sunset ( a symbolic imagery about the life cycle).', '2005-11-15 22:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870358, 255187, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the cool bue hues on this photo. The water tower is in silhouette such that we just see it shape cast upon the night sky. Including the cresent moon in the photo just makes the shot. My only critiuque is that I wish you had included all of the water tower instead of cropping out the bottom. For if all of it was included along with a little of the ground plane it would give us a sense that this tower is reaching up into the heavens.</td>', 'Love the cool bue hues on this photo. The water tower is in silhouette such that we just see it shape cast upon the night sky. Including the cresent moon in the photo just makes the shot. My only critiuque is that I wish you had included all of the water tower instead of cropping out the bottom. For if all of it was included along with a little of the ground plane it would give us a sense that this tower is reaching up into the heavens.', '2005-11-15 22:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870366, 255282, 43463, '<td valign="top">Beautiful stark white landscape along with the cascading white water that is seemingly "frozen"  in this photo. Our gaze is frozen as we look upon this beautiful white and frigid landscape. Wonderful job - the waterfall just makes this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful stark white landscape along with the cascading white water that is seemingly "frozen"  in this photo. Our gaze is frozen as we look upon this beautiful white and frigid landscape. Wonderful job - the waterfall just makes this shot.', '2005-11-15 22:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870376, 253300, 43463, '<td valign="top">This shot is stunningly beautiful. I love how you captured the Northern lights as they seem to rise from the sky and then strike the mountain and bounce off into the sea of stars.</td>', 'This shot is stunningly beautiful. I love how you captured the Northern lights as they seem to rise from the sky and then strike the mountain and bounce off into the sea of stars.', '2005-11-15 22:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870393, 254820, 37111, '<td valign="top">the mill?</td>', 'the mill?', '2005-11-15 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870397, 254816, 47277, '<td valign="top">I probably underrated your photo, but as a personal preference I''m not a big fan of silky waterfalls.  The small frame size left most of the detail to the imagination.</td>', 'I probably underrated your photo, but as a personal preference I''m not a big fan of silky waterfalls.  The small frame size left most of the detail to the imagination.', '2005-11-15 22:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870399, 255588, 43463, '<td valign="top">Adjusting the shutter speed to be a tad faster would have cut down on the amount of light let through and thus exposed the Empire State Building better. I do love how you captured some beams of light that shine down on the city (lights from a helicopter or plane?) It makes for a wonderful addition to the composition. I also love the hues of the night sky along with the cresent moon seen there in the shot - and I see Venus up just above the moon! (I tried capturing a shot of the cresent moon and venus a few weeks ago) Wonderful composition - it''s just the lighting that needs a little work.</td>', 'Adjusting the shutter speed to be a tad faster would have cut down on the amount of light let through and thus exposed the Empire State Building better. I do love how you captured some beams of light that shine down on the city (lights from a helicopter or plane?) It makes for a wonderful addition to the composition. I also love the hues of the night sky along with the cresent moon seen there in the shot - and I see Venus up just above the moon! (I tried capturing a shot of the cresent moon and venus a few weeks ago) Wonderful composition - it''s just the lighting that needs a little work.', '2005-11-15 22:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870402, 255577, 47378, '<td valign="top">"Nature In Perspective" indeed! I love how the person on red gives everything else a sense of hugeness. Could be slightly sharper, but that''s extremely tough to do with a shot like this. Well done!</td>', '"Nature In Perspective" indeed! I love how the person on red gives everything else a sense of hugeness. Could be slightly sharper, but that''s extremely tough to do with a shot like this. Well done!', '2005-11-15 22:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870405, 255156, 4281, '<td valign="top">The very best I''ve seen so far. Hope you do well in the challenge!<br/> <br/>I really like the composition, the landscape is quite astonishing and I like the subdued colors. Don''t really see much if anything  I''d change.</td>', 'The very best I''ve seen so far. Hope you do well in the challenge! I really like the composition, the landscape is quite astonishing and I like the subdued colors. Don''t really see much if anything  I''d change.', '2005-11-15 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
