(1870436, 255275, 4281, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite in the challenge so far. I really like the lines in this picture. Quite fun composition. Pity that we don''t see more shadow detail in the tree in the foreground.<br/> <br/>It also seems a bit over-compressed or cropped.</td>', 'One of my favorite in the challenge so far. I really like the lines in this picture. Quite fun composition. Pity that we don''t see more shadow detail in the tree in the foreground. It also seems a bit over-compressed or cropped.', '2005-11-15 22:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870438, 255508, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the colors of the golden fields and the autumn colors adorning the trees. But there is something that lies nearly in the center of this image that makes it stand out as being a little unusual and unique. The green of the cactus as it lies low in the golden hued field. The cactus adds interest as that it is something one rarely sees or gets the impression of when visuallizing an autumn scene.</td>', 'Love the colors of the golden fields and the autumn colors adorning the trees. But there is something that lies nearly in the center of this image that makes it stand out as being a little unusual and unique. The green of the cactus as it lies low in the golden hued field. The cactus adds interest as that it is something one rarely sees or gets the impression of when visuallizing an autumn scene.', '2005-11-15 22:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
