(1870481, 255275, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo just for the beautiful simplicity captured in this. A single tree does stand all alone. But what adds visual interest is the divide of colors. The tree rests on the "side that is greener". It seems to look out upon the barren land beyond the green line that comprises of nothing more than the golden hues of a "wheatfield" (or perhaps it is just weeds) Either way it captures the imagery of a fertile land juxtapositioned next to a barren land. My only critique is that the colors of the landscape could be richer in hue - mayhap if this was taken in the late afternoon it would make the hues richer and bolder.</td>', 'I really like this photo just for the beautiful simplicity captured in this. A single tree does stand all alone. But what adds visual interest is the divide of colors. The tree rests on the "side that is greener". It seems to look out upon the barren land beyond the green line that comprises of nothing more than the golden hues of a "wheatfield" (or perhaps it is just weeds) Either way it captures the imagery of a fertile land juxtapositioned next to a barren land. My only critique is that the colors of the landscape could be richer in hue - mayhap if this was taken in the late afternoon it would make the hues richer and bolder.', '2005-11-15 22:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870486, 253991, 37111, '<td valign="top">looks like a painting</td>', 'looks like a painting', '2005-11-15 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
