(1870711, 255472, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a really high quality landscape in a ''portrait'' format.  This is a very fine composition; lovely lines &amp; proportions.  Beautiful colours and light ... spectacular but not strident.  Also some interesting textural contrasts.  All things considered, it''s an image that is so unpresumptuous at first glance that it might be easy to overlook just how effortless and harmonious it actually is.  I hope it isn''t overlooked in favour of more flashy models!    9.</td>', 'Nice to see a really high quality landscape in a ''portrait'' format.  This is a very fine composition; lovely lines & proportions.  Beautiful colours and light ... spectacular but not strident.  Also some interesting textural contrasts.  All things considered, it''s an image that is so unpresumptuous at first glance that it might be easy to overlook just how effortless and harmonious it actually is.  I hope it isn''t overlooked in favour of more flashy models!    9.', '2005-11-15 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
