(1870833, 255156, 19936, '<td valign="top">Congrats and well deserved blue!  Going into my favorites and took my top score.  Great first ribbon.</td>', 'Congrats and well deserved blue!  Going into my favorites and took my top score.  Great first ribbon.', '2005-11-16 00:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
