(1870841, 255156, 14620, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue! Wow, 2.5 minutes is one long exposure.  Never would''ve thunk it from the photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue! Wow, 2.5 minutes is one long exposure.  Never would''ve thunk it from the photo.  Well done!', '2005-11-16 00:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
