(1870889, 254165, 20214, '<td valign="top">I want to thank all of those fine people that were kind enough to comment on my photo, it''s much appreciated. Well, I did what I''ve been wanting to do for a long time, I beat my top three photos with this challenge. I guess that means I''m improving some! Again, thank you all very much for your comments.</td>', 'I want to thank all of those fine people that were kind enough to comment on my photo, it''s much appreciated. Well, I did what I''ve been wanting to do for a long time, I beat my top three photos with this challenge. I guess that means I''m improving some! Again, thank you all very much for your comments.', '2005-11-16 00:19:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1870895, 254955, 40718, '<td valign="top">I loved this shot Sammie.  I wondered if it was Sand Dunes National Park.  Sorry to sqeak out the yellow, but it looks like you''ve tasted ribbon a fair amount already...congrats again on the green.</td>', 'I loved this shot Sammie.  I wondered if it was Sand Dunes National Park.  Sorry to sqeak out the yellow, but it looks like you''ve tasted ribbon a fair amount already...congrats again on the green.', '2005-11-16 00:20:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1870896, 254955, 39429, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sammie.  I love your Sand Dunes pictures and this is no exception.  I couldn''t be happier for you.  WaaaHooo!<br/>Becky</td>', 'Congratulations Sammie.  I love your Sand Dunes pictures and this is no exception.  I couldn''t be happier for you.  WaaaHooo!Becky', '2005-11-16 00:21:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1870899, 255577, 17507, '<td valign="top">Contrary to what some have said, I think that the person in red totally makes the shot, especially given that part of the challenge was to make a landscape "refreshing." It''s refreshing to see a person in red actually fit meaningfully into a landscape shot. The sense of perspective is indeed awe-inspiring.</td>', 'Contrary to what some have said, I think that the person in red totally makes the shot, especially given that part of the challenge was to make a landscape "refreshing." It''s refreshing to see a person in red actually fit meaningfully into a landscape shot. The sense of perspective is indeed awe-inspiring.', '2005-11-16 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1870901, 254955, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot Sammie, congratulations on your 4th place finish!  Great work.</td>', 'Great shot Sammie, congratulations on your 4th place finish!  Great work.', '2005-11-16 00:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1870914, 255156, 8891, '<td valign="top">A sprawling epic of an image, Popescu! Many congrats on your Blue!</td>', 'A sprawling epic of an image, Popescu! Many congrats on your Blue!', '2005-11-16 00:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
