(1872434, 255505, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 finish - amazing colors.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 finish - amazing colors.', '2005-11-16 10:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872435, 255400, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 finish.  Breathtaking shot.</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 finish.  Breathtaking shot.', '2005-11-16 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872439, 255059, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 30 finish - I had this pegged for a ribbon.  Breathtaking scene.</td>', 'Congrats on top 30 finish - I had this pegged for a ribbon.  Breathtaking scene.', '2005-11-16 10:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872446, 254820, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot Jen!  Congrats on top 40 finish in a very tough field of competitors.  :-)</td>', 'Fantastic shot Jen!  Congrats on top 40 finish in a very tough field of competitors.  :-)', '2005-11-16 10:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872452, 255409, 36371, '<td valign="top">Photographers long for this shot! I am so jealous that you caught it. Early birds don''t always get to catch a "good worm", but you did!!  Way to go on your top 5!! (Should have been number 1, tho!)</td>', 'Photographers long for this shot! I am so jealous that you caught it. Early birds don''t always get to catch a "good worm", but you did!!  Way to go on your top 5!! (Should have been number 1, tho!)', '2005-11-16 10:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872478, 253836, 32754, '<td valign="top">Paul, I guess it wasn''t that bad was it..you made top 30!  congratulations...but you know me: how did it look in b&amp;w? I like the shadows and the pinball effect of the trees and diagonals of the hills..the area where you live is lovely.</td>', 'Paul, I guess it wasn''t that bad was it..you made top 30!  congratulations...but you know me: how did it look in b&w? I like the shadows and the pinball effect of the trees and diagonals of the hills..the area where you live is lovely.', '2005-11-16 10:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872483, 255156, 42456, '<td valign="top">Lookout Ursula...I think you got some serious competition here!!! I''m from Montana and I''m not sure where this was taken, but it sure made me Homesick...very emotive to me...Kudos!</td>', 'Lookout Ursula...I think you got some serious competition here!!! I''m from Montana and I''m not sure where this was taken, but it sure made me Homesick...very emotive to me...Kudos!', '2005-11-16 10:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872541, 254570, 47440, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your kind comments! I''m new to digital photography and don''t know how to play with the photos, so all I knew how to do was increase the saturation a little bit to make the colors a little brighter. <br/> <br/>For those who are interested, I went to Kykuit, the Rockefeller Mansion, in Sleepy Hollow, which is open to tours from late June-early November. They have a beautiful garden overlooking the Hudson. <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, as misterjosh mentioned, it was a very hazy day, and I was unable to get any good shots of the Hudson. =(  oh well. I''ll try all your recommendations next time I''m out on a hazy day! Thanks again!!! Hopefully I''ll be able to take more pics and keep submitting them so that I can become SOMEwhere near all of you!!!  =)</td>', 'Thank you for your kind comments! I''m new to digital photography and don''t know how to play with the photos, so all I knew how to do was increase the saturation a little bit to make the colors a little brighter.  For those who are interested, I went to Kykuit, the Rockefeller Mansion, in Sleepy Hollow, which is open to tours from late June-early November. They have a beautiful garden overlooking the Hudson.  Unfortunately, as misterjosh mentioned, it was a very hazy day, and I was unable to get any good shots of the Hudson. =(  oh well. I''ll try all your recommendations next time I''m out on a hazy day! Thanks again!!! Hopefully I''ll be able to take more pics and keep submitting them so that I can become SOMEwhere near all of you!!!  =)', '2005-11-16 10:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872576, 254704, 4610, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for your comments, the blue haze over the mountains is the famous chromatic aberration known to ocurr in the Canon powershot "A" series cameras, You need certain conditions for it to be this noticeable, and I seem to have found those conditions in this photo, also the noise in the sky a problem that could not be fixed with the despeckle filter, maybe this is why the moon seems so blurry, but since there is no spot editing in DPChallenge... well, I guess I found the limitations of my camera with this night shot.</td>', 'Thanks everybody for your comments, the blue haze over the mountains is the famous chromatic aberration known to ocurr in the Canon powershot "A" series cameras, You need certain conditions for it to be this noticeable, and I seem to have found those conditions in this photo, also the noise in the sky a problem that could not be fixed with the despeckle filter, maybe this is why the moon seems so blurry, but since there is no spot editing in DPChallenge... well, I guess I found the limitations of my camera with this night shot.', '2005-11-16 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872588, 255156, 4482, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!! Go team NIkon! ;-)</td>', 'Excellent shot!! Go team NIkon! ;-)', '2005-11-16 11:02:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872589, 254593, 36382, '<td valign="top">I''m shocked.  You must have been penalised cos of all the sky.  It''s a fantastic picture.</td>', 'I''m shocked.  You must have been penalised cos of all the sky.  It''s a fantastic picture.', '2005-11-16 11:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872673, 255400, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great use of raking light.  Congratulations on the top 10 finish!  (And with the kit lens!)</td>', 'Great use of raking light.  Congratulations on the top 10 finish!  (And with the kit lens!)', '2005-11-16 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872748, 255109, 33379, '<td valign="top">congrats on your finish! it''s nice to see what my camera can do with the right photographer.</td>', 'congrats on your finish! it''s nice to see what my camera can do with the right photographer.', '2005-11-16 11:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872769, 255156, 20075, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well deserved blue ribbon!  This is so gorgeous.</td>', 'Congrats on a well deserved blue ribbon!  This is so gorgeous.', '2005-11-16 11:41:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872776, 254939, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think this may be another candidate for B&amp;W.  There are two large swaths of single colors, the brown/yellow of the field and the pale blue of the sky.  Neither is particularly eye-grabbing in hue.  So you can either "cheat" and really try to boost it with saturation, or switch to B&amp;W where texture becomes more important.  The field might have promise as texture and the clouds probably would too with the sunbeams.<br/> <br/>Your "penny sized" aperture was too big. ;)  There is a loss of detail in the foreground which would have added to the texture of the field.<br/> <br/>This isn''t your fault, but I''ve also noticed November trees are hard to make look good.  The deciduous trees have lost their leaves and evergreens are very, very hard to keep from turning into a green/black mess. I haven''t solved this nut yet myself...<br/> <br/>I gave it a 5.</td>', 'I think this may be another candidate for B&W.  There are two large swaths of single colors, the brown/yellow of the field and the pale blue of the sky.  Neither is particularly eye-grabbing in hue.  So you can either "cheat" and really try to boost it with saturation, or switch to B&W where texture becomes more important.  The field might have promise as texture and the clouds probably would too with the sunbeams. Your "penny sized" aperture was too big. ;)  There is a loss of detail in the foreground which would have added to the texture of the field. This isn''t your fault, but I''ve also noticed November trees are hard to make look good.  The deciduous trees have lost their leaves and evergreens are very, very hard to keep from turning into a green/black mess. I haven''t solved this nut yet myself... I gave it a 5.', '2005-11-16 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872808, 253891, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot, congratulations on your placement, but sadly, it should have been higher!  But into my favs!</td>', 'Wow! Great shot, congratulations on your placement, but sadly, it should have been higher!  But into my favs!', '2005-11-16 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872814, 255400, 19672, '<td valign="top">I regret not really having gotten to go to the imperial desert when I was a child growing up in San Diego.<br/> <br/>(we were poor, and well most of my time out there we only had a moped for a car - so it''s kinda hard to take a family trip out. though I did do some camping out in the desert with my father a few times)<br/> <br/>Great shot BTW</td>', 'I regret not really having gotten to go to the imperial desert when I was a child growing up in San Diego. (we were poor, and well most of my time out there we only had a moped for a car - so it''s kinda hard to take a family trip out. though I did do some camping out in the desert with my father a few times) Great shot BTW', '2005-11-16 11:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1872820, 253300, 19672, '<td valign="top">I envy you....<br/> <br/>I so want to see the northern lights..</td>', 'I envy you.... I so want to see the northern lights..', '2005-11-16 11:52:41.000000', NULL, 0),
