(1872895, 253803, 40819, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by metcalfe:</b></div><hr/><i> burnt corner!<br/>taking that off, it''s a great shot :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree, if I had been able to do spot editing it would not have been there. I did not want to crop out anything because I just loved the entire picture. Thanks for the comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by metcalfe: burnt corner!taking that off, it''s a great shot :D   I agree, if I had been able to do spot editing it would not have been there. I did not want to crop out anything because I just loved the entire picture. Thanks for the comment.', '2005-11-16 12:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
