(1874083, 255156, 12328, '<td valign="top">Wow... Amazing. This picture is absolutely breathtaking. <br/>The lighting is soft and mystical-- looks like a dream. At a glance this picture is great, yet there are many finer details to captivate the viewer for longer. Ribbon most definitely deserved, congrats :)</td>', 'Wow... Amazing. This picture is absolutely breathtaking. The lighting is soft and mystical-- looks like a dream. At a glance this picture is great, yet there are many finer details to captivate the viewer for longer. Ribbon most definitely deserved, congrats :)', '2005-11-16 16:43:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1874131, 255476, 42821, '<td valign="top">This was shot in a hurry from the car window.  I should have come back and set up a tripod.  That would have taken care of the camera shake,  and allowed me to use a higher f-stop. I appreciate everyone that took the time to comment.</td>', 'This was shot in a hurry from the car window.  I should have come back and set up a tripod.  That would have taken care of the camera shake,  and allowed me to use a higher f-stop. I appreciate everyone that took the time to comment.', '2005-11-16 16:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
