(1874547, 255109, 45627, '<td valign="top">Yes, I could have brightened it up a bit but I think it would have lost the muted colors created by a fading sun in late afternoon. I have to remember to look at the camera settings frequently as it was somehow set to "Auto ISO" accidentally. (big fingers)<br/>Thanks to all those who voted and for the helpful comments.<br/>Bob</td>', 'Yes, I could have brightened it up a bit but I think it would have lost the muted colors created by a fading sun in late afternoon. I have to remember to look at the camera settings frequently as it was somehow set to "Auto ISO" accidentally. (big fingers)Thanks to all those who voted and for the helpful comments.Bob', '2005-11-16 18:53:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1874784, 254955, 26936, '<td valign="top">My husband and I both love this photo, I have it on my desktop right now.  Hope that''s OK. It''s quite fabulous, congratulations! Brenda</td>', 'My husband and I both love this photo, I have it on my desktop right now.  Hope that''s OK. It''s quite fabulous, congratulations! Brenda', '2005-11-16 19:55:58.000000', NULL, 0),
