(1876830, 255524, 16950, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... I turned the brightness ALL the way up on my monitor and played with my Gamma settings, and now if I look closely, I can see some hint of the Pleiades and the costellation Taurus.  Many people must have much better monitors than me, as I can still barely see anything other than a black rectangle with a few light smudges.  One of the hazards of online voting I guess!</td>', 'Hmmmm... I turned the brightness ALL the way up on my monitor and played with my Gamma settings, and now if I look closely, I can see some hint of the Pleiades and the costellation Taurus.  Many people must have much better monitors than me, as I can still barely see anything other than a black rectangle with a few light smudges.  One of the hazards of online voting I guess!', '2005-11-17 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 0),
