(1878888, 254965, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Very nice capture of a fall landscape, very appropriate for the category.  I think this was a harder challenge to stand out in, unless you had something a little unusual.  The photo itself is very nice. I like the composition and how there really aren''t any empty spots.  Also I find the reflection in the water to be nice and inviting.  I would have played with adjusting the contrast just to bring out the leaves some more.  I really like the soft flow, and glow from the top of fence possibly from the sunlight.  Personally I did vote higher then you scored.  I felt this shot stood out above many of the other landscape. Good shot. I can see this shot on a card or calendar.</td>', '*Critique Club* Very nice capture of a fall landscape, very appropriate for the category.  I think this was a harder challenge to stand out in, unless you had something a little unusual.  The photo itself is very nice. I like the composition and how there really aren''t any empty spots.  Also I find the reflection in the water to be nice and inviting.  I would have played with adjusting the contrast just to bring out the leaves some more.  I really like the soft flow, and glow from the top of fence possibly from the sunlight.  Personally I did vote higher then you scored.  I felt this shot stood out above many of the other landscape. Good shot. I can see this shot on a card or calendar.', '2005-11-17 23:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1878951, 255156, 47325, '<td valign="top">The purplish color of the photograph gives it a very intensive magical look which I loved since the first instant I looked at the picture. Beautiful, just beautiful. Congratultions!!!</td>', 'The purplish color of the photograph gives it a very intensive magical look which I loved since the first instant I looked at the picture. Beautiful, just beautiful. Congratultions!!!', '2005-11-17 23:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
