(1889729, 255412, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I''m curious, why in black and white gallery?  It does have a somewhat monotone feel but still colorful too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great picture.  I''m curious, why in black and white gallery?  It does have a somewhat monotone feel but still colorful too.  Nice job.', '2005-11-22 15:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1889888, 255162, 19590, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  It was an overcast day.  This is the easiest view of this falls and most of the pics I take are down at the bottom level after climbing down into the ravine.  This angle captures the fall colors better.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  It was an overcast day.  This is the easiest view of this falls and most of the pics I take are down at the bottom level after climbing down into the ravine.  This angle captures the fall colors better.', '2005-11-22 16:09:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1890264, 255269, 39112, '<td valign="top">Hi lovely colours in the sky. However the land here adds little. Either more looking for effective shadow or just a plain sky shot would I think have been better .</td>', 'Hi lovely colours in the sky. However the land here adds little. Either more looking for effective shadow or just a plain sky shot would I think have been better .', '2005-11-22 19:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
