(1919725, 254965, 34659, '<td valign="top">This was one tough challenge (96th place with a 5.837?!)!  Great shot, no doubt.  Very nice natural tones - I might have punched them up a hair (as I have a tendency to overdo that sort of thing - lol).  The composition is perfect!  Beautiful reflection - the yellow leaves are exquisite.  Great job.</td>', 'This was one tough challenge (96th place with a 5.837?!)!  Great shot, no doubt.  Very nice natural tones - I might have punched them up a hair (as I have a tendency to overdo that sort of thing - lol).  The composition is perfect!  Beautiful reflection - the yellow leaves are exquisite.  Great job.', '2005-12-03 20:56:30.000000', NULL, 0),
